of Ooty products.','<p>Indulge in the rich and decadent Mix Nuts Milk Homemade Chocolates, made with love and care in Ooty, India. Our homemade chocolates are crafted with only the finest ingredients, including high quality mix nuts sourced from the lush Nilgiris.</p>','[{\"label\":\"Available weights\",\"value\":\"100g, 250g, 500g\"},{\"label\":\"Category\",\"value\":\"Homemade Chocolates\"},{\"label\":\"Packed & shipped from\",\"value\":\"Ooty, The Nilgiris\"},{\"label\":\"Price\",\"value\":\"Inclusive of GST\"}]',NULL,160.00,190.00,120,1,0,0,0,'2026-11-10 10:16:05','2026-11-10 10:16:05'),(19,3,NULL,'Roasted Cashew Dark Chocolates','roasted-cashew-dark-chocolates',NULL,'Our Ooty products have always been known for their exceptional quality and taste, and these Roasted Cashew Dark Chocolates are no exception. With every bite, you will experience the perfect balance of bitterness and sweetness, making these chocolates truly delicious.Treat yourself or your loved ones to these mouth-watering Nilgiris chocolates today','<p>Indulge in the rich and velvety Roasted Cashew Dark Chocolates, a heavenly treat for all chocolate lovers. Made with high-quality mix nuts and scrumptious dark chocolate, these chocolates are homemade and sourced from the picturesque hill station of Ooty.</p>','[{\"label\":\"Available weights\",\"value\":\"100g, 250g, 500g\"},{\"label\":\"Category\",\"value\":\"Homemade Chocolates\"},{\"label\":\"Packed & shipped from\",\"value\":\"Ooty, The Nilgiris\"},{\"label\":\"Price\",\"value\":\"Inclusive of GST\"}]',NULL,160.00,190.00,120,1,0,0,0,'2026-11-10 10:16:05','2026-11-10 10:16:05'),(20,3,NULL,'Roasted Almonds Dark Chocolates','roasted-almonds-dark-chocolates',NULL,'Our Ooty products have always been known for their exceptional quality and taste, and these Roasted Cashew Dark Chocolates are no exception. With every bite, you will experience the perfect balance of bitterness and sweetness, making these chocolates truly delicious.Treat yourself or your loved ones to these mouth-watering Nilgiris chocolates today','<p>Indulge in the rich and creamy taste of our Roasted Almonds Dark Chocolates, made with the finest quality mix nuts sourced from the hills of Ooty. These homemade chocolates are crafted with care and expertise to deliver a heavenly taste experience</p>','[{\"label\":\"Available weights\",\"value\":\"100g, 250g, 500g\"},{\"label\":\"Category\",\"value\":\"Homemade Chocolates\"},{\"label\":\"Packed & shipped from\",\"value\":\"Ooty, The Nilgiris\"},{\"label\":\"Price\",\"value\":\"Inclusive of GST\"}]',NULL,160.00,190.00,120,1,0,0,0,'2026-11-10 10:16:05','2026-11-10 10:16:05'),(21,3,NULL,'Sugar Free Dark Homemade Chocolates','sugar-free-dark-homemade-chocolates',NULL,'These homemade chocolates are a perfect blend of health and taste, as they are free from sugar and preservatives. Made from the finest cocoa beans sourced from the Nilgiris, these','<p>Indulge in the goodness of Sugar Free Dark Homemade Chocolates made with high quality mix nuts, exclusively handcrafted by expert chocolatiers of Ooty.</p>','[{\"label\":\"Available weights\",\"value\":\"100g, 250g, 500g\"},{\"label\":\"Category\",\"value\":\"Homemade Chocolates\"},{\"label\":\"Packed & shipped from\",\"value\":\"Ooty, The Nilgiris\"},{\"label\":\"Price\",\"value\":\"Inclusive of GST\"}]',NULL,350.00,390.00,120,1,0,0,0,'2026-11-10 10:16:05','2026-11-10 10:16:05'),(22,7,NULL,'Nilgiri Forest Honey Wild Bitter','nilgiri-forest-honey-wild-bitter',NULL,'This bitter honey is 100% raw and unheated, packed with bee pollen, propolis, royal jelly, enzymes, yeast, vitamins, minerals and amino acids, making it a powerful antioxidant. Enjoy the benefits of this natural sweetener, straight from the forest to your home INFORMATION This honey may naturally crystallise, if so, stand jar in a bowl of warm water until it becomes clear again.','Experience the untamed essence of the Blue Mountains with Nilgiri Forest Honey Wild Bitter. This is not your average supermarket honey; it is a pure, raw, and unprocessed nectar, meticulously and sustainably harvested by indigenous communities deep within the protected Nilgiri Biosphere Reserve. Known locally as “Kattu Then,” this wild forest honey is a potent liquid gold that bridges the gap between gourmet flavor and ancient healing.\n<h2>The Power of Nilgiri Forest Wild Bitter Honey: Nature’s Rare Harvest</h2>\nWhat sets our Wild Bitter Honey apart is its complex, sophisticated flavor profile. Unlike the sugary sweetness of clover or wildflower honey, this variety offers a bold, tangy, and characteristically bitter finish. This unique taste is derived from the nectar of medicinal forest flora, specifically the Jamun (Indian Blackberry) and native Wild Neem blossoms. These plants infuse the honey with bioactive compounds, making it a staple in traditional wellness for those seeking natural immunity boosters and digestible superfoods.\n<h2>Authentic Nilgiri Sourcing &amp; Tribal Heritage</h2>\nAt Ooty Originals, we pride ourselves on delivering authentic Ooty products that honor the land. Our honey is collected from the massive combs of the Giant Rock Bee (Apis dorsata), found on high-altitude cliffs and towering jungle trees.\nThe harvesting process is a sacred tradition performed by the Irula and Kurumba tribes. These indigenous experts use smoke and traditional climbing techniques to gather the honey without harming the bee colonies. By choosing this product, you are supporting ethical sourcing and the livelihoods of tribal communities, ensuring that the biodiversity of the Nilgiris remains protected for generations to come.\n<h2>Pure, Raw, and Unprocessed: Straight from Hive to Jar</h2>\nModern honey processing often involves high-heat pasteurization and micro-filtration, which strips away the “living” elements of the honey. We do things differently. Our Nilgiri Forest Honey remains:\n<ul>\n<li>Unheated &amp; Raw: Retaining all naturally occurring enzymes, antioxidants, and vitamins.</li>\n<li>Rich in Bee Pollen: We use a simple single-filter method that allows microscopic bee pollen and propolis to remain in the jar, providing maximum nutritional value.</li>\n<li>100% Natural: Free from added sugars, preservatives, or artificial flavors.</li>\n</ul>\n<em>Note: Because this is real raw honey, it may naturally crystallize. This is a hallmark of purity and high pollen content.</em>\n<h2>Medicinal Benefits &amp; Wellness Uses</h2>\nRenowned for its therapeutic properties, Wild Bitter Honey is often sought after for its health-giving benefits:\n<ul>\n<li>Antioxidant Powerhouse: Helps fight oxidative stress and supports cellular health.</li>\n<li>Blood Sugar Management: Traditionally used in smaller quantities as a more stable alternative to refined sugars.</li>\n<li>Respiratory Support: A classic remedy for soothing sore throats and seasonal coughs.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>How to Use This Gourmet Forest Honey</h2>\nTo fully appreciate the nuanced flavor of the Nilgiris, we recommend:\n<ol>\n<li>A Morning Tonic: Mix one teaspoon with lukewarm water and lemon to detoxify your system.</li>\n<li>Gourmet Pairings: Use it as a glaze for roasted vegetables or a bold drizzle over artisanal cheeses.</li>\n<li>Sugar Alternative: Add a complex depth to your Nilgiri Teas or coffee.</li>\n</ol>\n<h2>Order Authentic Ooty Honey Online</h2>\nDon’t settle for processed alternatives. Bring home the most authentic Nilgiri forest products directly from the source. Whether you are looking for a unique gift or a daily health supplement, our Wild Bitter Honey offers a taste of the wild that is as pure as the mountains themselves.','[{\"label\":\"Available weights\",\"value\":\"200g, 500g\"},{\"label\":\"Category\",\"value\":\"Honey\"},{\"label\":\"Packed & shipped from\",\"value\":\"Ooty, The Nilgiris\"},{\"label\":\"Price\",\"value\":\"Inclusive of GST\"}]',NULL,295.00,320.00,0,1,0,0,0,'2026-11-10 10:16:05','2026-11-10 10:16:05'),(23,7,NULL,'Nilgiri Forest Honey Sweet','nilgiri-forest-honey-sweet',NULL,'This honey may naturally crystallise, if so, stand jar in a bowl of warm water until it becomes clear again.','<p>Raw unprocessed wild forest honey from the Nilgiri hills, sustainably harvest by the indigenous communities in the reserve areas. 100% raw and unheated, raw honey is full of bee pollen, propolis, royal jellly, enzymes, yeast, vitamins, minerals and amino acids, which contribute higher antioxidant level than normal honey.</p>','[{\"label\":\"Available weights\",\"value\":\"200g, 500g\"},{\"label\":\"Category\",\"value\":\"Honey\"},{\"label\":\"Packed & shipped from\",\"value\":\"Ooty, The Nilgiris\"},{\"label\":\"Price\",\"value\":\"Inclusive of GST\"}]',NULL,295.00,325.00,79,1,0,0,0,'2026-11-10 10:16:05','2026-11-16 10:22:41'),(24,6,NULL,'Pineapple Fruit Jam','pineapple-fruit-jam',NULL,'Sourced from the lush Nilgiri hills, our pineapple jam is free from preservatives and artificial additives. Spread it generously on toast, pancakes, or use it as a topping for your yogurt or oatmeal bowl. Taste the goodness of nilgiri jams with our Pineapple Fruit Jam.','<p>Indulge in the sweet and tangy flavor of Nilgiri Pineapple Jam, made from fresh and authentic pineapples. Our jams are carefully crafted to preserve the natural goodness of the fruit, making it a healthy addition to your breakfast or snack.</p>','[{\"label\":\"Available weights\",\"value\":\"300g, 500g\"},{\"label\":\"Category\",\"value\":\"Nilgiri Jams\"},{\"label\":\"Packed & shipped from\",\"value\":\"Ooty, The Nilgiris\"},{\"label\":\"Price\",\"value\":\"Inclusive of GST\"}]',NULL,320.00,350.00,40,1,0,0,0,'2026-11-10 10:16:05','2026-11-10 10:16:05'),(25,6,NULL,'Pear Jam','pear-jam',NULL,'Our Pear Jam is made with high-quality pears that are carefully selected for their sweetness and juiciness, giving you a rich and flavorful taste experience. This jam is perfect for anyone who wants to enjoy a delicious and healthy snack without compromising on taste or quality. S