to add more nutrients to their diet. Dried anjeer is an excellent source of minerals like calcium, copper, potassium, manganese, iron, selenium and zinc. These minerals are essential for maintaining good health and preventing various diseases.</p>','[{\"label\":\"Available weights\",\"value\":\"250g, 500g\"},{\"label\":\"Category\",\"value\":\"Dried Fruits\"},{\"label\":\"Packed & shipped from\",\"value\":\"Ooty, The Nilgiris\"},{\"label\":\"Price\",\"value\":\"Inclusive of GST\"}]',NULL,410.00,480.00,80,1,0,0,0,'2026-11-10 10:16:05','2026-11-10 10:16:05'),(33,10,NULL,'Dried Blueberries 200g','dried-blueberries-200g',NULL,'Additionally, these dried blueberries are useful in regulating blood sugar levels, making them an ideal snack choice for those with diabetes. With 200g of nourishing goodness, these Dried Blueberries are a must-have for any health-conscious individual.','<p>Our Dried Blueberries are a healthy and delicious snack option, packed with antioxidants that are great for your overall health. These blueberries can help to strengthen your immune system, and they are low in calories, making them a perfect choice for those looking to manage their weight.</p>','[{\"label\":\"Net quantity\",\"value\":\"200g\"},{\"label\":\"Category\",\"value\":\"Dried Fruits\"},{\"label\":\"Packed & shipped from\",\"value\":\"Ooty, The Nilgiris\"},{\"label\":\"Price\",\"value\":\"Inclusive of GST\"}]',NULL,480.00,580.00,40,1,0,0,0,'2026-11-10 10:16:05','2026-11-10 10:16:05'),(34,10,NULL,'Dried Cranberries','dried-cranberries',NULL,'Our Dried Cranberry 200g is the perfect addition to your healthy snacking routine. Made from real cranberries, these dried fruits have been dehydrated to lock in their natural sweet and tart flavors. Packed with super-rich Vitamin C, these cranberries are a great way to boost your immune system and maintain a healthy body weight as they are low in calories. Additionally, they are packed with essential minerals that your body needs. Try adding them to your yogurt, salads, or baked goods for a delicious and nutritious snack.','<p>Our Dried Cranberry 200g is the perfect addition to your healthy snacking routine. Made from real cranberries, these dried fruits have been dehydrated to lock in their natural sweet and tart flavors. Packed with super-rich Vitamin C, these cranberries are a great way to boost your immune system and maintain a healthy body weight as they are low in calories.</p>','[{\"label\":\"Available weights\",\"value\":\"200g\"},{\"label\":\"Category\",\"value\":\"Dried Fruits\"},{\"label\":\"Packed & shipped from\",\"value\":\"Ooty, The Nilgiris\"},{\"label\":\"Price\",\"value\":\"Inclusive of GST\"}]',NULL,430.00,490.00,40,1,0,0,0,'2026-11-10 10:16:05','2026-11-10 10:16:05'),(35,10,NULL,'Dried Kiwi','dried-kiwi',NULL,'Our 200g pack of Dried Kiwi is the perfect quick snack for those on-the-go. Not only is it a tasty treat, but it’s also a natural and 100% healthy option. These dried kiwis are rich in fiber and potassium content, making it a great addition to any diet. They also boost your immune system and provide a source of iron and calcium intake. Enjoy the sweet and tangy taste of kiwi fruit anytime, anywhere with our Dried Kiwi pack.','<p>Our 200g pack of Dried Kiwi is the perfect quick snack for those on-the-go. Not only is it a tasty treat, but it’s also a natural and 100% healthy option. These dried kiwis are rich in fiber and potassium content, making it a great addition to any diet. They also boost your immune system and provide a source of iron and calcium intake. Enjoy the sweet and tangy taste of kiwi fruit anytime, anywhere with our Dried Kiwi pack.</p>','[{\"label\":\"Available weights\",\"value\":\"200g\"},{\"label\":\"Category\",\"value\":\"Dried Fruits\"},{\"label\":\"Packed & shipped from\",\"value\":\"Ooty, The Nilgiris\"},{\"label\":\"Price\",\"value\":\"Inclusive of GST\"}]',NULL,175.00,200.00,40,1,0,0,0,'2026-11-10 10:16:05','2026-11-10 10:16:05'),(36,8,NULL,'Cinnamon 100g','cinnamon-100g',NULL,'Our Cinnamon is sourced from the beautiful Nilgiri mountains of India, known for producing some of the highest quality spices. This aromatic spice is actually Cassia, a type of cinnamon that has a slightly stronger flavor than its Sri Lankan counterpart. In addition to adding a delicious taste to your dishes, Cinnamon has many health benefits such as regulating blood sugar levels and reducing inflammation. For those who prefer the sweeter and milder taste of Sri Lankan Cinnamon, we also offer that option in our Nilgiri products lineup. Add this versatile spice to your pantry today1','<p>Our Cinnamon is sourced from the beautiful Nilgiri mountains of India, known for producing some of the highest quality spices. This aromatic spice is actually Cassia, a type of cinnamon that has a slightly stronger flavor than its Sri Lankan counterpart. In addition to adding a delicious taste to your dishes, Cinnamon has many health benefits such as regulating blood sugar levels and reducing inflammation.</p>','[{\"label\":\"Net quantity\",\"value\":\"100g\"},{\"label\":\"Category\",\"value\":\"Spices\"},{\"label\":\"Packed & shipped from\",\"value\":\"Ooty, The Nilgiris\"},{\"label\":\"Price\",\"value\":\"Inclusive of GST\"}]',NULL,140.00,180.00,40,1,0,0,0,'2026-11-10 10:16:05','2026-11-10 10:16:05'),(37,8,NULL,'Premium Green Cardamom (Nilgiri Sourced) – 100g','premium-green-cardamom-nilgiri-sourced-100g',NULL,'Discover the superior aroma of hand-picked 8mm Bold Green Cardamom from the pristine slopes of the Nilgiris. Naturally dried and packed at the source in Ooty, these high-essential-oil pods are perfect for gourmet cooking, traditional tea, and Ayurvedic wellness. 100% natural, farm-fresh, and delivered straight from the Blue Mountains to your doorstep.','<p>Experience the “Queen of Spices” in her purest form. Sourced directly from the mist-covered plantations of the <b>Nilgiris</b>, our cardamom brings the authentic essence of the Blue Mountains to your kitchen.</p>\n<h3><b>Pure Nilgiri Green Cardamom: The Aromatic Treasure of Ooty</b></h3>\n<p>When it comes to <b>premium quality green cardamom</b>, the high-altitude climate of the Nilgiris creates a profile that is world-renowned. Unlike mass-produced spices, <b>Ooty Originals</b> cardamom is grown at over 6,000 feet, where the cool temperatures and mineral-rich soil concentrate the essential oils within every pod. This results in an <b>intense aroma</b> and a bold, sweet-spicy flavor that is unmistakable.</p>\n<p>Our <b>8mm bold green cardamom</b> pods are hand-picked and sun-dried to preserve their vibrant color and nutritional integrity. Whether you are brewing a pot of <b>authentic Masala Chai</b>, flavoring a decadent biryani, or looking for the <b>best cardamom for baking</b>, our pods deliver a punch of freshness that store-bought alternatives simply cannot match.</p>\n<p><b>Why Choose Ooty Originals Cardamom?</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><b>Chemical-Free:</b> We prioritize sustainable farming practices that protect the Western Ghats’ biodiversity.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><b>Rich in Health Benefits:</b> Known for its <b>antioxidant properties</b>, Nilgiri cardamom aids digestion, freshens breath naturally, and supports respiratory health.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><b>Farm-to-Table Traceability:</b> Every pack is sourced directly from local Ooty farmers, ensuring you receive the <b>freshest spices online in India</b>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Elevate your culinary creations with the spice that defined the ancient trade routes. <b>Buy Nilgiri cardamom online</b> today and taste the difference of high-altitude harvesting.</p>','[{\"label\":\"Net quantity\",\"value\":\"100g\"},{\"label\":\"Category\",\"value\":\"Spices\"},{\"label\":\"Packed & shipped from\",\"value\":\"Ooty, The Nilgiris\"},{\"label\":\"Price\",\"value\":\"Inclusive of GST\"}]',NULL,610.00,695.00,40,1,0,0,0,'2026-11-10 10:16:05','2026-11-10 10:16:05'),(38,8,NULL,'Premium Nilgiri Black Pepper','premium-nilgiri-black-pepper',NULL,'Ooty Originals Bold Nilgiri Black Pepper (Whole Peppercorns) Upgrade your spice rack with premium whole black pepper sourced from the mist-soaked plantations of the Nilgiris. These high-piperine peppercorns offer a superior sharp bite and rich woody aroma. Perfect for spice grinders, gourmet recipes, and Ayurvedic wellness. 100% natural, hand-picked, and delivered fresh from the heart of Ooty.','<p>Harness the legendary “King of Spices” from the high-altitude estates of the Blue Mountains. Sourced for <b>Ooty Originals</b>, our black pepper is a testament to the rich, volcanic soil and cool mist of the <b>Nilgiris</b>, delivering a bold heat that mass-market varieties can’t replicate.</p>\n<h3><b>Premium Nilgiri Black Pepper: The Bold Gold of Ooty</b></h3>\n<p>For centuries, <b>pure black pepper</b> has been the world’s most coveted spice, and our Nilgiri harvest reminds you why. Grown at elevations exceeding 6,000 feet, <b>Ooty Originals Black Pepper</b> develops a higher concentration of <b>piperine</b>—the active compound responsible for its signature sharp bite and therapeutic properties.</p>\n<p>Our <b>whole black peppercorns</b> are hand-harvested and sun-dried to perfection, ensuring they retain their deep, dark color and complex flavor profile. When you <b>buy black pepper online</b> from us, you aren’t just getting a seasoning; you’re getting a spice with earthy, woody undertones and a clean, citrusy finish. It is the <b>best black pepper for cooking</b> gourmet steaks, seasoning traditional South Indian curries, or freshly grinding over a morning omelet.</p>\n<p><b>Why Ooty Originals Black Pepper Stands Out:</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><b>Superior Potency:</b> High-altitude farming results in a more <b>intense aroma</b> and a sharper “kick.”</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><b>Weight Loss &amp; Digestion:</b> Rich in antioxidants, our pepper is a favorite for those looking for <b>natural metabolism boosters</b> and digestive aids.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><b>100% Natural &amp; Traceable:</b> We offer <b>pesticide-free spices</b> sourced directly from local Ooty farmers, ensuring farm-to-table freshness.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Stop settling for dusty, pre-ground powders. <b>Buy Nilgiri black pepper</b> today and experience the “Black Gold” of the hills in its most potent, whole-grain form.</p>','[{\"label\":\"Available weights\",\"value\":\"100g, 250g, 500g\"},{\"label\":\"Category\",\"value\":\"Spices\"},{\"label\":\"Packed & shipped from\",\"value\":\"Ooty, The Nilgiris\"},{\"label\":\"Price\",\"value\":\"Inclusive of GST\"}]',NULL,130.00,165.00,120,1,0,0,0,'2026-11-10 10:16:05','2026-11-10 10:16:05'),(39,8,NULL,'Cloves Premium','cloves-premium',NULL,'Our Clove is the perfect addition to any spice collection. Our authentic cloves are hand-selected from the finest sources to ensure the highest quality product. Cloves have been used for centuries for their numerous health benefits, including aiding in digestion and reducing inflammation. Add our Clove to your dishes for a flavorful and healthy boost.','<p>Our Clove is the perfect addition to any spice collection. Our authentic cloves are hand-selected from the finest sources to ensure the highest quality product. Cloves have been used for centuries for their numerous health benefits, including aiding in digestion and reducing inflammation. Add our Clove to your dishes for a flavorful and healthy boost.</p>','[{\"label\":\"Available weights\",\"value\":\"100g, 250g, 500g\"},{\"label\":\"Category\",\"value\":\"Spices\"},{\"label\":\"Packed & shipped from\",\"value\":\"Ooty, The Nilgiris\"},{\"label\":\"Price\",\"value\":\"Inclusive of GST\"}]',NULL,280.00,310.00,120,1,0,0,0,'2026-11-10 10:16:05','2026-11-10 10:16:05'),(40,5,12,'Apricot Oil','apricot-oil',NULL,'Pure Apricot Kernel Oil from Ooty Originals — 10ml. A light, skin-compatible carrier oil for moisturising, anti-ageing, massage, and hair care. Perfect for sensitive skin and as a makeup remover. Shop at ootyoriginals.in.','<h4>About This Product</h4>\n<p>Ooty Originals Apricot Oil is cold-pressed from apricot kernels — a light, fast-absorbing carrier oil with exceptional moisturising, anti-inflammatory, and skin-softening properties.</p>\n<p>At Ooty Originals, we bring you the richness of nature with our premium apricot oil, sourced from the pristine hills of the Nilgiris. Carefully extracted from high-quality apricot kernels, our oil—also known as apricot seed oil, apricot kernel oil, and apricot kernel seed oil—is a natural treasure packed with essential nutrients. Known for its lightweight texture and deep nourishing properties, this oil has been trusted for generations as a versatile solution for both hair and skin care.</p>\n<p>Our apricot pit oil is cold-pressed to retain its natural vitamins and antioxidants, especially Vitamin A and E, which are essential for healthy skin and hair. At Ooty Originals, we focus on purity and authenticity, ensuring that every drop of our apricot oil is free from harmful chemicals and additives. This commitment makes our product an ideal choice for those seeking natural and effective personal care solutions.</p>\n<p>When it comes to hair care, our apricot oil for hair works wonders in restoring moisture, improving scalp health, and enhancing shine. It penetrates deeply into the hair follicles, helping to reduce dryness, frizz, and breakage. Regular use can strengthen your hair from root to tip, making it softer, smoother, and more manageable. Whether used as a massage oil or as part of your hair care routine, apricot kernel oil provides gentle yet powerful nourishment.</p>\n<p>In skincare, apricot seed oil is known for its ability to hydrate and rejuvenate the skin without leaving a greasy residue. Its lightweight nature makes it suitable for all skin types, including sensitive skin. It helps improve skin elasticity, reduce fine lines, and promote a natural glow. Many customers prefer apricot kernel seed oil as a daily moisturizer because it absorbs quickly and supports healthy, radiant skin.</p>\n<p>If you are looking to buy apricot oil, Ooty Originals offers you a trusted and convenient solution. Our platform makes it easy to buy apricot kernel oil directly from a reliable source that values quality and authenticity. With increasing demand for natural products, many people choose to apricot oil buy online for ease and accessibility, and we ensure a smooth and secure shopping experience.</p>\n<p>For those searching for genuine products, Ooty Originals stands out as a dependable destination to apricot oil buy with confidence. Our oils are carefully packaged to preserve freshness and delivered efficiently to your doorstep. We believe in connecting customers with nature’s finest offerings while maintaining transparency and quality at every step.</p>\n<p>Choosing Ooty Originals means embracing natural wellness with products that are thoughtfully sourced and expertly crafted. Our apricot oil is more than just a beauty product—it is a reflection of purity, tradition, and care. Whether you use it for hair nourishment or skin hydration, this versatile oil is designed to fit seamlessly into your daily routine.</p>\n<p>Experience the benefits of authentic apricot oil and make the smart choice to buy apricot oil from Ooty Originals today. Let nature enhance your beauty with the goodness of apricot kernel oil straight from the Nilgiris.</p>\n<h4>Key Benefits</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Deeply hydrates without clogging pores — ideal for all skin types</li>\n<li>Softens and conditions hair as a leave-in oil</li>\n<li>Excellent carrier oil for essential oil blending</li>\n<li>Gentle makeup remover — dissolves makeup without irritation</li>\n<li>Reduces eczema and skin inflammation</li>\n<li>Smoothens fine lines and improves skin tone</li>\n<li>Ideal for baby massage — very gentle on delicate skin</li>\n<li>Used as a light cooking oil with a mild nutty flavour</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>How to Use / How to Apply</h4>\n<p><strong>Skincare:</strong> Apply 4–5 drops as a face moisturiser morning or night.<br />\n<strong>Hair:</strong> Apply to ends and mid-lengths as a leave-in conditioner.<br />\n<strong>Carrier oil:</strong> Mix 10 drops of any essential oil in 2 tsp apricot oil.<br />\n<strong>Makeup removal:</strong> Apply on a cotton pad and gently wipe away makeup.<br />\n<strong>Massage:</strong> Use as-is for full-body massage — light and non-greasy.</p>\n<h4>How It Works</h4>\n<p>Apricot oil is rich in oleic acid (60–70%) and linoleic acid (25–30%) — two fatty acids that closely mimic the skin’s own sebum. This makes it exceptionally well-tolerated by all skin types. Its high Vitamin E content provides antioxidant protection and aids in cellular repair, making it excellent for scar reduction and anti-ageing.</p>\n<h4>Why Buy From Us?</h4>\n<p><strong>Cold-pressed: </strong>full oleic and Vitamin E profile retained<br />\n<strong>Light texture:</strong> ideal for sensitive, oily, and dry skin alike<br />\n<strong>Versatile:</strong> carrier oil, skincare, haircare, and massage<br />\n<strong>10ml format:</strong> perfect starter size<br />\n<strong>Part of Ooty Originals’ carefully curated carrier oil range</strong></p>\n<h4>Who Can Use This?</h4>\n<p>All skin types, including sensitive and acne-prone skin. Safe for adults, children, and babies for massage. Excellent for those who prefer light, non-greasy oils.</p>\n<h4>Restrictions</h4>\n<p>Individuals with stone fruit or nut allergies should perform a patch test before use.</p>\n<h4>Precautions / Notes</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Patch test before widespread application if you have nut allergies.</li>\n<li>Keep away from eyes.</li>\n<li>Ensure pure, cold-pressed quality for optimal results.</li>\n<li>Use within 12 months of opening.</li>\n<li>Store in a cool, dark place.</li>\n</ul>','[{\"label\":\"Available sizes\",\"value\":\"10ml\"},{\"label\":\"Category\",\"value\":\"Essential Oils\"},{\"label\":\"Packed & shipped from\",\"value\":\"Ooty, The Nilgiris\"},{\"label\":\"Price\",\"value\":\"Inclusive of GST\"}]',NULL,290.00,320.00,40,1,0,0,0,'2026-11-10 10:16:05','2026-11-10 10:16:05'),(41,5,12,'Black Seed Oil','black-seed-oil',NULL,'Pure Black Seed (Nigella sativa / Kalonji) Oil from Ooty Originals — 10ml. Clinically studied for immune support, respiratory health, joint care, and blood sugar management. One of history’s most revered medicinal oils. Shop at ootyoriginals.in.','<h4>About This Product</h4>\n<p>Ooty Originals Black Seed Oil is derived from the seeds of Nigella sativa (Kalonji) — a plant referenced in ancient Ayurvedic, Unani, and Islamic medicine for its extraordinary range of health benefits, from immunity to skin health.</p>\n<p>At Ooty Originals, we bring you the power of nature with our premium black seed oil, carefully sourced and crafted to deliver authentic wellness. Derived from the seeds of Nigella sativa, our oil—commonly known as nigella sativa black seed oil, nigella seed oil, or black cumin seed oil—is valued for its rich nutritional profile and traditional healing properties. Sourced with care and processed to maintain purity, our black jeera oil reflects the natural goodness trusted for generations.</p>\n<p>Our black seed oil benefits are widely recognized in both traditional and modern wellness practices. Rich in antioxidants and essential fatty acids, it helps support overall health, improve immunity, and promote natural balance in the body. At Ooty Originals, we ensure that every bottle retains its original nutrients, making it a reliable choice for those seeking natural and effective solutions.</p>\n<p>One of the most popular uses of black seed oil is for hair care. Our black seed oil for hair helps nourish the scalp, strengthen hair roots, and improve overall hair texture. Regular use can reduce dryness, control dandruff, and support healthy hair growth. Its lightweight yet deeply penetrating nature ensures that your hair receives the care it needs without feeling heavy or greasy. Whether used as a massage oil or part of your routine, nigella seed oil provides visible and lasting results.</p>\n<p>In addition to hair care, black cumin seed oil is also known for its benefits in skin care. It helps hydrate the skin, reduce blemishes, and improve skin tone. Its natural properties make it suitable for daily use, supporting smoother and healthier-looking skin. The versatility of black jeera oil makes it an essential addition to your natural wellness routine.</p>\n<p>If you are looking to buy black seed oil, Ooty Originals offers a trusted and convenient platform to explore high-quality products. Our website allows you to easily access authentic oils, making it simple to buy black cumin seed oil directly from a reliable source. We understand that customers often search for the best black seed oil to buy, and we are committed to delivering products that meet the highest standards of quality and purity.</p>\n<p>For those searching for convenience, we make it easy to buy black seed oil near me through our efficient delivery network. Whether you prefer online shopping or are looking for quick access, Ooty Originals ensures that you receive fresh and genuine products at your doorstep. Our focus on transparency and quality helps you make confident purchasing decisions.</p>\n<p>Each bottle of our black seed oil is carefully packaged to preserve its natural properties and freshness. We take pride in offering products that combine traditional knowledge with modern quality standards. This dedication ensures that you receive the full benefits of nigella sativa black seed oil in every use.</p>\n<p>Choosing Ooty Originals means choosing purity, authenticity, and trust. Our black seed oil is more than just a product—it is a natural solution designed to support your health, hair, and skin. Experience the richness of nature and make the right choice to buy black seed oil from Ooty Originals today, and bring the timeless benefits of black cumin seed oil into your daily life.</p>\n<h4>Key Benefits</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Supports the immune system and helps fight infections</li>\n<li>Anti-inflammatory — may help reduce asthma and bronchitis symptoms</li>\n<li>Aids digestion and soothes stomach discomfort</li>\n<li>Potential blood sugar management benefits (for diabetes management)</li>\n<li>Treats eczema, psoriasis, and inflamed skin conditions</li>\n<li>Promotes scalp health and reduces dandruff</li>\n<li>Supports joint health — may relieve arthritis symptoms</li>\n<li>Powerful antibacterial properties</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>How to Use / How to Apply</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Skin care: Apply 2–3 drops diluted in carrier oil on affected skin areas.</li>\n<li>Hair: Mix 5 drops in coconut oil; apply to scalp, leave 30 mins, wash off.</li>\n<li>Oral wellness: Consult a practitioner for internal use guidance.</li>\n<li>Joint relief: Dilute and massage on affected joints twice daily.</li>\n<li>Respiratory: Use in a steam inhaler (3–4 drops) for asthma or bronchitis support.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>How It Works</h4>\n<p>Black seed oil’s key active compound, thymoquinone, has been studied in over 450 peer-reviewed papers. It inhibits NF-κB (a master inflammatory pathway), downregulates inflammatory cytokines, and modulates T-cell immunity. These mechanisms explain its anti-inflammatory, antiviral, and immune-modulating properties.</p>\n<h4>Why Buy From Us?</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Pure Nigella sativa seed oil — high thymoquinone content</li>\n<li>One of the most scientifically studied natural wellness oils</li>\n<li>Multi-benefit: immune, skin, hair, joint, and digestive health</li>\n<li>10ml amber bottle for preserved potency</li>\n<li>Part of Ooty Originals’ premium remedy oil collection</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Who Can Use This?</h4>\n<p>Adults seeking immune support, those with chronic inflammatory conditions, and anyone interested in preventive natural wellness.</p>\n<h4>Restrictions</h4>\n<p>Always consult a healthcare professional before using for therapeutic purposes, especially if on medications for diabetes or blood pressure.</p>\n<h4><b>Precautions / Notes</b></h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Consult a doctor before internal use — especially if on medications.</li>\n<li>Not for children without medical guidance.</li>\n<li>Patch test before topical use.</li>\n<li>Pregnant women should avoid therapeutic doses of black seed oil.</li>\n<li>Do not use as a substitute for prescribed medications.</li>\n</ul>','[{\"label\":\"Category\",\"value\":\"Essential Oils\"},{\"label\":\"Packed & shipped from\",\"value\":\"Ooty, The Nilgiris\"},{\"label\":\"Price\",\"value\":\"Inclusive of GST\"}]',NULL,290.00,320.00,40,1,0,0,0,'2026-11-10 10:16:05','2026-11-10 10:16:05'),(42,5,12,'Citriodora Oil','citriodora-oil',NULL,'Pure Citriodora (Lemon Eucalyptus) Oil from Ooty Originals — a Nilgiri specialty. Prevents hair fall, treats dandruff, keeps scalp cool, and repels insects naturally. Use in a diffuser or as floor wash. Available 30ml–500ml.','<h4>About This Product</h4>\n<p>Ooty Originals Citriodora Oil is extracted from Eucalyptus citriodora trees of the Nilgiris known for their unique lemon-citrus aroma and superior insect-repelling and hair-care properties compared to regular eucalyptus oil.</p>\n<h4>Key Benefits</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Prevents premature hair fall and thinning</li>\n<li>Treats dandruff effectively with regular scalp application</li>\n<li>Keeps scalp cool and refreshed ideal for summer and hot climates</li>\n<li>Powerful natural insect repellent more effective than regular eucalyptus</li>\n<li>Excellent floor wash additive for freshness and sanitation</li>\n<li>Uplifting lemon-citrus aroma in diffusers</li>\n<li>Antibacterial properties for wound care</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>How to Use / How to Apply</h4>\n<ol>\n<li>Hair care: Mix in coconut oil (ratio 1:10) and massage into scalp. Leave for 30 minutes; wash off.</li>\n<li>Diffuser: Add 4–5 drops for aroma and insect-repelling effect.</li>\n<li>Floor wash: Add 10–12 drops to a bucket of water before mopping.</li>\n<li>Insect repellent: Dilute in coconut oil and apply to arms, legs, and neck.</li>\n<li>Skin wound: Dilute 2 drops in 1 tsp aloe vera gel and apply to minor cuts.</li>\n</ol>\n<h4>How It Works</h4>\n<p>Citriodora oil contains p-menthane-3,8-diol (PMD) as its key active compound clinically recognized as an effective insect repellent and listed by the CDC as a safer alternative to DEET. It also contains citronellal and isopulegol, which nourish the scalp, reduce inflammation, and create an inhospitable environment for dandruff-causing fungi.</p>\n<h4>Why Buy From Us?</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Rare Nilgiri Citriodora stronger lemon aroma and higher PMD content than generic brands</li>\n<li>Dual-purpose: hair care AND insect repellent in one bottle</li>\n<li>External use only clearly labelled for safe use</li>\n<li>Available in sizes from 30ml to 500ml for all needs</li>\n<li>Straight from Nilgiri farms no intermediary mixing or dilution</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Who Can Use This?</h4>\n<p>Adults and children above 5 years (external use only). Highly recommended for people living in tropical/humid areas, those with dandruff-prone scalps, and frequent travellers.</p>\n<h4>Restrictions</h4>\n<p>For external use only. Do not ingest. Always dilute before use.</p>\n<h4>Precautions / Notes</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Must be diluted with coconut or other carrier oil before applying to skin or scalp.</li>\n<li>Keep away from eyes, nose, and mouth.</li>\n<li>Patch test required before first scalp application.</li>\n<li>Pregnant women should consult a doctor before use.</li>\n<li>Store in a cool, dark place. Do not expose yourself to heat.</li>\n</ul>','[{\"label\":\"Available types\",\"value\":\"Bottle, Spray, Roll-on\"},{\"label\":\"Available sizes\",\"value\":\"10ml, 30ml, 60ml, 100ml, 200ml, 500ml\"},{\"label\":\"Category\",\"value\":\"Essential Oils\"},{\"label\":\"Packed & shipped from\",\"value\":\"Ooty, The Nilgiris\"},{\"label\":\"Price\",\"value\":\"Inclusive of GST\"}]','Anti-bug antibacterial Room Freshners',140.00,150.00,240,1,0,0,0,'2026-11-10 10:16:05','2026-11-10 10:16:05'),(43,5,12,'Almond Oil','almond-oil',NULL,'Cold-pressed Pure Almond (Badam) Oil from Ooty Originals. Rich in Vitamin E, antioxidants, and fatty acids. Reduces dark circles, treats dry skin, lightens scars, and promotes healthy hair. Available 30ml–500ml at ootyoriginals.in.','<h4>About This Product</h4>\n<p>Ooty Originals Pure Almond (Badam) Oil is a cold-pressed, 100% natural oil derived from premium almonds — ideal for nourishing skin, lightening dark circles, reducing scars and stretch marks, and promoting hair strength.</p>\n<p>At Ooty Originals, we bring you the purity of nature with our premium almond oil, carefully sourced and crafted to deliver authentic wellness. Extracted from high-quality almonds, our oil—also known as badam oil—is rich in essential nutrients like Vitamin E, making it a trusted solution for both beauty and health needs. Rooted in the serene environment of the Nilgiris, our almond oil reflects freshness, purity, and traditional goodness.</p>\n<p>Our almond oil for hair is a natural way to nourish your scalp and strengthen your strands. Regular use helps reduce dryness, improves hair texture, and promotes healthy growth. Whether you are dealing with frizz, dandruff, or hair fall, incorporating badam oil into your routine can make a visible difference. It penetrates deep into the scalp, providing hydration and restoring vitality from root to tip.</p>\n<p>For skincare, our almond oil for face is a gentle yet effective solution. It helps moisturize dry skin, reduce dark circles, and enhance your natural glow. Being lightweight and non-greasy, it suits all skin types and absorbs easily without clogging pores. Many customers choose our almond oil as a daily skincare essential because it supports smoother, softer, and healthier-looking skin over time.</p>\n<p>At Ooty Originals, we ensure that every bottle of almond oil retains its natural properties without harmful additives. This commitment to quality makes our product ideal for those who are looking to buy almond oil that is both safe and effective. If you are searching to buy almond oil online, our website provides a seamless experience, allowing you to explore authentic products directly sourced from nature.</p>\n<p>We understand that customers often look for convenience and trust when making a purchase. That’s why we make it easy for you to buy almond oil near me through our reliable delivery network, ensuring your product reaches you fresh and on time. Our almond oil is always available as almond oil for sale, giving you access to premium quality at a reasonable badam oil price without compromising authenticity.</p>\n<p>Choosing Ooty Originals means choosing purity, tradition, and quality. Our almond oil is more than just a product—it’s a natural solution crafted with care for your everyday wellness. Whether you use it for hair care, skincare, or overall nourishment, our badam oil is designed to fit seamlessly into your lifestyle.</p>\n<p>Experience the goodness of nature with Ooty Originals and make the right choice to buy almond oil online today. Let your journey towards healthier hair and glowing skin begin with the finest almond oil sourced from the heart of the Nilgiris.</p>\n<h4>Key Benefits</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Reduces puffiness and dark circles under the eyes</li>\n<li>Improves skin complexion, tone, and texture naturally</li>\n<li>Deeply moisturises dry and flaky skin</li>\n<li>Helps reverse sun damage and premature ageing</li>\n<li>Reduces the appearance of scars and blemishes</li>\n<li>Minimises stretch marks with regular application</li>\n<li>Nourishes and strengthens hair — reduces breakage</li>\n<li>Safe for use on the face, body, and hair</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>How to Use / How to Apply</h4>\n<ol>\n<li>Under-eye care: Apply 2–3 drops around the eye area at night; gently tap with ring finger.</li>\n<li>Face moisturiser: Use 4–5 drops as a serum after cleansing