 from\",\"value\":\"Ooty, The Nilgiris\"},{\"label\":\"Price\",\"value\":\"Inclusive of GST\"}]',NULL,130.00,145.00,120,1,0,0,0,'2026-11-10 10:16:05','2026-11-10 12:10:07'),(44,5,12,'Citronella Oil','citronella-oil',NULL,'Pure Citronella Essential Oil from Ooty Originals — India’s most trusted natural mosquito repellent oil. No DEET. No chemicals. Also used as a natural air freshener, floor wash additive, and wound disinfectant. Available 30ml–500ml.','<h4>About This Product</h4>\n<p>Ooty Originals Citronella Oil is a 100% natural, chemical-free mosquito and insect repellent oil extracted from the citronella grass plant — effective against mosquitoes, bed bugs, and common household pests without the health risks of synthetic repellents.</p>\n<h4>Key Benefits</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Powerful natural mosquito and insect repellent — safe alternative to DEET</li>\n<li>Effective against bed bugs, ticks, and ants</li>\n<li>Natural air freshener — diffuse indoors to eliminate odours</li>\n<li>Excellent floor wash additive — disinfects and freshens rooms</li>\n<li>Treats minor wounds and skin infections (antibacterial properties)</li>\n<li>Reduces anxiety and depression with its refreshing aroma</li>\n<li>Anti-inflammatory properties — soothes sore muscles</li>\n<li>Deodorizes clothing, curtains, and fabric without staining</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>How to Use / How to Apply</h4>\n<ol>\n<li>Repellent: Mix 5–7 drops with coconut oil and apply to arms, legs, and neck.</li>\n<li>Diffuser: Add 6–8 drops to your diffuser to repel insects indoors.</li>\n<li>Floor wash: Add 10–15 drops to a bucket of water for mopping.</li>\n<li>Room spray: Mix 15 drops in 100ml water in a spray bottle; spray around room.</li>\n<li>Fabric application: Apply a few drops on curtains, bed sheets, and clothing — safe and non-staining.</li>\n</ol>\n<h4>How It Works</h4>\n<p>Citronella oil works by masking the scents (carbon dioxide and lactic acid) that attract mosquitoes to humans. Its active compounds — citronellal, geraniol, and citronellol — are scientifically proven to repel insects. The oil also contains antimicrobial and antifungal compounds that disinfect surfaces and inhibit bacterial growth.</p>\n<h4>Why Buy From Us?</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Sourced from Nilgiri-region citronella grass — high citronellal content</li>\n<li>More economical per use compared to commercial insect repellent sprays</li>\n<li>Completely safe for children and pets when diluted correctly</li>\n<li>Multi-purpose: repellent, cleaning, aromatherapy, wound care</li>\n<li>Available in bulk sizes (500ml) — perfect for homes and commercial spaces</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Who Can Use This?</h4>\n<p>Safe for the entire family when diluted properly — adults, children above 3 years, and even pets. Widely used in households, hospitals, hotels, and yoga studios.</p>\n<h4>Restrictions</h4>\n<p>Always dilute before skin application. Do not apply undiluted citronella oil directly on skin. Not for ingestion.</p>\n<h4>Precautions / Notes</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Dilute with coconut, almond, or olive oil before skin application (ratio 1:5 minimum).</li>\n<li>Avoid contact with eyes and mucous membranes.</li>\n<li>Conduct a patch test on inner wrist before widespread use.</li>\n<li>For children under 3, use only in diffuser — not on skin.</li>\n<li>Store in a dark, cool place to preserve potency.</li>\n</ul>','[{\"label\":\"Available types\",\"value\":\"Bottle, Spray\"},{\"label\":\"Available sizes\",\"value\":\"10ml, 30ml, 60ml, 100ml, 200ml, 500ml\"},{\"label\":\"Category\",\"value\":\"Essential Oils\"},{\"label\":\"Packed & shipped from\",\"value\":\"Ooty, The Nilgiris\"},{\"label\":\"Price\",\"value\":\"Inclusive of GST\"}]','Citronella Oil / Mosquito Repellent Oil',115.00,135.00,240,1,0,0,0,'2026-11-10 10:16:05','2026-11-10 10:16:05'),(45,5,12,'Clove Oil','clove-oil',NULL,'Pure Clove Essential Oil from Ooty Originals — India’s most trusted natural remedy for toothache, bad breath, and infections. 100% natural, steam-distilled. Fights bacteria, soothes sore throat, and eases headaches. (10ml)','<h4>About This Product</h4>\n<p>Ooty Originals Clove Oil is extracted by distilling the dried flower buds of the clove tree — a time-honoured Ayurvedic remedy for dental pain, oral infections, cold, nausea, and skin health.</p>\n<p>At Ooty Originals, we bring you the natural strength of spices with our premium clove oil, traditionally known as lavanga oil. Sourced from high-quality cloves and carefully processed to retain their natural potency, our oil reflects the purity and richness of the Nilgiris. Known for its strong aroma and powerful properties, clove oil has been used for generations as a trusted remedy for oral care and overall wellness.</p>\n<p>One of the most popular uses of clove oil is for dental care. Our clove oil for teeth is widely valued for its natural ability to support oral hygiene and provide relief from discomfort. It contains natural compounds that help soothe sensitive areas, making it an effective solution for maintaining healthy teeth and gums. Many people rely on clove oil for toothache as a quick and natural way to ease pain and discomfort.</p>\n<p>In addition, clove oil for dental pain is known for its calming and numbing properties, which can provide temporary relief when dealing with tooth sensitivity or gum irritation. At Ooty Originals, we ensure that our lavanga oil is pure and free from harmful chemicals, making it suitable for safe and effective use when applied properly. Its traditional use in oral care makes it a valuable addition to your home remedies.</p>\n<p>Beyond dental benefits, clove oil also offers a range of wellness advantages. Its strong, warm aroma makes it ideal for aromatherapy, helping to create a relaxing and refreshing environment. The natural properties of clove oil also support skin care and can be used in diluted form for massage and relaxation purposes. This versatility makes it a must-have essential oil for everyday use.</p>\n<p>If you are looking 