outines through both aroma and sensory experience.</p>\n<p>Its fresh scent supports moments of calm while creating a naturally refreshing environment.</p>\n<h2>Cypress Oil as a Varicose Veins Massage Oil</h2>\n<p>Among traditional wellness discussions, cypress oil is frequently mentioned in relation to massage practices focused on comfort.</p>\n<p>Many users include it in a varicose veins massage oil blend because of the relaxing massage experience it creates when combined with carrier oils.</p>\n<p>Massage routines using cypress oil may help create a soothing self-care ritual after long periods of standing or physical activity.</p>\n<p>People who explore varicose veins oil massage practices often prefer botanical oils that provide a smooth massage experience without leaving heavy residue.</p>\n<p>This growing interest has made cypress oil a common addition to wellness collections.</p>\n<h2>Why Cypress Oil Is Included in Traditional Wellness Routines</h2>\n<p>Traditional wellness practices often focus on creating balance through natural ingredients and intentional self-care.</p>\n<p>Cypress oil continues to remain popular because it fits into multiple routines:</p>\n<h3>Massage Rituals</h3>\n<p>Commonly used during relaxation-focused body massage.</p>\n<h3>Aromatherapy</h3>\n<p>Creates a calming atmosphere through diffusion.</p>\n<h3>Daily Self-Care</h3>\n<p>Supports intentional moments of rest and wellness.</p>\n<h3>Home Wellness Practices</h3>\n<p>Blends easily with other oils and body care rituals.</p>\n<p>Its versatility makes cypress oil a practical addition for modern wellness lifestyles.</p>\n<h2>Cypress Oil and Botanical Wellness Traditions</h2>\n<p>Natural oils have been used across generations to support mindful routines and relaxation practices.</p>\n<p>Many people searching for varicose veins ayurvedic oil are often interested in traditional approaches that incorporate botanical ingredients into body massage routines.</p>\n<p>Cypress oil aligns with these wellness traditions by offering a plant-based option suitable for massage and aromatherapy experiences.</p>\n<p>At Ooty Originals, we respect these traditions while maintaining modern quality standards.</p>\n<h2>How to Use Cypress Oil</h2>\n<p>To enjoy the experience of cypress oil safely and effectively, proper application is important.</p>\n<h3>Massage Use</h3>\n<p>Mix several drops with a carrier oil and apply gently to the desired area.</p>\n<h3>Aromatherapy</h3>\n<p>Add a few drops to a diffuser to create a refreshing environment.</p>\n<h3>Wellness Routine</h3>\n<p>Incorporate into personal body care rituals for relaxation.</p>\n<h3>Bath Experience</h3>\n<p>Add diluted oil to warm water for a calming aromatic experience.</p>\n<p>Avoid applying undiluted essential oils directly to sensitive skin.</p>\n<h2>What Makes Ooty Originals Different?</h2>\n<p>At Ooty Originals, every product reflects our commitment to authenticity, quality, and thoughtful preparation.</p>\n<p>Why customers choose us:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Carefully selected botanical ingredients</li>\n<li>Traditional preparation values</li>\n<li>Quality-focused processing</li>\n<li>No unnecessary additives</li>\n<li>Freshly packed products</li>\n</ul>\n<p>We believe natural wellness should feel simple, authentic, and enjoyable.</p>\n<h2>Choosing the Best Massage Oil for Varicose Veins Routines</h2>\n<p>Many customers look for products that complement massage-based self-care routines.</p>\n<p>When searching for the best massage oil for varicose veins, people often prefer products that:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Blend smoothly with carrier oils</li>\n<li>Have a refreshing sensory experience</li>\n<li>Support relaxing massage sessions</li>\n<li>Fit naturally into daily wellness habits</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Cypress oil continues to be appreciated because it combines aromatic freshness with versatility.</p>\n<h2>Buy Authentic Cypress Oil from Ooty Originals</h2>\n<p>Finding authentic essential oils can make a meaningful difference in your wellness experience.</p>\n<p>At Ooty Originals, we make it easy to access carefully prepared cypress oil through a convenient and reliable shopping experience.</p>\n<p>Whether you know it as cypress oil, cyprus oil, or cupressus oil, our goal remains the same—bringing you premium-quality botanical products that support your self-care journey.</p>\n<p>Experience the refreshing character of nature and discover how Ooty Originals cypress oil can become part of your everyday wellness routine.</p>\n<h2>Precautions</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>For external use only</li>\n<li>Always dilute before topical use</li>\n<li>Avoid contact with eyes</li>\n<li>Store away from direct sunlight</li>\n<li>Keep out of reach of children</li>\n<li>Consult a professional before use if needed</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Bring balance, comfort, and botanical wellness into your daily routine with Ooty Originals.</p>\n<h4>Key Benefits</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Improves blood circulation — reduces swelling in varicose veins</li>\n<li>Reduces inflammation and discomfort in affected veins</li>\n<li>Strengthens vein walls — helps prevent further deterioration</li>\n<li>Tightens and tones skin over bulging varicose veins</li>\n<li>Provides relief from menstrual cramps (antispasmodic properties)</li>\n<li>Promotes relaxation in aromatherapy</li>\n<li>Natural deodorant — antimicrobial against body odour</li>\n<li>Wound healing — antimicrobial and antiseptic properties</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>How to Use / How to Apply</h4>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Varicose veins:</strong> Dilute with coconut or almond oil; massage in gentle upward strokes on the legs.</li>\n<li><strong>Aromatherapy:</strong> Add 3–5 drops to a diffuser for relaxation and stress relief.</li>\n<li><strong>Menstrual relief:</strong> Dilute and apply on lower abdomen; massage gently.</li>\n<li><strong>Deodorant:</strong> Mix 2 drops with carrier oil and apply to underarms.</li>\n<li><strong>Wound care:</strong> Apply diluted oil on minor cuts to prevent infection.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>How It Works</h4>\n<p>Cypress oil contains camphene, alpha-pinene, and delta-3-carene — compounds that cause vasoconstriction (narrowing of blood vessels). This mechanism reduces the appearance of varicose veins, improves venous return, and alleviates the pressure and aching sensations associated with the condition. Its astringent properties also help tighten the skin around affected areas.</p>\n<h4>Why Buy From Us?</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>One of the few Indian brands stocking authentic Cypress Essential Oil</li>\n<li>Clearly labelled for varicose vein relief with supporting information</li>\n<li>Comes with detailed usage instructions for best results</li>\n<li>Priced competitively at ₹390 for a 10ml therapeutic bottle</li>\n<li>Part of the Ooty Originals Remedy Oils range</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Who Can Use This?</h4>\n<p>Adults experiencing varicose veins, poor leg circulation, menstrual discomfort, or stress. Also used by aromatherapists and wellness practitioners.</p>\n<h4>Restrictions</h4>\n<p>Pregnant women and those with sensitive skin should consult a healthcare professional before use. Not for direct application on open varicose ulcers.</p>\n<h4>Precautions / Notes</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Always dilute with a carrier oil (coconut, almond) before skin application.</li>\n<li>Patch test required before use — some individuals may be sensitive to cypress.</li>\n<li>Do not ingest.</li>\n<li>Avoid eye contact.</li>\n<li>Consult a doctor before use if on blood-pressure or circulation medications.</li>\n</ul>','[{\"label\":\"Category\",\"value\":\"Essential Oils\"},{\"label\":\"Packed & shipped from\",\"value\":\"Ooty, The Nilgiris\"},{\"label\":\"Price\",\"value\":\"Inclusive of GST\"}]','Cypress Oil | Varicose Veins Oil | Varicose Oil cypress oil varicose oil varicose veins oil',390.00,410.00,40,1,0,0,0,'2026-11-10 10:16:05','2026-11-10 10:16:05'),(47,5,12,'Pure Nilgiri Gaultheria Oil','pure-nilgiri-gaultheria-oil',NULL,'Pure Gaultheria (Wintergreen) Oil extracted from the Nilgiri hills of Tamil Nadu. India’s most effective natural relief for muscular pain, joint inflammation, and headaches. Available in 30ml to 500ml','<p>Ooty Originals Gaultheria Oil, also known as Wintergreen Oil, is extracted from the leaves of the Gaultheria plant grown in select parts of the Nilgiris — one of the very few regions in India where this rare medicinal herb thrives. At Ooty Originals, we bring you the refreshing strength of nature with our premium wintergreen oil, also known as gaultheria oil. Carefully sourced and distilled to preserve its natural potency, this oil reflects the purity and authenticity of the Nilgiris. Known for its cooling sensation and therapeutic properties, wintergreen oil has been traditionally valued for its ability to support relief and relaxation in everyday wellness routines.</p>\n<p>Our gaultheria oil is extracted with care to retain its key active compounds, making it highly effective for external applications. Among the most recognized gaultheria oil uses is its role in soothing muscle discomfort and joint stiffness. When applied in diluted form, it provides a warming and cooling effect that helps relax the body and ease tension. This makes it a popular choice for massage therapies and post-workout recovery.</p>\n<p>The wide range of gaultheria oil benefits makes it a versatile addition to your wellness collection. It is often used to support relief from minor aches, reduce inflammation, and promote a sense of comfort. Its strong and refreshing aroma also makes it suitable for aromatherapy, where it helps clear the mind and improve focus. At Ooty Originals, we ensure that our wintergreen oil is free from harmful additives, maintaining its natural strength and effectiveness.</p>\n<p>In addition to its therapeutic uses, gaultheria oil is also valued for its role in personal care. It can be blended with carrier oils for topical application or used in small quantities in relaxation routines. Its natural composition makes it a preferred option for those seeking alternatives to chemical-based products. With consistent use, wintergreen oil supports a balanced and holistic approach to well-being.</p>\n<p>If you are looking to buy wintergreen oil, Ooty Originals provides a trusted platform to access high-quality products. Our website allows you to easily gaultheria oil buy online, ensuring a seamless and secure shopping experience. For those searching wintergreen oil where to buy, we offer a reliable solution by delivering authentic products directly to your doorstep.</p>\n<p>We understand the importance of sourcing genuine oils, which is why Ooty Originals is recognized among dependable wintergreen oil suppliers. Our commitment to quality ensures that every bottle meets high standards of purity and freshness. Whether you are purchasing for personal use or professional applications, you can trust our products to deliver consistent results.</p>\n<p>Each bottle of our gaultheria oil is carefully packaged to preserve its natural properties and aroma. We focus on maintaining the balance between traditional methods and modern quality practices, ensuring that customers receive the best of both worlds. This dedication makes Ooty Originals a preferred choice for those seeking natural and effective wellness solutions.</p>\n<p>Choosing Ooty Originals means embracing authenticity, purity, and trust. Our wintergreen oil is more than just a product—it is a natural remedy designed to support your daily comfort and relaxation. Experience the benefits of gaultheria oil and make the right choice to buy wintergreen oil from Ooty Originals today, bringing the refreshing power of nature into your everyday life.</p>\n<h2>Key Benefits of Gaultheria Oil for Joint Pain &amp; Inflammation</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Provides fast relief from muscular pain and body aches</li>\n<li>Reduces inflammation of joints — effective for arthritis and gout</li>\n<li>Relieves headaches when applied to temples</li>\n<li>Acts as a natural analgesic (pain-numbing) agent</li>\n<li>Improves blood circulation in affected areas</li>\n<li>Helps with knee pain, back pain, and sports injuries</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>How to Use / How to Apply Wintergreen Oil for Best Results</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Mix Gaultheria oil with warm coconut oil in a 1:1 ratio.</li>\n<li>Apply the blend gently on the painful area — joints, muscles, back, or head.</li>\n<li>Massage in circular motions for 5–10 minutes for deeper penetration.</li>\n<li>Use 2–3 times a day for best results on chronic pain areas.</li>\n<li>For headache: apply 2 drops (diluted) to temples and back of the neck.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>How It Works</h4>\n<p>Gaultheria oil is naturally rich in methyl salicylate (over 90%), a compound closely related to aspirin. When absorbed through the skin, methyl salicylate inhibits prostaglandins — the chemicals responsible for pain and inflammation. This makes Gaultheria one of the most potent natural alternatives for pain relief, particularly for joint and muscle conditions.</p>\n<h4>Why Buy From Us?</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Rare Nilgiri-sourced Gaultheria — not blended with synthetic methyl salicylate</li>\n<li>Traditional extraction methods preserve natural potency</li>\n<li>Best Seller at Ooty Originals — trusted by thousands of repeat buyers</li>\n<li>Available in sizes from 30ml to 500ml — ideal for personal and bulk use</li>\n<li>Competitively priced with free shipping on orders above ₹499</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Who Can Use This?</h4>\n<p>Best suited for adults experiencing muscle pain, joint inflammation, arthritis, sports injuries, and tension headaches. Also popular with physiotherapists and natural health practitioners.</p>\n<h4>Restrictions</h4>\n<p>For external use only. Not for pregnant women, children under 12, or individuals on blood-thinning medications without medical advice. Do not use on broken or irritated skin.</p>\n<h4>Precautions / Notes</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Always dilute with a carrier oil — never apply neat (undiluted) to skin.</li>\n<li>Do not use near eyes, ears, or sensitive mucous membranes.</li>\n<li>Methyl salicylate can be toxic if ingested — keep out of reach of children.</li>\n<li>Those with aspirin sensitivity or salicylate allergy should avoid this oil.</li>\n<li>Consult a doctor before use if you are on anticoagulant medications.</li>\n</ul>\n#sp-ea-2180 .spcollapsing { height: 0; overflow: hidden; transition-property: height;transition-duration: 300ms;}#sp-ea-2180.sp-easy-accordion&gt;.sp-ea-single {margin-bottom: 10px; border: 1px solid #e2e2e2; }#sp-ea-2180.sp-easy-accordion&gt;.sp-ea-single&gt;.ea-header a {color: #686868;}#sp-ea-2180.sp-easy-accordion&gt;.sp-ea-single&gt;.sp-collapse&gt;.ea-body {background: #fff; color: #444;}#sp-ea-2180.sp-easy-accordion&gt;.sp-ea-single {background: #d4d6d4;}#sp-ea-2180.sp-easy-accordion&gt;.sp-ea-single&gt;.ea-header a .ea-expand-icon { float: left; color: #444;font-size: 16px;}<h3><i></i> Is Nilgiri Gaultheria oil effective for arthritis and joint pain?</h3> <p>Yes, <strong>Nilgiri Gaultheria (Wintergreen) oil</strong> is highly effective for <strong>arthritis, gout, and chronic joint pain</strong>. It contains over 90% <strong>natural methyl salicylate</strong>, which acts as a powerful <strong>analgesic (pain-killer)</strong> and <strong>anti-inflammatory</strong> agent to reduce swelling and improve mobility.</p><h3><i></i> How do I use Gaultheria oil for muscle aches and sports injuries?</h3> <p>To relieve <strong>muscle aches or sports injuries</strong>, always dilute Gaultheria oil in a <strong>1:1 ratio with a carrier oil</strong> like coconut or sesame oil. Massage the blend into the affected area to inhibit prostaglandins and provide <strong>fast-acting topical pain relief</strong>.</p><h3><i></i> Can Gaultheria oil be used for tension headaches?</h3> <p>Yes, it is a potent <strong>natural remedy for headaches</strong>. For quick relief, apply <strong>2 drops of diluted Gaultheria oil</strong> to your temples. Its <strong>numbing properties</strong> help soothe tension and provide a cooling, sedative effect.</p><h3><i></i> What makes Ooty Originals Gaultheria oil better than synthetic versions?</h3> <p>Our oil is <strong>pure, steam-distilled</strong>, and sourced directly from the <strong>Nilgiri hills</strong>, one of the few regions where this rare medicinal herb thrives. Unlike commercial brands, our <strong>authentic wintergreen oil</strong> is not factory-blended with <strong>synthetic methyl salicylate</strong>, ensuring you get the full therapeutic spectrum.</p><h3><i></i> Are there any safety precautions for using Wintergreen oil?</h3> <p>Since it is a high-potency <strong>essential oil</strong>, it is for <strong>external use only</strong>. It should not be used by pregnant women, children under 12, or individuals on <strong>blood-thinning medications</strong>. Always perform a patch test to check for skin sensitivity before full application.</p>','[{\"label\":\"Available types\",\"value\":\"Bottle, Roll-on\"},{\"label\":\"Available sizes\",\"value\":\"10ml, 30ml, 60ml, 100ml, 200ml, 500ml\"},{\"label\":\"Category\",\"value\":\"Essential Oils\"},{\"label\":\"Packed & shipped from\",\"value\":\"Ooty, The Nilgiris\"},{\"label\":\"Price\",\"value\":\"Inclusive of GST\"}]','Pure Nilgiri Gaultheria Oil | Wintergreen Oil for Joint & Muscle Pain Relief Pain Relief Relief Oils',100.00,120.00,240,0,0,0,1,'2026-11-10 10:16:05','2026-11-13 10:40:48'),(48,5,12,'Eucalyptus Oil','eucalyptus-oil',NULL,'Authentic steam-distilled Eucalyptus Oil sourced from the Nilgiri hills of India. 100% pure, chemical-free, and therapeutic-grade. Available in 30ml, 60ml, 100ml, 200ml & 500ml.','<p>At Ooty Originals, we bring you the authentic goodness of eucalyptus oil, sourced from the pristine hills of the Nilgiris where eucalyptus trees flourish in their natural environment. Known for its refreshing aroma and versatile wellness benefits, eucalyptus has been valued for generations as one of nature’s most trusted gifts. Our commitment to purity and quality ensures that every bottle of eucalyptus oil delivers the true essence of the Nilgiri region.</p>\n<p>The popularity of eucalyptus oil continues to grow because of its wide range of applications in everyday life. Whether it is used in aromatherapy, personal care, or traditional wellness practices, eucalyptus oil remains a preferred natural solution for many households. Customers often search for information about eucalyptus use, eucalyptus oil price, and eucalyptus oil cost before making a purchase, and Ooty Originals strives to provide premium quality oil at a fair value.</p>\n<p>Our carefully distilled eucalyptus essential oil is extracted from fresh eucalyptus leaves using traditional methods that preserve its natural properties. This ensures that every drop retains its characteristic aroma and effectiveness. As a trusted source of authentic products from Ooty, we believe in offering a pure and natural eucalyptus oil essential oil experience that supports your wellness journey.</p>\n<p>One of the most common reasons people choose eucalyptus oil is its refreshing and soothing aroma. The natural fragrance of eucalyptus helps create a calming atmosphere in homes, offices, and wellness spaces. Many people add a few drops of eucalyptus essential oil to diffusers and vaporizers to enjoy a clean and refreshing environment. The pleasant scent of eucalyptus is often associated with relaxation and mental clarity, making it an ideal companion for modern lifestyles.</p>\n<p>The use of eucalyptus oil extends beyond aromatherapy. It has been traditionally used in steam inhalation practices, especially during seasonal changes. Many families rely on eucalyptus oil for cold as part of their wellness routine. When added to hot water for steam inhalation, the aromatic vapors create a refreshing experience that promotes comfort and relaxation. Similarly, eucalyptus oil for cough is commonly included in traditional home remedies because of its naturally soothing aroma.</p>\n<p>At Ooty Originals, we understand that customers value versatile products. That is why our eucalyptus oil can be used in multiple ways. Many individuals incorporate eucalyptus oil for hair into their hair care routine by mixing it with carrier oils. This practice helps refresh the scalp and provides a cooling sensation during hair massages. The nourishing qualities of eucalyptus oil make it a valuable addition to natural hair care regimens.</p>\n<p>The world of eucalyptus is diverse, and some varieties are especially appreciated for their unique fragrance. Lemon scented eucalyptus is one such variety that offers a refreshing citrus-like aroma. Products inspired by this variety, including lemon eucalyptus oil, are known for their pleasant scent and refreshing characteristics. Some people also enjoy blending lemon and eucalyptus oil to create aromatic combinations that enhance their wellness and relaxation routines.</p>\n<p>When discussing eucalyptus oil, safety and proper usage are important considerations. Many people search for information regarding eucalyptus oil for infants and eucalyptus oil for newborn. While eucalyptus oil is widely appreciated for its natural properties, it is always advisable to consult a qualified healthcare professional before using essential oils around infants or newborns. Responsible usage helps ensure a safe and positive experience for everyone.</p>\n<p>At Ooty Originals, quality is our highest priority. We carefully source eucalyptus leaves from trusted growers in the Nilgiris and follow strict quality standards throughout the production process. This dedication allows us to offer eucalyptus oil that reflects the natural purity of the region. Every bottle is crafted to provide a genuine eucalyptus experience that customers can trust.</p>\n<p>Customers frequently compare eucalyptus oil price and eucalyptus oil cost when selecting a product. While pricing is important, quality and authenticity are equally essential. Low-cost products may not always provide the same level of purity and effectiveness as naturally sourced oils. At Ooty Originals, we focus on delivering exceptional value by combining premium quality with competitive pricing.</p>\n<p>Today, purchasing authentic eucalyptus products has become easier than ever. If you are looking to buy eucalyptus oil, Ooty Originals offers a convenient online shopping experience. Our platform makes it simple to eucalyptus oil buy online directly from a trusted source. Whether you are a first-time buyer or a regular customer, you can explore our products with confidence.</p>\n<p>Many customers search for buy eucalyptus oil near me, eucalyptus oil near me, or eucalyptus oil available near me because they want reliable access to genuine products. Ooty Originals bridges this gap by delivering authentic eucalyptus oil directly to customers across India. This means you can enjoy the convenience of online shopping while receiving products sourced from the heart of the Nilgiris.</p>\n<p>The growing interest in natural wellness products has increased awareness about the many benefits of eucalyptus. From home aromatherapy to personal care routines, eucalyptus use continues to evolve with modern lifestyles. People appreciate the versatility of eucalyptus essential oil because it can be incorporated into various wellness practices while maintaining its natural appeal.</p>\n<p>Choosing Ooty Originals means choosing authenticity, tradition, and purity. Our eucalyptus oil is more than just a product—it is a reflection of the rich natural heritage of Ooty and the Nilgiri hills. Every bottle captures the freshness of carefully selected eucalyptus leaves and the expertise of traditional extraction methods.</p>\n<p>Experience the refreshing power of eucalyptus oil from Ooty Originals and discover why this remarkable natural oil remains a trusted choice for wellness-conscious individuals. Whether you are exploring the many benefits of eucalyptus, comparing eucalyptus oil price, learning about eucalyptus use, or looking to buy eucalyptus oil, Ooty Originals is your trusted destination for premium-quality eucalyptus products sourced directly from nature.</p>\n<h2>Key Benefits of Nilgiri Eucalyptus Oil</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Relieves cold, congestion &amp; blocked nose inhale directly or use in steam</li>\n<li>Reduces headache and mental fatigue when applied to temples</li>\n<li>Soothes muscle pain and body aches with topical application</li>\n<li>Promotes dental health known antibacterial properties</li>\n<li>Helps bring down fever naturally</li>\n<li>Nourishes scalp, reduces dandruff and promotes hair growth</li>\n<li>Heals minor wounds and skin infections faster</li>\n<li>Acts as a natural room freshener and insect repellent</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>How to Use / How to Apply Nilgiri Eucalyptus Oil</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>Steam inhalation: Add 3–5 drops to a bowl of hot water, cover head with towel, and inhale for 5–10 minutes.</li>\n<li>Topical for pain: Dilute 3–4 drops with coconut oil (1:5 ratio) and massage on affected area.</li>\n<li>Headache relief: Apply 1–2 drops on temples and back of neck; massage gently.</li>\n<li>Diffuser: Add 5–6 drops to your diffuser for respiratory relief and freshness.</li>\n<li>Hair care: Mix 5 drops with 2 tbsp coconut oil, massage into scalp, leave for 30 mins, wash off.</li>\n</ol>\n<h4>How It Works</h4>\n<p>Eucalyptus oil contains cineole (also called eucalyptol) as its primary active compound  clinically studied for its antimicrobial, anti-inflammatory, and decongestant properties. When inhaled, it opens nasal passages and soothes the respiratory tract. When applied topically, it creates a cooling sensation that numbs pain receptors and reduces inflammation in muscles and joints.</p>\n<h4>Why Buy From Us?</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Sourced directly from Nilgiri villages not factory-blended generics</li>\n<li>Steam distilled in small batches retains maximum therapeutic potency</li>\n<li>No added chemicals, fillers, or synthetic fragrance</li>\n<li>Every batch from the same trusted Nilgiri farms since inception</li>\n<li>Most affordable pure Nilgiri Oil online priced for everyday families</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Who Can Use This?</h4>\n<p>Suitable for adults and children above 6 years. Safe for daily use when properly diluted. Widely used by families, wellness practitioners, aromatherapists, and people with chronic respiratory conditions.</p>\n<h4>Restrictions</h4>\n<p>Not recommended for children under 2 years near the face area. Do not ingest. Do not apply undiluted directly on broken skin.</p>\n<h4>Precautions / Notes</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Always dilute with carrier oil (coconut, almond) before topical application.</li>\n<li>Perform a patch test on inner wrist before first use.</li>\n<li>Keep away from eyes and mucous membranes.</li>\n<li>Pregnant women and nursing mothers should consult a doctor before use.</li>\n<li>Store in a cool, dry place away from direct sunlight.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Frequently Asked Questions</h3>\n#sp-ea-2195 .spcollapsing { height: 0; overflow: hidden; transition-property: height;transition-duration: 300ms;}#sp-ea-2195.sp-easy-accordion&gt;.sp-ea-single {margin-bottom: 10px; border: 1px solid #e2e2e2; }#sp-ea-2195.sp-easy-accordion&gt;.sp-ea-single&gt;.ea-header a {color: #444;}#sp-ea-2195.sp-easy-accordion&gt;.sp-ea-single&gt;.sp-collapse&gt;.ea-body {background: #fff; color: #444;}#sp-ea-2195.sp-easy-accordion&gt;.sp-ea-single {background: #eee;}#sp-ea-2195.sp-easy-accordion&gt;.sp-ea-single&gt;.ea-header a .ea-expand-icon { float: left; color: #444;font-size: 16px;}<h3><i></i> What are the primary health benefits of Nilgiri oil (Eucalyptus oil)?</h3> <p>Nilgiri oil is clinically valued for its powerful anti-inflammatory, antimicrobial, and analgesic properties. It is most commonly used for instant respiratory relief from colds and congestion, soothing muscle and joint pain, and promoting dental health. Additionally, its invigorating aroma is used in aromatherapy to reduce stress and improve mental clarity.</p><h3><i></i> How do I use eucalyptus oil for cold and cough relief?</h3> <p>The most effective method is steam inhalation: add 2–5 drops of pure eucalyptus oil to a bowl of hot water, cover your head with a towel, and breathe in the vapors for 5–10 minutes. For chest congestion, you can also dilute the oil with a carrier oil like coconut oil and gently massage it onto the chest and throat before bedtime.</p><h3><i></i> Can I apply eucalyptus oil directly to my skin?</h3> <p>No, you should never apply undiluted eucalyptus oil directly to the skin as it is highly concentrated and can cause irritation or chemical burns. Always dilute 3–5 drops of essential oil with at least one tablespoon of a carrier oil, such as almond or coconut oil, before topical application.</p><h3><i></i> Is eucalyptus oil good for hair growth and dandruff?</h3> <p>Yes, eucalyptus oil promotes hair growth by stimulating blood circulation to the scalp and strengthening hair follicles. Its antifungal properties make it an excellent natural remedy for dandruff and itchy scalp when 2-3 drops are mixed into your regular shampoo or a carrier oil for a scalp massage.</p><h3><i></i> How can I identify 100% pure steam-distilled eucalyptus oil?</h3> <p>Look for oil labeled as “100% pure” or “therapeutic grade” that is packaged in a bottle to prevent light degradation. Authentic Ooty eucalyptus oil is traditionally steam-distilled in small batches from fresh leaves and should have a sharp, camphoraceous aroma without any synthetic chemical undertones.</p><h3><i></i> Is eucalyptus oil safe for children and infants?</h3> <p>Eucalyptus oil should not be used on or diffused around infants and children under the age of 6 without professional medical guidance. The high cineole content can cause respiratory distress in very young children; always store the bottle out of reach of children to avoid accidental ingestion.</p><h3><i></i> Does eucalyptus oil have an expiry date?</h3> <p>Yes, eucalyptus oil typically has a shelf life of 2 to 3 years when stored in a cool, dark place in an airtight glass bottle. Over time, exposure to light and air can cause the oil to oxidize, leading to a loss of its therapeutic potency and a change in its distinct aroma.</p><h3><i></i> Can eucalyptus oil be used in a diffuser or humidifier?</h3> <p>Yes, adding 5–7 drops of eucalyptus oil to a diffuser can help purify the air, eliminate household odors, and support easier breathing while you sleep. Ensure you use it in a well-ventilated room and limit sessions to 30–45 minutes to avoid overexposure to the concentrated aroma.</p><h3><i></i> What is the difference between Nilgiri oil and regular eucalyptus oil?</h3> <p>“Nilgiri oil” specifically refers to eucalyptus oil sourced from the Nilgiri Hills (Blue Mountains) of South India, which has been famous for its high-quality production since 1843. Nilgiri-sourced oil is often preferred for its purity and traditional small-batch steam distillation methods, which preserve a superior therapeutic profile compared to mass-produced factory blends.</p><h3><i></i> Can eucalyptus oil help with muscle and joint pain?</h3> <p>Eucalyptus oil acts as a natural analgesic and counter-irritant that creates a cooling and then warming sensation on the skin, distracting from deeper pain. It is widely used in Ayurvedic liniments to reduce inflammation and stiffness associated with arthritis, rheumatism, and sports injuries.</p>','[{\"label\":\"Available types\",\"value\":\"Bottle, Spray, Roll-on, Set of 3\"},{\"label\":\"Available sizes\",\"value\":\"10ml, 30ml, 60ml, 100ml, 200ml, 500ml\"},{\"label\":\"Category\",\"value\":\"Essential Oils\"},{\"label\":\"Packed & shipped from\",\"value\":\"Ooty, The Nilgiris\"},{\"label\":\"Price\",\"value\":\"Inclusive of GST\"}]','Eucalyptus Oil | Eucalyptus Oil Price | 100% Pure Nilgiri Eucalyptus Essential Oil eucalyptus eucalyptus essential oil eucalyptus oil eucalyptus oil cost eucalyptus oil essential oil eucalyptus oil price eucalyptus use nilgiri oil Relief Oils',100.00,110.00,278,1,1,1,0,'2026-11-10 10:16:05','2026-11-17 09:41:01'),(49,5,12,'Geranium Oil','geranium-oil',NULL,'Pure Geranium Essential Oil from Ooty Originals — 10ml. Balances skin, reduces ageing, repels insects, and regulates scalp oil production. Used in aromatherapy for stress and mood support.','<h4>About This Product</h4>\n<p>Ooty Originals Geranium Essential Oil is a sweet, floral oil with powerful anti-ageing, skin-balancing, and stress-relieving properties — one of the most versatile oils in natural skincare and aromatherapy.</p>\n<p>At Ooty Originals, we bring you the gentle floral essence of nature with our premium geranium oil, carefully sourced and crafted from the serene environment of the Nilgiris. Known for its refreshing fragrance and balancing properties, our geranium essential oil captures the purity and richness of natural botanicals. Each bottle is thoughtfully distilled to preserve its natural aroma and therapeutic benefits, making it a perfect addition to your wellness and self-care routine.</p>\n<p>Our geranium oil is widely appreciated for its beautiful geranium scent, which is both uplifting and calming. Often described as a natural geranium perfume, it offers a soft floral fragrance that enhances mood and creates a soothing atmosphere. Many customers use it as a daily aromatic companion, whether in diffusers, personal care products, or relaxation rituals. As a versatile geranium aroma oil, it helps reduce stress, improve emotional balance, and promote a sense of well-being.</p>\n<p>At Ooty Originals, we ensure that our geranium essential oil is free from harmful additives and synthetic chemicals. This commitment to purity makes it suitable for various applications, including skincare and aromatherapy. When used in diluted form, geranium oil helps support healthy skin by balancing oil production, improving texture, and promoting a natural glow. Its gentle nature makes it suitable for all skin types, adding to its popularity among those seeking natural solutions.</p>\n<p>The unique floral profile of geranium oil also makes it a preferred choice for those who enjoy natural fragrances. Its resemblance to a light and refreshing geranium perfume makes it an excellent alternative to synthetic scents. Whether you want to create a calming home environment or enhance your personal care routine, our geranium aroma oil offers a natural and effective solution.</p>\n<p>If you are looking to buy geranium essential oil, Ooty Originals provides a trusted and convenient platform to access authentic products. Our website makes it easy to buy geranium oil directly from a reliable source that values quality and customer satisfaction. With growing demand for natural oils, many customers prefer to purchase online, and we ensure a seamless and secure experience.</p>\n<p>Our products are available as geranium oil for sale, offering premium quality at a reasonable value. Each bottle is carefully packaged to maintain freshness and preserve the natural properties of the oil. We focus on delivering consistency and excellence, ensuring that every customer receives a product they can trust.</p>\n<p>Choosing Ooty Originals means embracing nature’s purity and tradition. Our geranium essential oil is more than just a fragrance—it is a natural solution designed to support relaxation, beauty, and overall wellness. From its soothing aroma to its skin-friendly properties, geranium oil fits effortlessly into your daily lifestyle.</p>\n<p>Experience the elegance of natural fragrance and make the right choice to buy geranium essential oil from Ooty Originals today. Let the calming geranium scent and the richness of pure botanical extracts enhance your everyday routine with freshness, balance, and care.</p>\n<h4>Key Benefits</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Reduces fine lines, wrinkles, and signs of skin ageing</li>\n<li>Balances oily skin by regulating sebum production</li>\n<li>Prevents skin infections with antiseptic properties</li>\n<li>Natural insect repellent — deters mosquitoes and ticks</li>\n<li>Promotes hair health by nourishing follicles</li>\n<li>Reduces inflammation in joints and muscles (anti-inflammatory)</li>\n<li>Uplifts mood and reduces stress in aromatherapy</li>\n<li>Naturally fragrant — used in artisan perfumes and skincare</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>How to Use / How to Apply</h4>\n<ol>\n<li>Skincare: Mix 2–3 drops in facial serum or moisturiser.</li>\n<li>Aromatherapy: Diffuse 4–5 drops for emotional balance.</li>\n<li>Scalp care: Mix 5 drops in coconut oil and massage weekly.</li>\n<li>Joint pain: Dilute in carrier oil and massage affected area.</li>\n<li>Insect repellent: Dilute and apply to exposed skin or diffuse outdoors.</li>\n</ol>\n<h4>How It Works</h4>\n<p>Geranium oil’s primary active compound, citronellol, acts as both an antimicrobial and insect repellent. Geraniol regulates sebum production in skin glands, making it ideal for oily or acne-prone skin. These compounds also modulate inflammatory pathways, providing relief from arthritis pain and skin irritation.</p>\n<h4>Why Buy From Us?</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>High-quality botanical geranium oil — not diluted with cheaper carriers</li>\n<li>Premium 10ml amber bottle for optimal storage</li>\n<li>Multi-benefit: skin, hair, insect repelling, and aromatherapy</li>\n<li>Affordable for a premium floral essential oil</li>\n<li>Part of Ooty Originals’ trusted 10ml aromatherapy collection</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Who Can Use This?</h4>\n<p>Adults interested in natural skincare, aromatherapy, or natural alternatives to insect repellents. Recommended for those with oily or combination skin.</p>\n<h4>Restrictions</h4>\n<p>More research is needed for medicinal claims. Do not use as a replacement for medical treatment.</p>\n<h4>Precautions / Notes</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Dilute before applying to skin.</li>\n<li>Patch test before facial application.</li>\n<li>Do not ingest.</li>\n<li>Pregnant women should consult a doctor.</li>\n<li>Avoid eye contact.</li>\n</ul>','[{\"label\":\"Category\",\"value\":\"Essential Oils\"},{\"label\":\"Packed & shipped from\",\"value\":\"Ooty, The Nilgiris\"},{\"label\":\"Price\",\"value\":\"Inclusive of GST\"}]',NULL,450.00,475.00,40,1,0,0,0,'2026-11-10 10:16:05','2026-11-10 10:16:05'),(50,5,12,'Lavender Oil','lavender-oil',NULL,'Pure Lavender Essential Oil from Ooty Originals — 10ml. Clinically studied for stress relief, sleep improvement, and skin healing. Natural insect repellent. Ideal for diffusers, skincare, and bath rituals.','<h4>About This Product</h4>\n<p>Ooty Originals Lavender Essential Oil is one of the most extensively studied essential oils in the world — widely trusted for its calming, sleep-inducing, pain-relieving, and skin-healing properties.</p>\n<p>At Ooty Originals, we bring you the calming essence of nature with our premium lavender oil, sourced and crafted with care from the serene landscapes of the Nilgiris. Known for its soothing fragrance and therapeutic benefits, our lavender essential oil is a perfect blend of purity and tradition. Carefully distilled to retain its natural properties, this oil is designed to support relaxation, beauty, and overall well-being.</p>\n<p>Our lavender oil is widely appreciated as a natural lavender aromatherapy oil that helps reduce stress and promote restful sleep. Its gentle and refreshing aroma creates a peaceful environment, making it ideal for use in diffusers, massage, or daily relaxation rituals. Many customers also refer to it as a lavender aroma oil because of its long-lasting fragrance that uplifts mood and enhances mental clarity.</p>\n<p>When it comes to hair care, our lavender oil for hair is a natural solution to nourish the scalp and strengthen hair strands. It helps reduce dryness, supports healthy hair growth, and leaves your hair feeling soft and refreshed. Regular use can improve scalp health and add a natural shine, making it a valuable addition to your hair care routine. The lightweight texture ensures easy absorption without leaving a greasy residue.</p>\n<p>At Ooty Originals, we are committed to delivering authentic products that are free from harmful chemicals and synthetic additives. Our lavender essential oil is carefully processed to preserve its natural benefits, ensuring that you experience true quality in every drop. Whether you are using it for aromatherapy, skincare, or hair care, our lavender oil is designed to fit seamlessly into your daily lifestyle.</p>\n<p>If you are planning to buy lavender oil, Ooty Originals offers a trusted and convenient platform to explore premium-quality options. Our website makes it easy to buy lavender essential oil directly from a reliable source that values authenticity and customer satisfaction. With increasing demand for natural wellness products, many customers prefer to shop online, and we ensure a smooth and secure experience.</p>\n<p>We also provide clear information about lavender essential oil price and lavender oil price, helping you make an informed decision based on quality and value. Our products are available as lavender oil for sale, giving you access to high-quality oils at reasonable prices without compromising purity. Each bottle is carefully packaged to maintain freshness and delivered efficiently to your doorstep.</p>\n<p>Choosing Ooty Originals means embracing a natural approach to wellness backed by tradition and trust. Our lavender oil is more than just a product—it is a reflection of calmness, purity, and care. Whether you are looking to relax after a long day, improve your hair health, or create a soothing environment, our lavender aromatherapy oil is the perfect companion.</p>\n<p>Experience the gentle power of nature and make the right choice to buy lavender oil from Ooty Originals today. Let the soothing aroma and natural benefits of lavender essential oil enhance your daily routine and bring balance to your life.</p>\n<h4>Key Benefits</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Reduces stress and anxiety — most widely used calming essential oil</li>\n<li>Significantly improves sleep quality and helps with insomnia</li>\n<li>Treats acne, eczema, and psoriasis with its anti-inflammatory properties</li>\n<li>Relieves headaches, muscle pain, and migraines topically</li>\n<li>Natural insect repellent — particularly effective against mosquitoes and moths</li>\n<li>Improves respiratory function when diffused</li>\n<li>Enhances mood and promotes emotional wellbeing</li>\n<li>Supports wound healing and reduces inflammation</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>How to Use / How to Apply</h4>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Sleep:</strong> Add 5–6 drops to your diffuser or sprinkle 2 drops on your pillow.</li>\n<li><strong>Stress relief:</strong> Apply 2 drops to your wrists and inhale deeply.</li>\n<li><strong>Skin care:</strong> Mix 3 drops in 1 tsp aloe vera gel; apply on acne or irritated skin.</li>\n<li><strong>Pain relief:</strong> Dilute with carrier oil and massage on sore muscles or temples.</li>\n<li><strong>Bath ritual:</strong> Add 8–10 drops to warm bathwater for a calming soak.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>How It Works</h4>\n<p>Lavender oil contains linalool and linalyl acetate — compounds proven to interact with the GABA neurotransmitter system, producing sedative and anxiolytic effects without dependency risks. These compounds also inhibit the growth of bacteria and fungi, making lavender effective for acne and wound healing. When applied topically, it reduces inflammatory cytokines that cause redness and swelling.</p>\n<h4>Why Buy From Us?</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Pure lavender essential oil — not blended with synthetic linalool</li>\n<li>Perfect for diffusers, skincare, massage, and bath use</li>\n<li>10ml format — ideal for personal use and gifting</li>\n<li>No synthetic fragrance — the aroma is entirely from the natural oil</li>\n<li>Competitively priced within the Ooty Originals aromatherapy range</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Who Can Use This?</h4>\n<p>All ages (adults, children above 5, and elderly). Particularly popular with people who struggle with stress, anxiety, insomnia, or skin sensitivity.</p>\n<h4>Restrictions</h4>\n<p>While generally safe, concentrated lavender should be diluted for topical use. Not recommended in high doses for boys under puberty age (there are rare reports of hormonal effects).</p>\n<h4>Precautions / Notes</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Always dilute with carrier oil before applying to skin.</li>\n<li>Perform a patch test before first use.</li>\n<li>Do not ingest unless food-grade and guided by a practitioner.</li>\n<li>Pregnant women should avoid concentrated doses — use sparingly in diffuser.</li>\n<li>Store away from light and heat.</li>\n</ul>','[{\"label\":\"Category\",\"value\":\"Essential Oils\"},{\"label\":\"Packed & shipped from\",\"value\":\"Ooty, The Nilgiris\"},{\"label\":\"Price\",\"value\":\"Inclusive of GST\"}]',NULL,290.00,310.00,40,1,0,0,0,'2026-11-10 10:16:05','2026-11-10 10:16:05'),(51,5,12,'Lemongrass Oil','lemongrass-oil',NULL,'100% pure Lemongrass Essential Oil from Ooty Originals — grown in the Nilgiris and extracted traditionally. Anti-inflammatory, antibacterial, and antifungal. Perfect for pain relief, gastritis, diffuser use, and skincare. Available 30ml–500ml.','<h4>About This Product</h4>\n<p>Ooty Originals Lemongrass Essential Oil is sourced from fresh lemongrass plants cultivated in the Nilgiri region, known for its medicinal properties. It is one of the most versatile oils in the Ayurvedic and aromatherapy traditions of South India.</p>\n<h4>Key Benefits</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Relieves headaches and migraines with topical application</li>\n<li>Fights bacteria and fungal infections</li>\n<li>Reduces inflammation in joints and muscles</li>\n<li>Aids digestion and soothes gastritis when consumed diluted</li>\n<li>Promotes relaxation and reduces anxiety in aromatherapy</li>\n<li>Natural insect repellent — keeps mosquitoes and ants away</li>\n<li>Tones and cleanses oily skin</li>\n<li>Relieves rheumatoid arthritis symptoms with massage</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>How to Use / How to Apply</h4>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Massage:</strong> Mix with jojoba or coconut oil (1:1) and apply to painful areas.</li>\n<li><strong>Gastritis:</strong> Add 1 drop to a cup of warm water or herbal tea — consume with care.</li>\n<li><strong>Diffuser:</strong> Add 4–6 drops to your diffuser for stress relief and insect repelling.</li>\n<li><strong>Skin toner:</strong> Dilute 2–3 drops in 50ml water and apply with cotton on oily skin.</li>\n<li><strong>Foot soak:</strong> Add 5–6 drops to warm water and soak feet for 15 minutes.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>How It Works</h4>\n<p>Lemongrass oil contains citral, myrcene, and limonene as its primary actives. Citral has strong antibacterial and antifungal properties. Myrcene acts as a natural sedative and analgesic. Together, they make this oil effective for pain, infections, and stress. When ingested in very small quantities (1 drop in warm tea), it soothes the stomach lining and reduces acidity.</p>\n<h4>Why Buy From Us?</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Nilgiri-grown lemongrass — distinct aroma and superior citral content</li>\n<li>Traditional cold-processing retains full therapeutic spectrum</li>\n<li>Multi-purpose oil — works for 8+ different health uses</li>\n<li>Available in 5 convenient sizes — from travel 30ml to value 500ml</li>\n<li>No dilution or fillers — pure oil, exactly as nature intended</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Who Can Use This?</h4>\n<p>Suitable for adults and children above 10 years (external use). Widely used in Ayurvedic practice, aromatherapy, natural skincare routines, and home cooking (1 drop in tea).</p>\n<h4>Restrictions</h4>\n<p>Avoid undiluted skin application. Do not use near eyes. Ingestion only recommended in trace amounts (1 drop in tea).</p>\n<h4>Precautions / Notes</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Never apply undiluted essential oils to skin — always use with a carrier oil.</li>\n<li>Pregnant women should consult a doctor before oral use.</li>\n<li>Those with sensitive skin should do a patch test before use.</li>\n<li>Keep away from eyes, ears, and open wounds.</li>\n<li>Do not give to children under 10 for internal use.</li>\n</ul>','[{\"label\":\"Available types\",\"value\":\"Bottle, Spray\"},{\"label\":\"Available sizes\",\"value\":\"10ml, 30ml, 60ml, 100ml, 200ml, 500ml\"},{\"label\":\"Category\",\"value\":\"Essential Oils\"},{\"label\":\"Packed & shipped from\",\"value\":\"Ooty, The Nilgiris\"},{\"label\":\"Price\",\"value\":\"Inclusive of GST\"}]',NULL,115.00,120.00,240,1,0,0,0,'2026-11-10 10:16:05','2026-11-10 10:16:05'),(52,5,12,'Natural Jasmine Oil','natural-jasmine-oil',NULL,'Pure Jasmine Essential Oil from Ooty Originals — 10ml. Moisturises skin, reduces scars, induces sleep, promotes hair growth, and uplifts mood. India’s most loved floral essential oil.','<h4>About This Product</h4>\n<p>Ooty Originals Natural Jasmine Essential Oil captures the warm, intoxicatingly sweet aroma of jasmine flowers — widely used in Ayurvedic beauty rituals, aromatherapy, hair care, and as a natural perfume ingredient.</p>\n<h4>Key Benefits</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Moisturises and anti-ages skin — reduces scars and blemishes</li>\n<li>Promotes relaxation and reduces stress and anxiety</li>\n<li>Improves sleep quality — ideal for insomnia</li>\n<li>Nourishes scalp and promotes hair growth</li>\n<li>Unique floral perfume — used in high-end fragrances</li>\n<li>Eases muscle tension during massage</li>\n<li>Uplifts mood and promotes emotional wellbeing</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>How to Use / How to Apply</h4>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Skincare:</strong> Mix 2–3 drops in your night cream or serum; apply before sleep.</li>\n<li><strong>Sleep:</strong> Diffuse 4–5 drops or add 2 drops to your pillow for better sleep.</li>\n<li><strong>Hair:</strong> Mix 5 drops in 2 tbsp coconut oil; massage into scalp and hair.</li>\n<li><strong>Perfume:</strong> Apply 1–2 drops diluted in jojoba oil to pulse points.</li>\n<li><strong>Massage:</strong> Blend with carrier oil for a relaxing body massage.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>How It Works</h4>\n<p>Jasmine’s primary compounds — benzyl acetate, linalool, and indole — stimulate the release of serotonin and other neurotransmitters that regulate mood, sleep, and relaxation. Benzyl benzoate, another component, has excellent emollient properties that help skin retain moisture and improve texture over time.</p>\n<h4>Why Buy From Us?</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Pure botanical jasmine essential oil — not fragrance oil</li>\n<li>Versatile for beauty, aromatherapy, and perfumery</li>\n<li>Beautiful aromatic profile — feminine, warm, and deeply relaxing</li>\n<li>10ml amber bottle for preserved potency</li>\n<li>Certified natural — part of the Ooty Originals aromatherapy 10ml range</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Who Can Use This?</h4>\n<p>Adults who enjoy floral aromatherapy, those seeking natural sleep aids, or people wanting to add a natural floral oil to their skincare routine.</p>\n<h4>Restrictions</h4>\n<p>Pregnant women should use with caution as jasmine oil may stimulate uterine contractions in concentrated use.</p>\n<h4>Precautions / Notes</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Dilute before skin application.</li>\n<li>Pregnant women should consult a doctor before use.</li>\n<li>Patch test before applying to face.</li>\n<li>Do not ingest.</li>\n<li>Keep away from eyes and children under 5.</li>\n</ul>','[{\"label\":\"Category\",\"value\":\"Essential Oils\"},{\"label\":\"Packed & shipped from\",\"value\":\"Ooty, The Nilgiris\"},{\"label\":\"Price\",\"value\":\"Inclusive of GST\"}]',NULL,290.00,300.00,40,1,0,0,0,'2026-11-10 10:16:05','2026-11-10 10:16:05'),(53,5,12,'Orange Oil','orange-oil',NULL,'Pure Sweet Orange Essential Oil from Ooty Originals — 10ml. Uplifts mood, purifies the air, repels insects, disinfects surfaces, and flavours food. One of the most cheerful and useful essential oils.','<h4>About This Product</h4>\n<p>Ooty Originals Orange Essential Oil is cold-pressed from the peel of sweet oranges — delivering an instantly uplifting citrus aroma with practical uses in aromatherapy, cleaning, skincare, cooking, and insect repelling.</p>\n<h4>Key Benefits</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Uplifts mood and reduces stress — most cheerful aromatherapy oil</li>\n<li>Natural household antibacterial cleaner</li>\n<li>Repels insects — can be used in diffusers and bug sprays</li>\n<li>Brightens and tones skin with antioxidant properties</li>\n<li>Used as natural flavouring in food and beverages</li>\n<li>Polishes wood furniture naturally</li>\n<li>Removes adhesive residue and grease stains</li>\n<li>Promotes positive and energetic atmosphere when diffused</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>How to Use / How to Apply</h4>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Aromatherapy:</strong> Diffuse 5–6 drops for an uplifting, happy atmosphere.</li>\n<li><strong>Cleaning:</strong> Add 10–15 drops to 200ml water in a spray bottle; use as a surface cleaner.</li>\n<li><strong>Skincare:</strong> Mix 2 drops in your moisturiser — brightens complexion.</li>\n<li><strong>Wood polish:</strong> Apply 3–5 drops on a cloth and polish wooden furniture.</li>\n<li><strong>Flavoring:</strong> Add 1 drop to baked goods or beverages (food-grade use).</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>How It Works</h4>\n<p>Orange oil’s dominant compound, limonene (over 90%), is a powerful antioxidant and antibacterial agent. Limonene also stimulates the production of glutathione (the body’s master antioxidant) when inhaled. Its uplifting olfactory effect is mediated through stimulation of serotonin production in the limbic system.</p>\n<h4>Why Buy From Us?</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Cold-pressed for maximum limonene content and fresh aroma</li>\n<li>Multi-purpose: aromatherapy, cleaning, cooking, and skincare</li>\n<li>High-concentration — a little goes a long way</li>\n<li>Part of Ooty Originals’ versatile 10ml aromatherapy range</li>\n<li>Priced affordably for everyday household use</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Who Can Use This?</h4>\n<p>Entire family — adults, children above 5, and even used in cooking. One of the safest and most cheerful essential oils.</p>\n<h4>Restrictions</h4>\n<p>Photosensitive — do not apply to skin and expose to direct sunlight within 12 hours (may cause skin darkening).</p>\n<h4>Precautions / Notes</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Avoid applying to skin before sun exposure — phototoxic risk.</li>\n<li>Dilute before topical skin application.</li>\n<li>Keep away from eyes.</li>\n<li>Patch test before first use.</li>\n<li>Store in a dark bottle away from heat.</li>\n</ul>','[{\"label\":\"Category\",\"value\":\"Essential Oils\"},{\"label\":\"Packed & shipped from\",\"value\":\"Ooty, The Nilgiris\"},{\"label\":\"Price\",\"value\":\"Inclusive of GST\"}]',NULL,290.00,300.00,40,1,0,0,0,'2026-11-10 10:16:05','2026-11-10 10:16:05'),(54,5,12,'Peppermint Oil','peppermint-oil',NULL,'Pure Peppermint Essential Oil from Ooty Originals — 10ml. Relieves headaches, soothes muscle pain, clears respiratory congestion, boosts mental clarity, and repels insects. 100% natural.','<h4>About This Product</h4>\n<p>Ooty Originals Peppermint Essential Oil is one of the most versatile and widely researched essential oils in the world — offering proven benefits for headache relief, respiratory health, focus, pain relief, and natural insect repelling.</p>\n<h4>Key Benefits</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Relieves headaches and migraines with topical application</li>\n<li>Soothes nausea and vomiting — especially motion sickness</li>\n<li>Boosts mental clarity and improves concentration</li>\n<li>Relieves muscle pain, joint soreness, and tension</li>\n<li>Natural insect repellent — deters mosquitoes, ants, and spiders</li>\n<li>Opens airways — excellent for asthma and respiratory congestion</li>\n<li>Freshens breath and supports oral hygiene</li>\n<li>Reduces stress and anxiety through aromatherapy</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>How to Use / How to Apply</h4>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Headache:</strong> Dilute 2 drops in carrier oil; apply to temples, forehead, and neck.</li>\n<li><strong>Nausea:</strong> Inhale directly from the bottle or add 3 drops to a diffuser.</li>\n<li><strong>Mental focus:</strong> Diffuse 4–5 drops in your study or work area.</li>\n<li><strong>Muscle pain:</strong> Mix with coconut oil (1:5) and massage onto sore muscles.</li>\n<li><strong>Steam inhalation:</strong> Add 3 drops to hot water bowl; inhale with towel over head.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>How It Works</h4>\n<p>Menthol (the primary compound in peppermint oil) acts on the TRPM8 receptor in the skin — the same receptor responsible for the cooling sensation. This creates an analgesic effect that blocks pain signals. When inhaled, menthol acts as a decongestant by reducing mucous membrane inflammation. It also activates the GABA receptors, which reduce anxiety.</p>\n<h4>Why Buy From Us?</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>High menthol content — effective and fast-acting</li>\n<li>Pure botanical peppermint — not synthetic menthol</li>\n<li>10ml is ideal for personal use — over 100 applications per bottle</li>\n<li>Part of Ooty Originals’ curated 10ml Aromatherapy Oil range</li>\n<li>Free from additives — just the essential oil, nothing else</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Who Can Use This?</h4>\n<p>Adults and children above 10 years (diluted use). Suitable for aromatherapy practitioners, students, office workers, athletes, and people with chronic headaches.</p>\n<h4>Restrictions</h4>\n<p>Not for children under 6 years near the face. Do not ingest more than 1 drop diluted in water without medical advice.</p>\n<h4>Precautions / Notes</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Never apply undiluted peppermint oil directly on skin — menthol can burn.</li>\n<li>Avoid applying near eyes, ears, or nostrils of young children.</li>\n<li>Pregnant or nursing women should consult a doctor before use.</li>\n<li>Those with epilepsy or seizure disorders should avoid prolonged inhalation.</li>\n<li>Perform a patch test before first use.</li>\n</ul>','[{\"label\":\"Category\",\"value\":\"Essential Oils\"},{\"label\":\"Packed & shipped from\",\"value\":\"Ooty, The Nilgiris\"},{\"label\":\"Price\",\"value\":\"Inclusive of GST\"}]',NULL,290.00,300.00,40,1,0,0,0,'2026-11-10 10:16:05','2026-11-10 10:16:05'),(55,5,12,'Rose Essential Oil','rose-essential-oil',NULL,'Pure Rose Essential Oil from Ooty Originals — 10ml. The queen of essential oils for skincare, mood enhancement, pain relief, and natural perfumery. 100% botanical rose oil.','<h4>About This Product</h4>\n<p>Ooty Originals Rose Essential Oil is a luxurious, botanically-derived essential oil valued for its extraordinary fragrance, profound skincare benefits, mood-enhancing properties, and gentle pain-relieving effects.</p>\n<h4>Key Benefits</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Deeply hydrates and nourishes skin — reduces fine lines and dryness</li>\n<li>Powerful mood enhancer — reduces stress and promotes emotional balance</li>\n<li>Natural aphrodisiac — enhances romantic ambience in aromatherapy</li>\n<li>Relieves headaches, muscle pain, and menstrual discomfort</li>\n<li>Improves digestion when used aromatically</li>\n<li>Reduces the appearance of scars, stretch marks, and blemishes</li>\n<li>Used in high-end perfumery and cosmetic products</li>\n<li>Calming and romantic aroma ideal for diffusers and bath rituals</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>How to Use / How to Apply</h4>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Skincare:</strong> Mix 2–3 drops in your moisturiser or face serum; apply at night.</li>\n<li><strong>Aromatherapy:</strong> Diffuse 3–5 drops for emotional balance and romantic ambience.</li>\n<li><strong>Bath:</strong> Add 6–8 drops to warm bathwater for luxurious relaxation.</li>\n<li><strong>Perfume:</strong> Apply 1–2 drops diluted in carrier oil to pulse points.</li>\n<li><strong>Pain relief:</strong> Mix with carrier oil and massage on temples or abdomen.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>How It Works</h4>\n<p>Rose oil’s primary active compounds — citronellol, geraniol, and nerol — interact with the limbic system (the brain’s emotional centre), explaining its profound mood-enhancing and anxiolytic effects. These compounds also inhibit lipid peroxidation in skin cells, protecting against premature ageing and improving skin barrier function.</p>\n<h4>Why Buy From Us?</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Authentic botanical rose oil — not synthetic rose fragrance</li>\n<li>Luxuriously aromatic — the most premium of our 10ml range</li>\n<li>Multi-benefit: skincare, aromatherapy, perfumery, and pain relief</li>\n<li>Beautiful amber packaging — makes an excellent personal gift</li>\n<li>Part of the Ooty Originals certified natural aromatherapy collection</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Who Can Use This?</h4>\n<p>Adults of all skin types. Particularly recommended for those seeking natural anti-ageing skincare, emotional wellbeing support, or natural perfume alternatives.</p>\n<h4>Restrictions</h4>\n<p>Consult a healthcare professional before using therapeutically during pregnancy.</p>\n<h4>Precautions / Notes</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Dilute before topical use — high-potency oil.</li>\n<li>Conduct a patch test before use on face.</li>\n<li>Not for internal use without professional guidance.</li>\n<li>Keep away from eyes.</li>\n<li>Store in a cool, dark place to preserve the delicate aroma.</li>\n</ul>','[{\"label\":\"Category\",\"value\":\"Essential Oils\"},{\"label\":\"Packed & shipped from\",\"value\":\"Ooty, The Nilgiris\"},{\"label\":\"Price\",\"value\":\"Inclusive of GST\"}]',NULL,290.00,300.00,40,1,0,0,0,'2026-11-10 10:16:05','2026-11-10 10:16:05'),(56,5,12,'Rosehip Oil','rosehip-oil',NULL,'Pure Rosehip Seed Oil from Ooty Originals — 10ml. Rich in Vitamin A (retinol) and Vitamin C. Reduces wrinkles, scars, acne marks, sun damage, and stretch marks. India’s most effective natural anti-ageing oil.','<h4>About This Product</h4>\n<p>Ooty Originals Rosehip Oil is extracted from the seeds of wild rose bushes — a botanical goldmine of Vitamins A, C, and E, along with essential fatty acids that repair, brighten, and rejuvenate skin from within.</p>\n<h4>Key Benefits</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Reduces wrinkles, fine lines, and age spots with natural retinol (Vitamin A)</li>\n<li>Minimises acne scars and surgical scars over time</li>\n<li>Brightens and evens out skin tone with Vitamin C</li>\n<li>Repairs sun-damaged skin</li>\n<li>Reduces stretch marks with regular use</li>\n<li>Deeply moisturises dry and dehydrated skin</li>\n<li>Strengthens nails and cuticles</li>\n<li>Conditions and adds shine to hair</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>How to Use / How to Apply</h4>\n<ol>\n<li>Anti-ageing: Apply 3–4 drops on cleansed face at night; gently pat in.</li>\n<li>Scar treatment: Apply 2–3 drops directly on scars twice daily.</li>\n<li>Stretch marks: Massage on affected area twice daily after bathing.</li>\n<li>Under-eye area: Apply 1–2 drops gently around the eye area at night.</li>\n<li>Hair: Apply a few drops to ends and mid-lengths for shine and moisture.</li>\n</ol>\n<h4>How It Works</h4>\n<p>Rosehip oil contains trans-retinoic acid (Vitamin A derivative) that stimulates collagen and elastin production — the structural proteins responsible for firm, youthful skin. Vitamin C inhibits melanin production, reducing hyperpigmentation and dark spots. The essential fatty acids (omega-3 and omega-6) rebuild the skin barrier and promote cellular regeneration.</p>\n<h4>Why Buy From Us?</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>High trans-retinoic acid content — superior anti-ageing potency</li>\n<li>Cold-pressed from wild rose seeds — maximum nutritional integrity</li>\n<li>One of the most researched and recommended natural anti-ageing oils</li>\n<li>Premium 10ml amber bottle for optimal preservation</li>\n<li>Part of Ooty Originals’ premium skincare oil range</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Who Can Use This?</h4>\n<p>Adults of all skin types, especially those with ageing concerns, acne scars, sun damage, uneven skin tone, or stretch marks.</p>\n<h4>Restrictions</h4>\n<p>May cause purging in acne-prone skin initially — start with once daily use. Patch test required.</p>\n<h4>Precautions / Notes</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Perform a patch test before first use — especially if you have nut/seed allergies.</li>\n<li>Start with a once-daily application to allow skin to adjust.</li>\n<li>Not for use on active acne lesions.</li>\n<li>Pregnant women should consult a doctor before using the retinol-rich oil.</li>\n<li>Store in the fridge after opening to extend shelf life.</li>\n</ul>','[{\"label\":\"Category\",\"value\":\"Essential Oils\"},{\"label\":\"Packed & shipped from\",\"value\":\"Ooty, The Nilgiris\"},{\"label\":\"Price\",\"value\":\"Inclusive of GST\"}]',NULL,290.00,300.00,40,1,0,0,0,'2026-11-10 10:16:05','2026-11-10 10:16:05'),(57,5,12,'Rosemary Oil','rosemary-oil',NULL,'Pure Rosemary Essential Oil from Ooty Originals — 10ml. Clinically proven to stimulate hair growth, improve memory and focus, relieve muscle pain, and support respiratory health. 100% natural.','<h4>About This Product</h4>\n<p>Ooty Originals Rosemary Essential Oil is extracted from the leaves of Rosmarinus officinalis — a herb with a growing body of clinical evidence for its hair growth-stimulating, focus-enhancing, and pain-relieving properties. At Ooty Originals, we bring you the goodness of nature with our premium rosemary oil, carefully sourced and crafted to support your everyday wellness needs. Extracted from fresh rosemary leaves grown in clean, natural environments, our rosemary essential oil is known for its purity, refreshing aroma, and powerful benefits. Rooted in the serene landscapes of the Nilgiris, our oils are prepared with care to preserve their natural potency and effectiveness.</p>\n<p>Our rosemary oil for hair is one of the most trusted natural solutions for maintaining healthy and strong hair. Rich in antioxidants and essential nutrients, it helps nourish the scalp, improve blood circulation, and strengthen hair from the roots. Many people choose rosemary oil for hair growth as a natural alternative to chemical-based products, as it supports thicker, fuller, and healthier-looking hair over time. With regular use, it can help reduce hair fall, dryness, and dandruff while enhancing overall hair texture.</p>\n<p>At Ooty Originals, we ensure that every bottle of rosemary oil is free from harmful additives and synthetic ingredients. Our focus on quality makes our rosemary essential oil suitable not only for hair care but also for aromatherapy and relaxation. Its refreshing herbal fragrance helps reduce stress, improve focus, and create a calming atmosphere in your home or workspace. This versatility makes rosemary oil an essential part of a natural self-care routine.</p>\n<p>If you are looking to buy rosemary oil, Ooty Originals offers a reliable and convenient platform to access authentic products. Whether you want to rosemary oil buy online or explore natural solutions for your hair care routine, we make the process simple and trustworthy. Customers who want to buy rosemary oil for hair can rely on our commitment to quality and consistency.</p>\n<p>For those specifically focused on hair care benefits, we provide the perfect option to buy rosemary oil for hair growth, ensuring you receive a product that supports long-term results. Our rosemary oil is carefully processed to retain its natural properties, making it effective for both scalp nourishment and overall hair health. Additionally, if you are interested in aromatherapy or wellness applications, you can confidently buy rosemary essential oil from Ooty Originals.</p>\n<p>We understand that choosing the right product is important, which is why we emphasize transparency and authenticity in everything we offer. Our oils are packaged with care to maintain freshness and delivered efficiently to your doorstep. This makes it easy for customers to experience the benefits of rosemary oil without any compromise on quality.</p>\n<p>Choosing Ooty Originals means embracing a natural and holistic approach to beauty and wellness. Our rosemary oil is more than just a product—it is a reflection of purity, tradition, and trust. Whether you are using it to improve hair health or to enjoy its calming aroma, it fits seamlessly into your daily routine.</p>\n<p>Experience the power of nature and make the right choice to buy rosemary oil from Ooty Originals today. Let our premium rosemary essential oil support your journey towards stronger hair, better growth, and overall well-being.</p>\n<h4>Key Benefits</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Stimulates hair follicles and promotes hair growth — clinically studied</li>\n<li>Reduces hair loss and dandruff</li>\n<li>Improves memory, concentration, and mental performance when diffused</li>\n<li>Relieves muscle pain, headaches, and menstrual cramps</li>\n<li>Anti-inflammatory and antimicrobial for skin care</li>\n<li>Supports respiratory health — helpful for coughs and sinusitis</li>\n<li>Natural insect repellent</li>\n<li>Used as a culinary flavouring in Mediterranean cooking</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>How to Use / How to Apply</h4>\n<ol>\n<li>Hair growth: Mix 5 drops in 2 tbsp carrier oil; massage scalp twice weekly.</li>\n<li>Focus &amp; memory: Diffuse 4–6 drops while studying or working.</li>\n<li>Pain relief: Dilute with carrier oil and massage on sore muscles or joints.</li>\n<li>Skin care: Add 2–3 drops to your moisturiser for anti-inflammatory benefits.</li>\n<li>Steam inhalation: Add 3 drops to hot water for respiratory support.</li>\n</ol>\n<h4>How It Works</h4>\n<p>Rosemary oil contains 1,8-cineole and camphor — compounds that improve cerebral blood circulation and stimulate the TRPV channels in hair follicles, promoting the anagen (growth) phase of hair. A landmark 2015 study found rosemary oil performed comparably to minoxidil (a common hair loss drug) in treating androgenetic alopecia after 6 months of use.</p>\n<h4>Why Buy From Us?</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Pure rosemary essential oil — no artificial ingredients or side effects</li>\n<li>Specifically effective for natural hair growth support</li>\n<li>No dilution added — full-strength therapeutic quality</li>\n<li>10ml amber bottle — ideal storage for maximum shelf life</li>\n<li>Part of Ooty Originals’ trusted aromatherapy collection</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Who Can Use This?</h4>\n<p>Adults concerned about hair loss, people who study or work long hours, those with muscle pain, and anyone interested in natural aromatherapy.</p>\n<h4>Restrictions</h4>\n<p>Pregnant and breastfeeding women should avoid rosemary oil due to potential uterine-stimulating effects. People with epilepsy should use with caution.</p>\n<h4>Precautions / Notes</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Always dilute before skin application.</li>\n<li>Not recommended for pregnant or nursing women.</li>\n<li>Those with epilepsy or high blood pressure should consult a doctor.</li>\n<li>Avoid contact with eyes.</li>\n<li>Patch test recommended before scalp application.</li>\n</ul>','[{\"label\":\"Category\",\"value\":\"Essential Oils\"},{\"label\":\"Packed & shipped from\",\"value\":\"Ooty, The Nilgiris\"},{\"label\":\"Price\",\"value\":\"Inclusive of GST\"}]',NULL,290.00,300.00,40,1,0,0,1,'2026-11-10 10:16:05','2026-11-16 11:35:55'),(58,5,12,'Sandal Fragrance Oil','sandal-fragrance-oil',NULL,'Pure Sandalwood Fragrance Oil from Ooty Originals — 10ml. Calming, grounding woody aroma for aromatherapy, meditation, stress relief, skincare, and natural perfumery. 100% botanical-based.','<h4>About This Product</h4>\n<p>Ooty Originals Sandal Fragrance Oil is derived from the wood and bark of the sandalwood tree — one of the most ancient and revered aromatic oils in Ayurvedic and spiritual traditions, used for calming the mind, nourishing skin, and elevating meditation practice.</p>\n<h4>Key Benefits</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Deeply calming aroma — reduces stress, anxiety, and nervous tension</li>\n<li>Enhances focus and spiritual depth during meditation</li>\n<li>Anti-inflammatory and antimicrobial — treats acne and skin conditions</li>\n<li>Used in premium perfumery for its warm, long-lasting woody base note</li>\n<li>Relieves respiratory issues like bronchitis and coughs</li>\n<li>Natural insect repellent</li>\n<li>Promotes mental clarity and emotional grounding</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>How to Use / How to Apply</h4>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Aromatherapy/meditation:</strong> Diffuse 4–6 drops for grounding and focus.</li>\n<li><strong>Skincare:</strong> Mix 2–3 drops in your face moisturiser — soothes inflammation.</li>\n<li><strong>Natural perfume:</strong> Apply 1–2 drops diluted in jojoba to pulse points.</li>\n<li><strong>Stress relief:</strong> Add 8–10 drops to warm bathwater.</li>\n<li><strong>Insect repellent</strong>: Diffuse indoors to deter bugs and mosquitoes.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>How It Works</h4>\n<p>Sandalwood oil’s primary active compound, alpha-santalol, binds to olfactory receptors that stimulate the limbic system — reducing anxiety and promoting mental clarity. It also has significant anti-inflammatory and antimicrobial properties at the cellular level, making it effective for both skin conditions and respiratory support.</p>\n<h4>Why Buy From Us?</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Authentic botanical sandalwood fragrance — deep, woody, and long-lasting</li>\n<li>Multi-purpose: meditation, aromatherapy, perfumery, and skincare</li>\n<li>10ml amber glass bottle for preserved longevity</li>\n<li>More affordable than pure sandalwood essential oil — accessible luxury</li>\n<li>Part of Ooty Originals’ artisan aromatherapy collection</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Who Can Use This?</h4>\n<p>Adults seeking stress relief, meditation aids, natural perfume alternatives, or skin-calming aromatherapy.</p>\n<h4>Restrictions</h4>\n<p>Fragrance oils are for aromatherapy and topical use (diluted). Not for ingestion.</p>\n<h4>Precautions / Notes</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Dilute before topical use.</li>\n<li>Patch test before skin application.</li>\n<li>Do not ingest.</li>\n<li>Keep away from eyes.</li>\n<li>Pregnant women should consult a doctor before using concentrated amounts.</li>\n</ul>','[{\"label\":\"Category\",\"value\":\"Essential Oils\"},{\"label\":\"Packed & shipped from\",\"value\":\"Ooty, The Nilgiris\"},{\"label\":\"Price\",\"value\":\"Inclusive of GST\"}]',NULL,290.00,300.00,40,1,0,0,0,'2026-11-10 10:16:05','2026-11-10 10:16:05'),(59,5,12,'Tea Tree Oil','tea-tree-oil',NULL,'Pure Tea Tree Essential Oil from Ooty Originals — 10ml. Nature’s most powerful antibacterial, antifungal, and antiviral essential oil. Treats acne, dandruff, oral health, and household germs naturally.','<h4>About This Product</h4>\n<p>Ooty Originals Tea Tree Essential Oil is one of the most clinically researched essential oils — proven effective against a wide range of bacteria, fungi, and viruses, making it a go-to natural remedy for acne, dandruff, oral infections, and household cleaning.</p>\n<p>At Ooty Originals, we bring you the purity of nature with our premium tea tree oil, carefully sourced and crafted to deliver powerful natural care. Known for its antibacterial and antifungal properties, tea tree oil has been a trusted solution for skin and hair concerns for generations. Extracted with precision to preserve its natural potency, our oil reflects the freshness and authenticity of the Nilgiris.</p>\n<p>Our tea tree oil for hair is a highly effective natural remedy for maintaining a healthy scalp. It helps cleanse the scalp, reduce excess oil, and promote stronger hair from the roots. Many customers rely on tea tree oil for dandruff as it works to eliminate flakes, soothe irritation, and restore scalp balance. Regular use can leave your hair feeling clean, refreshed, and visibly healthier.</p>\n<p>In skincare, our tea tree oil for face is widely appreciated for its ability to combat acne, reduce blemishes, and support clear skin. Its natural purifying properties help unclog pores and control excess oil without causing dryness. Lightweight and fast-absorbing, tea tree oil fits easily into daily skincare routines, making it a popular choice for those seeking natural and effective solutions.</p>\n<p>At Ooty Originals, we ensure that every bottle of tea tree oil is free from harmful chemicals and synthetic additives. Our focus on quality and authenticity makes our product suitable for a variety of uses, including aromatherapy and personal care. Whether you are using it for hair, skin, or general wellness, our tea tree oil is designed to deliver consistent and reliable results.</p>\n<p>If you are looking to buy tea tree oil, Ooty Originals offers a trusted platform to access premium-quality products. Our website makes it easy to tea tree oil buy online, giving you the convenience of shopping from a reliable source. Customers who want to buy tea tree oil near me can also benefit from our efficient delivery network, ensuring that the product reaches them quickly and safely.</p>\n<p>With increasing demand for natural wellness products, many people prefer to explore tea tree oil online, and we provide a seamless and secure shopping experience. Our products are available as tea tree oil for sale, offering great value without compromising on quality. Each bottle is carefully packaged to maintain freshness and preserve the natural effectiveness of the oil.</p>\n<p>Choosing Ooty Originals means choosing purity, tradition, and trust. Our tea tree oil is more than just a product—it is a natural solution designed to support healthy hair, clear skin, and overall well-being. We are committed to delivering products that align with your lifestyle and help you embrace the benefits of nature.</p>\n<p>Experience the refreshing and healing power of tea tree oil and make the right choice to buy tea tree oil from Ooty Originals today. Let nature take care of your hair and skin with a product that is crafted with care and backed by authenticity.</p>\n<h4>Key Benefits</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Treats acne, blackheads, and skin blemishes effectively</li>\n<li>Eliminates dandruff and fungal scalp conditions</li>\n<li>Natural household disinfectant — effective against common bacteria</li>\n<li>Natural insect repellent for mosquitoes, ticks, and pests</li>\n<li>Promotes oral health — kills bacteria that cause bad breath and cavities</li>\n<li>Used in aromatherapy for relaxation and stress relief</li>\n<li>Anti-inflammatory for skin rashes and eczema</li>\n<li>Antiviral properties — supports immune defence</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>How to Use / How to Apply</h4>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Acne spot treatment:</strong> Dilute 1 drop in carrier oil; apply directly on pimple.</li>\n<li><strong>Dandruff:</strong> Add 5 drops to your regular shampoo; massage in and rinse.</li>\n<li><strong>Household cleaner:</strong> Add 10 drops to 200ml water in a spray bottle; use on surfaces.</li>\n<li><strong>Oral health:</strong> Add 1 drop to a glass of water as a mouthwash — do not swallow.</li>\n<li><strong>Diffuser:</strong> Add 4–5 drops to purify air and repel insects.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>How It Works</h4>\n<p>Tea tree oil’s primary active compound, terpinen-4-ol (minimum 30%), disrupts the cell membranes of bacteria, fungi, and viruses. This mechanism is broad-spectrum — effective against MRSA, Candida, and various skin pathogens. Its anti-inflammatory action comes from the suppression of TNF-α and interleukins, reducing redness and swelling.</p>\n<h4>Why Buy From Us?</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>High terpinen-4-ol content — the marker of therapeutic-grade tea tree oil</li>\n<li>Pure and concentrated — most effective per drop</li>\n<li>Versatile for skincare, haircare, cleaning, and aromatherapy</li>\n<li>10ml amber bottle for optimal preservation</li>\n<li>Affordable and long-lasting — part of the Ooty Originals aromatherapy range</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Who Can Use This?</h4>\n<p>Adults and teenagers with acne-prone skin, dandruff, or hygiene concerns. Also ideal for households looking to reduce chemical cleaning products.</p>\n<h4>Restrictions</h4>\n<p>Never ingest tea tree oil — it is toxic when swallowed. Not for internal use in any quantity.</p>\n<h4>Precautions / Notes</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Always dilute before skin application — undiluted tea tree can cause irritation.</li>\n<li>Do not swallow — toxic if ingested.</li>\n<li>Not suitable for pets — toxic to cats and dogs.</li>\n<li>Pregnant women should use only diffusers with moderation.</li>\n<li>Conduct a patch test before use on sensitive skin.</li>\n</ul>','[{\"label\":\"Category\",\"value\":\"Essential Oils\"},{\"label\":\"Packed & shipped from\",\"value\":\"Ooty, The Nilgiris\"},{\"label\":\"Price\",\"value\":\"Inclusive of GST\"}]',NULL,380.00,400.00,40,1,0,0,0,'2026-11-10 10:16:05','2026-11-10 10:16:05'),(60,5,12,'Ylang Ylang Oil','ylang-ylang-oil',NULL,'Pure Ylang Ylang Essential Oil from Ooty Originals — 10ml. Relieves stress, promotes hair growth, balances skin, and uplifts mood. A staple in luxury perfumes and aromatherapy.','<h4>About This Product</h4>\n<p>Ooty Originals Ylang Ylang Essential Oil is extracted from the flowers of the Cananga odorata tree — one of the most treasured aromatic oils in perfumery and holistic wellness, known for its mood-lifting, hair-growing, and skin-balancing properties.</p>\n<h4>Key Benefits</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Reduces stress, anxiety, and nervous tension in aromatherapy</li>\n<li>Promotes hair growth and conditions the scalp</li>\n<li>Balances oily and combination skin</li>\n<li>Reduces fine lines and improves skin elasticity</li>\n<li>Sweet, exotic floral fragrance — used in luxury perfumes</li>\n<li>Natural insect repellent effect</li>\n<li>Encourages relaxation and romantic ambience</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>How to Use / How to Apply</h4>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Aromatherapy:</strong> Diffuse 3–5 drops for stress relief and mood lifting.</li>\n<li><strong>Hair:</strong> Mix 5 drops in coconut oil; massage scalp and leave for 30 mins.</li>\n<li><strong>Perfume:</strong> Apply 1 drop diluted in jojoba oil behind ears or on wrists.</li>\n<li><strong>Skincare:</strong> Mix 2–3 drops in your moisturiser for anti-ageing benefits.</li>\n<li><strong>Bath:</strong> Add 6–8 drops to warm bathwater.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>How It Works</h4>\n<p>Ylang ylang oil contains linalool and benzyl acetate — proven anxiolytic compounds that reduce cortisol (stress hormone) levels and lower heart rate when inhaled. These compounds also modulate sebum production in the scalp and skin, making the oil effective for oily skin and dry scalp without over-drying.</p>\n<h4>Why Buy From Us?</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Pure botanical ylang ylang — not synthetic fragrance</li>\n<li>Authentic floral aroma with therapeutic potency</li>\n<li>Multi-use: perfumery, aromatherapy, haircare, and skincare</li>\n<li>10ml amber glass for maximum preservation</li>\n<li>Part of Ooty Originals’ trusted aromatherapy oil collection</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Who Can Use This?</h4>\n<p>Adults looking for a natural stress-relief oil, luxury home fragrance, or natural hair and skin care support.</p>\n<h4>Restrictions</h4>\n<p>Use in moderation — excessive inhalation of ylang ylang can cause headaches. Start with 2–3 drops.</p>\n<h4>Precautions / Notes</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Use in well-ventilated spaces — too much can cause nausea.</li>\n<li>Dilute before skin application.</li>\n<li>Pregnant women should consult a doctor before use.</li>\n<li>Patch test before use on face or scalp.</li>\n<li>Keep away from children under 5.</li>\n</ul>','[{\"label\":\"Category\",\"value\":\"Essential Oils\"},{\"label\":\"Packed & shipped from\",\"value\":\"Ooty, The Nilgiris\"},{\"label\":\"Price\",\"value\":\"Inclusive of GST\"}]',NULL,390.00,400.00,40,1,0,0,0,'2026-11-10 10:16:05','2026-11-10 10:16:05'),(61,5,12,'Olive Oil','olive-oil',NULL,'100% pure Olive Oil from Ooty Originals — ideal for hair care, skin nourishment, and body massage. Rich in vitamins, antioxidants, and healthy fatty acids. Available in 30ml to 500ml.','<h4>About This Product</h4>\n<p>Ooty Originals Pure Olive Oil is a premium-grade, natural oil that deeply moisturises skin, nourishes hair, and supports overall skin health — free from any additives, preservatives, or synthetic ingredients.</p>\n<h4>Key Benefits</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Deeply nourishes and hydrates skin — suitable for face and body</li>\n<li>Adds shine and reduces frizz in hair with regular use</li>\n<li>Promotes healthy hair growth from the root</li>\n<li>Rich in Vitamin E, K, and antioxidants — fights free radical damage</li>\n<li>Excellent body massage oil — non-greasy and fast-absorbing</li>\n<li>Helps soothe eczema, psoriasis, and dry skin conditions</li>\n<li>Gentle enough for baby massage</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>How to Use / How to Apply</h4>\n<ol>\n<li>Face: Apply 4–5 drops as a night moisturiser; massage gently.</li>\n<li>Hair: Warm slightly and massage into scalp and hair; leave for 30–45 minutes, then wash.</li>\n<li>Body: Apply post-shower on damp skin for maximum absorption.</li>\n<li>Lip care: Dab a small amount on lips for overnight hydration.</li>\n<li>Baby massage: Use diluted (mixed with coconut oil) for gentle infant massages.</li>\n</ol>\n<h4>How It Works</h4>\n<p>Olive oil contains squalene, oleocanthal, and polyphenols — compounds that mimic the skin’s natural oils, making it highly compatible with human skin. Squalene acts as an emollient that seals moisture. Oleocanthal has anti-inflammatory properties comparable to ibuprofen. Polyphenols provide powerful antioxidant protection against UV damage and premature ageing.</p>\n<h4>Why Buy From Us?</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Pure, unblended olive oil — not diluted with cheaper oils</li>\n<li>Can be taken internally — food-grade quality</li>\n<li>Available in 5 sizes — from travel to family economy size</li>\n<li>No mineral oil, paraffin, or synthetic additives</li>\n<li>Part of Ooty Originals’ trusted wellness oil range</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Who Can Use This?</h4>\n<p>All skin types. Safe for adults, children, and babies. Particularly beneficial for people with dry, sensitive, or ageing skin.</p>\n<h4>Restrictions</h4>\n<p>Those with olive pollen allergies may experience sensitivity. Patch test recommended before widespread use.</p>\n<h4>Precautions / Notes</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Always do a small patch test before applying to face or sensitive skin.</li>\n<li>For acne-prone skin, use sparingly and observe skin reaction.</li>\n<li>Keep away from eyes.</li>\n<li>Store in a dark glass container away from heat.</li>\n<li>Use within 12 months of opening.</li>\n</ul>','[{\"label\":\"Available sizes\",\"value\":\"30ml, 60ml, 100ml\"},{\"label\":\"Category\",\"value\":\"Essential Oils\"},{\"label\":\"Packed & shipped from\",\"value\":\"Ooty, The Nilgiris\"},{\"label\":\"Price\",\"value\":\"Inclusive of GST\"}]',NULL,130.00,145.00,120,1,0,0,0,'2026-11-10 10:16:05','2026-11-10 10:16:05'),(62,5,12,'Heena Oil','heena-oil',NULL,'Pure Henna (Heena) Oil from Ooty Originals — made from the leaves of the henna plant. Strengthens hair, prevents breakage, reduces dandruff, and nourishes skin. Safe for all hair types. Available 30ml–500ml.','<h4>About This Product</h4>\n<p>Ooty Originals Pure Heena Oil is derived from the leaves of the henna plant (Lawsonia inermis) — a botanical used in Indian beauty traditions for centuries to promote strong, thick, healthy hair and nourished skin.</p>\n<h4>Key Benefits</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Strengthens hair roots and prevents breakage</li>\n<li>Promotes hair growth with regular scalp massages</li>\n<li>Reduces dandruff and scalp itchiness</li>\n<li>Conditions and moisturises dry, damaged hair</li>\n<li>Soothes inflamed or irritated scalp</li>\n<li>Natural moisturiser for dry skin</li>\n<li>Aromatherapeutic — relieves stress and anxiety</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>How to Use / How to Apply</h4>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Hair care:</strong> Massage into scalp and along hair shaft; leave for 30–60 mins before washing.</li>\n<li><strong>Overnight treatment:</strong> Apply to scalp and wrap with a warm towel; wash off in the morning.</li>\n<li><strong>Skin care:</strong> Apply a small amount to dry patches and massage gently.</li>\n<li><strong>Aromatherapy:</strong> Add 4–5 drops to a diffuser for a calming effect.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>How It Works</h4>\n<p>Henna oil is rich in phenolic compounds, including lawsone (2-hydroxy-1,4-naphthoquinone), which binds to the keratin protein in hair and strengthens each strand. Its anti-inflammatory and antifungal properties address dandruff and scalp conditions at the root level. Regular application improves hair’s tensile strength and shine.</p>\n<h4>Why Buy From Us?</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Pure extraction — no synthetic fragrance or colour</li>\n<li>External use only — clearly labelled for safe use</li>\n<li>Available in multiple sizes for all usage patterns</li>\n<li>Trusted part of Ooty Originals’ ayurvedic oil range</li>\n<li>Affordable pricing for a premium natural product</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Who Can Use This?</h4>\n<p>Suitable for all hair types and skin types. Especially beneficial for those with dry, brittle, or thinning hair. Safe for adults and teenagers.</p>\n<h4>Restrictions</h4>\n<p>For external use only. Not for internal consumption.</p>\n<h4>Precautions / Notes</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Patch test recommended before first use — particularly for sensitive scalps.</li>\n<li>Pregnant women should consult a doctor before use.</li>\n<li>Avoid contact with eyes.</li>\n<li>Keep in a cool, dry place.</li>\n<li>Do not ingest.</li>\n</ul>','[{\"label\":\"Available sizes\",\"value\":\"30ml, 60ml, 100ml, 500ml\"},{\"label\":\"Category\",\"value\":\"Essential Oils\"},{\"label\":\"Packed & shipped from\",\"value\":\"Ooty, The Nilgiris\"},{\"label\":\"Price\",\"value\":\"Inclusive of GST\"}]',NULL,130.00,145.00,160,1,0,0,0,'2026-11-10 10:16:05','2026-11-10 10:16:05'),(63,5,12,'Neem Oil','neem-oil',NULL,'100% pure Neem Oil from Ooty Originals. Natural remedy for acne, eczema, dandruff, fungal infections, and scalp health. Also the most effective organic pesticide for plants and gardens. Available 30ml–500ml.','<h4>About This Product</h4>\n<p>Ooty Originals Pure &amp; Natural Neem Oil is extracted from the seeds of the neem tree — one of Ayurveda’s most powerful medicinal plants — offering a multi-purpose solution for skin problems, hair care, organic gardening, and pet care.</p>\n<h4>Key Benefits</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Treats acne, eczema, psoriasis, and skin infections</li>\n<li>Eliminates dandruff and promotes scalp health</li>\n<li>Natural organic pesticide — protects plants without harming bees</li>\n<li>Treats fungal infections like athlete’s foot and nail fungus</li>\n<li>Natural flea, tick, and mite repellent for pets</li>\n<li>Powerful antimicrobial for household cleaning</li>\n<li>Promotes oral health — used in some Ayurvedic toothpastes</li>\n<li>Anti-inflammatory — soothes irritated and inflamed skin</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>How to Use / How to Apply</h4>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Skin care:</strong> Dilute 2–3 drops in 1 tsp coconut oil; apply on affected areas twice daily.</li>\n<li><strong>Scalp/hair:</strong> Mix with coconut oil (1:10 ratio); massage into scalp. Leave 30 mins, wash off.</li>\n<li><strong>Plant care:</strong> Dilute 5ml in 1 litre water with a few drops of dish soap; spray on plants.</li>\n<li><strong>Fungal infections:</strong> Apply diluted neem oil on affected nail or skin area twice daily.</li>\n<li><strong>Pet care:</strong> Add 2–3 drops to pet shampoo for tick and flea protection.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>How It Works</h4>\n<p>Neem oil’s primary bioactive compound is azadirachtin, which disrupts the life cycle of insects and fungi at a cellular level — making it one of nature’s most comprehensive natural pesticides and antifungals. The compound nimbin provides strong anti-inflammatory and antipyretic benefits, while gedunin has proven antifungal properties for skin and nail conditions.</p>\n<h4>Why Buy From Us?</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Unrefined, cold-pressed — full-spectrum azadirachtin content retained</li>\n<li>Multipurpose: skin, hair, plants, pets — one bottle, many uses</li>\n<li>Free from chemical processing or dilution</li>\n<li>External use labelled clearly for safe home use</li>\n<li>Trusted by organic farmers, Ayurvedic practitioners, and pet owners</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Who Can Use This?</h4>\n<p>Adults, gardeners, pet owners, and those with chronic skin or scalp conditions. For children above 5 years (diluted, external use only).</p>\n<h4>Restrictions</h4>\n<p>For external use only. Do not ingest undiluted neem oil. Not recommended for pregnant women without medical supervision.</p>\n<h4>Precautions / Notes</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Always dilute before skin application — concentrated neem oil can irritate.</li>\n<li>Patch test required — strong oil that may cause reactions in sensitive individuals.</li>\n<li>Do not apply near eyes or mucous membranes.</li>\n<li>The strong smell is natural and indicates purity — use in well-ventilated spaces.</li>\n<li>Keep out of reach of children.</li>\n</ul>','[{\"label\":\"Available sizes\",\"value\":\"30ml, 60ml, 100ml, 500ml\"},{\"label\":\"Category\",\"value\":\"Essential Oils\"},{\"label\":\"Packed & shipped from\",\"value\":\"Ooty, The Nilgiris\"},{\"label\":\"Price\",\"value\":\"Inclusive of GST\"}]',NULL,130.00,145.00,160,1,0,0,0,'2026-11-10 10:16:05','2026-11-10 10:16:05'),(64,1,NULL,'Darmona Estate Premium Tea','darmona-estate-premium-tea',NULL,'Darmona Estate Premium Tea is a high-quality Nilgiri tea, grown and harvested in India. It is carefully dried and ground into a fine powder, making it easy to prepare. Its rich, earthy flavor is the perfect way to start your morning or end your day.','<p>Darmona Estate Premium Tea is a high-quality Nilgiri tea, grown and harvested in India. It is carefully dried and ground into a fine powder, making it easy to prepare. Its rich, earthy flavor is the perfect way to start your morning or end your day. Enjoy a cup of Darmona Estate Premium Tea and experience the fresh, natural taste of India. Shop at Ooty Originals for authentic Nilgiri products with high quality and quick delivery!</p>','[{\"label\":\"Available sizes\",\"value\":\"250g, 500g\"},{\"label\":\"Category\",\"value\":\"Nilgiri Teas\"},{\"label\":\"Packed & shipped from\",\"value\":\"Ooty, The Nilgiris\"},{\"label\":\"Price\",\"value\":\"Inclusive of GST\"}]',NULL,180.00,NULL,80,1,0,0,0,'2026-11-10 10:16:05','2026-11-10 10:16:05'),(65,