y sip.</p>\n<p>Enjoy the convenience of quick delivery right to your doorstep, making it easier than ever to indulge in this premium tea.</p>','[{\"label\":\"Available sizes\",\"value\":\"250g, 500g\"},{\"label\":\"Category\",\"value\":\"Nilgiri Teas\"},{\"label\":\"Packed & shipped from\",\"value\":\"Ooty, The Nilgiris\"},{\"label\":\"Price\",\"value\":\"Inclusive of GST\"}]',NULL,125.00,NULL,80,1,0,0,0,'2026-11-10 10:16:05','2026-11-10 10:16:05'),(67,1,NULL,'Chamraj Nilgiri Leaf Tea','chamraj-nilgiri-leaf-tea',NULL,'Experience the exceptional taste of CHAMRAJ Nilgiri Leaf Tea, a high-quality black tea sourced from the Nilgiri region, renowned for its distinct characteristics and flavor profile.','<p>Experience the exceptional taste of CHAMRAJ Nilgiri Leaf Tea, a high-quality black tea sourced from the Nilgiri region, renowned for its distinct characteristics and flavor profile.</p>\n<p>At Ooty Originals, your destination to buy Authentic Nilgiri Products with high quality and quick delivery, we offer this exquisite tea made from whole tea leaves that capture the unique and vibrant essence of the southern Indian highlands.</p>\n<p>Perfect for discerning tea lovers seeking purity and depth in every sip, CHAMRAJ Nilgiri Leaf Tea embodies a refreshing and robust flavor, making every cup a delight. Savour the authentic Nilgiri experience with assurance in quality and swift delivery from Ooty Originals.</p>','[{\"label\":\"Available sizes\",\"value\":\"250g, 500g\"},{\"label\":\"Category\",\"value\":\"Nilgiri Teas\"},{\"label\":\"Packed & shipped from\",\"value\":\"Ooty, The Nilgiris\"},{\"label\":\"Price\",\"value\":\"Inclusive of GST\"}]',NULL,135.00,140.00,40,1,0,0,0,'2026-11-10 10:16:05','2026-11-10 10:16:05'),(68,1,NULL,'Homedale Tea 500g','homedale-tea-500g',NULL,'Homedale teas are made from hand-picked young shoots, the two leaves and bud that sprout from the very tip of the evergreen Camellia Sinensis bush which produce the most flavorful cup.','<p>Homedale teas are made from hand-picked young shoots, the two leaves and bud that sprout from the very tip of the evergreen <em>Camellia Sinensis</em> bush which produce the most flavorful cup.</p>\n<p>Our teas retain their unique essential oils and are therefore full-bodied and deliciously aromatic. When brewed, the leaves unfold luxuriantly, gently unveiling their complex character, and producing aromatic cups that delight and please the senses.</p>\n<p>Homedale teas come to you freshly plucked straight from the garden and delivered within weeks of manufacture. We make sure to select only the best produce of the season, and our teas are marked by a distinct seasonal character relished by tea connoisseurs everywhere. Long-time consumers appreciate the unmistakable spirit of the Nilgiris palpable in every sip of Homedale tea.</p>','[{\"label\":\"Available sizes\",\"value\":\"250g, 500g\"},{\"label\":\"Category\",\"value\":\"Nilgiri Teas\"},{\"label\":\"Packed & shipped from\",\"value\":\"Ooty, The Nilgiris\"},{\"label\":\"Price\",\"value\":\"Inclusive of GST\"}]',NULL,200.00,NULL,40,1,0,0,0,'2026-11-10 10:16:05','2026-11-10 10:16:05'),(69,5,14,'Lemongrass Oil Spray','lemongrass-oil-spray',NULL,'100% pure Lemongrass Essential Oil from Ooty Originals — grown in the Nilgiris and extracted traditionally. Anti-inflammatory, antibacterial, and antifungal. Perfect for pain relief, gastritis, diffuser use, and skincare. You are now buying the 10ml Roll-On','<h4>About This Product</h4>\n<p>Ooty Originals Lemongrass Essential Oil is sourced from fresh lemongrass plants cultivated in the Nilgiri region, known for its medicinal properties. It is one of the most versatile oils in the Ayurvedic and aromatherapy traditions of South India.</p>\n<h4>Key Benefits</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Relieves headaches and migraines with topical application</li>\n<li>Fights bacteria and fungal infections</li>\n<li>Reduces inflammation in joints and muscles</li>\n<li>Aids digestion and soothes gastritis when consumed diluted</li>\n<li>Promotes relaxation and reduces anxiety in aromatherapy</li>\n<li>Natural insect repellent — keeps mosquitoes and ants away</li>\n<li>Tones and cleanses oily skin</li>\n<li>Relieves rheumatoid arthritis symptoms with massage</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>How to Use / How to Apply</h4>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Massage:</strong> Mix with jojoba or coconut oil (1:1) and apply to painful areas.</li>\n<li><strong>Gastritis:</strong> Add 1 drop to a cup of warm water or herbal tea — consume with care.</li>\n<li><strong>Diffuser:</strong> Add 4–6 drops to your diffuser for stress relief and insect repelling.</li>\n<li><strong>Skin toner:</strong> Dilute 2–3 drops in 50ml water and apply with cotton on oily skin.</li>\n<li><strong>Foot soak:</strong> Add 5–6 drops to warm water and soak feet for 15 minutes.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>How It Works</h4>\n<p>Lemongrass oil contains citral, myrcene, and limonene as its primary actives. Citral has strong antibacterial and antifungal properties. Myrcene acts as a natural sedative and analgesic. Together, they make this oil effective for pain, infections, and stress. When ingested in very small quantities (1 drop in warm tea), it soothes the stomach lining and reduces acidity.</p>\n<h4>Why Buy From Us?</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Nilgiri-grown lemongrass — distinct aroma and superior citral content</li>\n<li>Traditional cold-processing retains full therapeutic spectrum</li>\n<li>Multi-purpose oil — works for 8+ different health uses</li>\n<li>Available in 5 convenient sizes — from travel 30ml to value 500ml</li>\n<li>No dilution or fillers — pure oil, exactly as nature intended</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Who Can Use This?</h4>\n<p>Suitable for adults and children above 10 years (external use). Widely used in Ayurvedic practice, aromatherapy, natural skincare routines, and home cooking (1 drop in tea).</p>\n<h4>Restrictions</h4>\n<p>Avoid undiluted skin application. Do not use near eyes. Ingestion only recommended in trace amounts (1 drop in tea).</p>\n<h4>Precautions / Notes</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Never apply undiluted essential oils to skin — always use with a carrier oil.</li>\n<li>Pregnant women should consult a doctor before oral use.</li>\n<li>Those with sensitive skin should do a patch test before use.</li>\n<li>Keep away from eyes, ears, and open wounds.</li>\n<li>Do not give to children under 10 for internal use.</li>\n</ul>','[{\"label\":\"Category\",\"value\":\"Essential Oils\"},{\"label\":\"Packed & shipped from\",\"value\":\"Ooty, The Nilgiris\"},{\"label\":\"Price\",\"value\":\"Inclusive of GST\"}]',NULL,115.00,120.00,40,1,0,0,1,'2026-11-10 10:16:05','2026-11-10 10:16:05'),(70,5,15,'Eucalyptus Oil Roll-On Set of 3 Combo','eucalyptus-oil-roll-on-set-of-3-combo',NULL,'Authentic steam-distilled Eucalyptus Oil sourced from the Nilgiri hills of India. 100% pure, chemical-free, and therapeutic-grade. You are now buying the 10ml roll-on set of 3 as a combo.','<h4>About This Product</h4>\n<p>Ooty Originals Eucalyptus Oil — also known as Nilgiri Oil — is a 100% pure, steam-distilled essential oil hand-collected from eucalyptus trees in the villages of the Nilgiri hills, processed by traditional small-batch oil distilleries. At Ooty Originals, we bring you the refreshing power of the Nilgiris with our Eucalyptus Oil Roll-On Set, thoughtfully crafted to support your everyday wellness. Infused with pure eucalyptus oil, also known as nilgiri oil, this convenient eucalyptus roll on is designed to deliver instant relief and relaxation wherever you are. Combining traditional knowledge with modern convenience, our roll-on set captures the natural strength of eucalyptus in an easy-to-use format.</p>\n<p>Our eucalyptus oil roll on is perfect for those seeking quick and effective relief from headaches, stress, and fatigue. The cooling and soothing properties of eucalyptus oil help calm the mind and ease tension, making it ideal for daily use. Whether you’re at work, traveling, or resting at home, this roll on eucalyptus oil provides a simple and mess-free application that fits seamlessly into your routine.</p>\n<p>The carefully formulated nilgiri oil roll on is known for its refreshing aroma and therapeutic benefits. It works by stimulating the senses, clearing the mind, and promoting a feeling of relaxation. Many customers prefer our eucalyptus oil roll on for headache as a natural alternative to chemical-based solutions. With just a gentle application on the temples or neck, you can experience a calming effect that helps reduce discomfort and restore focus.</p>\n<p>At Ooty Originals, we ensure that every eucalyptus essential oil roll on is made using high-quality ingredients, free from harmful additives. Our oils are sourced and processed with care to retain their natural purity and effectiveness. This commitment to quality allows you to enjoy the true benefits of eucalyptus oil in a safe and reliable form.</p>\n<p>If you are looking to buy eucalyptus oil, our roll-on set offers a practical and ready-to-use solution that combines convenience with authenticity. Customers who prefer online shopping can easily eucalyptus oil buy online through our platform, ensuring a smooth and secure experience. For those searching buy eucalyptus oil near me or eucalyptus oil near me, Ooty Originals provides efficient delivery services that bring our products directly to your doorstep.</p>\n<p>The Eucalyptus Oil Roll-On Set is designed for modern lifestyles, offering portability and ease of use without compromising on quality. Each roll-on is compact, travel-friendly, and perfect for carrying in your bag or pocket. Whether you need quick relief during a busy day or a calming moment during travel, this product is always within reach.</p>\n<p>Choosing Ooty Originals means embracing natural wellness backed by tradition and trust. Our eucalyptus roll on is more than just a product—it is a thoughtful solution designed to support your comfort and well-being. With its soothing aroma and effective formulation, it helps you stay refreshed and relaxed throughout the day.</p>\n<p>Experience the natural benefits of eucalyptus and make the right choice to buy eucalyptus oil from Ooty Originals today. Let the purity of nilgiri oil and the convenience of our eucalyptus oil roll on enhance your daily routine with freshness, clarity, and comfort.</p>\n<h4>Key Benefits</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Relieves cold, congestion &amp; blocked nose — inhale directly or use in steam</li>\n<li>Reduces headache and mental fatigue when applied to temples</li>\n<li>Soothes muscle pain and body aches with topical application</li>\n<li>Promotes dental health — known antibacterial properties</li>\n<li>Helps bring down fever naturally</li>\n<li>Nourishes scalp, reduces dandruff and promotes hair growth</li>\n<li>Heals minor wounds and skin infections faster</li>\n<li>Acts as a natural room freshener and insect repellent</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>How to Use / How to Apply</h4>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Steam inhalation</strong>: Add 3–5 drops to a bowl of hot water, cover head with towel, and inhale for 5–10 minutes.</li>\n<li><strong>Topical for pain:</strong> Dilute 3–4 drops with coconut oil (1:5 ratio) and massage on affected area.</li>\n<li><strong>Headache relief:</strong> Apply 1–2 drops on temples and back of neck; massage gently.</li>\n<li><strong>Diffuser:</strong> Add 5–6 drops to your diffuser for respiratory relief and freshness.</li>\n<li><strong>Hair care:</strong> Mix 5 drops with 2 tbsp coconut oil, massage into scalp, leave for 30 mins, wash off.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>How It Works</h4>\n<p>Eucalyptus oil contains cineole (also called eucalyptol) as its primary active compound — clinically studied for its antimicrobial, anti-inflammatory, and decongestant properties. When inhaled, it opens nasal passages and soothes the respiratory tract. When applied topically, it creates a cooling sensation that numbs pain receptors and reduces inflammation in muscles and joints.</p>\n<h4>Why Buy From Us?</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Sourced directly from Nilgiri villages — not factory-blended generics</li>\n<li>Steam distilled in small batches — retains maximum therapeutic potency</li>\n<li>No added chemicals, fillers, or synthetic fragrance</li>\n<li>Every batch from the same trusted Nilgiri farms since inception</li>\n<li>Most affordable pure Nilgiri Oil online — priced for everyday families</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Who Can Use This?</h4>\n<p>Suitable for adults and children above 6 years. Safe for daily use when properly diluted. Widely used by families, wellness practitioners, aromatherapists, and people with chronic respiratory conditions.</p>\n<h4>Restrictions</h4>\n<p>Not recommended for children under 2 years near the face area. Do not ingest. Do not apply undiluted directly on broken skin.</p>\n<h4>Precautions / Notes</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Always dilute with carrier oil (coconut, almond) before topical application.</li>\n<li>Perform a patch test on inner wrist before first use.</li>\n<li>Keep away from eyes and mucous membranes.</li>\n<li>Pregnant women and nursing mothers should consult a doctor before use.</li>\n<li>Store in a cool, dry place away from direct sunlight.</li>\n</ul>','[{\"label\":\"Category\",\"value\":\"Essential Oils\"},{\"label\":\"Packed & shipped from\",\"value\":\"Ooty, The Nilgiris\"},{\"label\":\"Price\",\"value\":\"Inclusive of GST\"}]',NULL,249.00,285.00,40,1,0,0,0,'2026-11-10 10:16:05','2026-11-10 10:16:05'),(71,5,13,'Wintergreen Oil Roll-on','wintergreen-oil-roll-on',NULL,'Pure Gaultheria (Wintergreen) Oil extracted from the Nilgiri hills of Tamil Nadu. India’s most effective natural relief for muscular pain, joint inflammation, and headaches.','<h4>About This Product</h4>\n<p>Ooty Originals Gaultheria Oil, also known as Wintergreen Oil, is extracted from the leaves of the Gaultheria plant grown in select parts of the Nilgiris — one of the very few regions in India where this rare medicinal herb thrives.</p>\n<h4>Key Benefits</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Provides fast relief from muscular pain and body aches</li>\n<li>Reduces inflammation of joints — effective for arthritis and gout</li>\n<li>Relieves headaches when applied to temples</li>\n<li>Acts as a natural analgesic (pain-numbing) agent</li>\n<li>Improves blood circulation in affected areas</li>\n<li>Helps with knee pain, back pain, and sports injuries</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>How to Use / How to Apply</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Mix Gaultheria oil with warm coconut oil in a 1:1 ratio.</li>\n<li>Apply the blend gently on the painful area — joints, muscles, back, or head.</li>\n<li>Massage in circular motions for 5–10 minutes for deeper penetration.</li>\n<li>Use 2–3 times a day for best results on chronic pain areas.</li>\n<li>For headache: apply 2 drops (diluted) to temples and back of the neck.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>How It Works</h4>\n<p>Gaultheria oil is naturally rich in methyl salicylate (over 90%), a compound closely related to aspirin. When absorbed through the skin, methyl salicylate inhibits prostaglandins — the chemicals responsible for pain and inflammation. This makes Gaultheria one of the most potent natural alternatives for pain relief, particularly for joint and muscle conditions.</p>\n<h4>Why Buy From Us?</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Rare Nilgiri-sourced Gaultheria — not blended with synthetic methyl salicylate</li>\n<li>Traditional extraction methods preserve natural potency</li>\n<li>Best Seller at Ooty Originals — trusted by thousands of repeat buyers</li>\n<li>Available in sizes from 30ml to 500ml — ideal for personal and bulk use</li>\n<li>Competitively priced with free shipping on orders above ₹499</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Who Can Use This?</h4>\n<p>Best suited for adults experiencing muscle pain, joint inflammation, arthritis, sports injuries, and tension headaches. Also popular with physiotherapists and natural health practitioners.</p>\n<h4>Restrictions</h4>\n<p>For external use only. Not for pregnant women, children under 12, or individuals on blood-thinning medications without medical advice. Do not use on broken or irritated skin.</p>\n<h4>Precautions / Notes</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Always dilute with a carrier oil — never apply neat (undiluted) to skin.</li>\n<li>Do not use near eyes, ears, or sensitive mucous membranes.</li>\n<li>Methyl salicylate can be toxic if ingested — keep out of reach of children.</li>\n<li>Those with aspirin sensitivity or salicylate allergy should avoid this oil.</li>\n<li>Consult a doctor before use if you are on anticoagulant medications.</li>\n</ul>','[{\"label\":\"Category\",\"value\":\"Essential Oils\"},{\"label\":\"Packed & shipped from\",\"value\":\"Ooty, The Nilgiris\"},{\"label\":\"Price\",\"value\":\"Inclusive of GST\"}]','Gaultheria Oil | Wintergreen Oil Roll-on',95.00,115.00,40,1,0,0,0,'2026-11-10 10:16:05','2026-11-10 10:16:05'),(72,5,15,'Wintergreen Oil Roll-on Set of 3 Combo','wintergreen-oil-roll-on-set-of-3-combo',NULL,'Pure Gaultheria (Wintergreen) Oil extracted from the Nilgiri hills of Tamil Nadu. India’s most effective natural relief for muscular pain, joint inflammation, and headaches. You are now buying the 10ml roll-on set of 3 as a combo.','<h4>About This Product</h4>\n<p>Ooty Originals Gaultheria Oil, also known as Wintergreen Oil, is extracted from the leaves of the Gaultheria plant grown in select parts of the Nilgiris — one of the very few regions in India where this rare medicinal herb thrives. At Ooty Originals, we bring you the natural strength of the Nilgiris with our Gaultheria/Wintergreen Oil Roll-on Set, a carefully crafted solution designed to support everyday comfort and relaxation. Infused with premium wintergreen oil, also known as gaultheria oil or winter green oil, this roll-on set combines traditional wellness knowledge with modern convenience. Each application delivers the refreshing and soothing properties of nature directly to the areas where you need it most.</p>\n<p>Our roll-on is specially designed to highlight the powerful gaultheria oil benefits, making it an ideal choice for those seeking natural relief from discomf