ls, we combine the power of nature and tradition to create effective wellness solutions like our Eucalyptus, Gaultheria and Migraine Oil Roll-on. Carefully crafted using premium eucalyptus oil, also known as nilgiri oil, along with potent gaultheria oil (commonly referred to as gaultheria wintergreen oil), this blend is designed to provide fast, natural relief from headaches and migraines. Inspired by the purity of the Nilgiris, our roll-on brings together time-tested ingredients in a convenient and easy-to-use format.</p>\n<p>Our specially formulated migraine roll on stick is designed for quick application anytime, anywhere. Whether you are at work, traveling, or at home, the compact design of this migraine stick roll on allows you to apply it directly to your temples, forehead, or neck for instant soothing relief. The cooling and calming effect of eucalyptus oil combined with the warming sensation of gaultheria oil helps relax tension and ease discomfort naturally.</p>\n<p>The use of migraine essential oil roll on products has gained popularity due to their convenience and effectiveness. At Ooty Originals, we ensure that our blend retains the natural strength of each ingredient. Eucalyptus oil, or nilgiri oil, is known for its refreshing aroma and ability to clear the mind, while gaultheria wintergreen oil is valued for its soothing properties that help reduce pain and inflammation. Together, they create a balanced formula that supports relief and relaxation without the need for harsh chemicals.</p>\n<p>If you are looking to buy eucalyptus oil, our roll-on provides the added benefit of a ready-to-use solution that combines multiple therapeutic oils. Customers who prefer convenience can explore options to eucalyptus oil buy online through our platform, ensuring easy access to authentic products. For those searching buy eucalyptus oil near me or eucalyptus oil near me, Ooty Originals offers reliable delivery services that bring our products directly to your doorstep.</p>\n<p>In addition to eucalyptus oil, our formulation includes high-quality gaultheria oil. If you are exploring options to gaultheria oil buy online, our migraine roll-on serves as a practical and effective choice. Many customers often wonder wintergreen oil where to buy, and we provide a trusted solution with our carefully crafted blend. You can also confidently buy wintergreen oil through Ooty Originals, knowing that you are receiving a product that meets high standards of purity and quality.</p>\n<p>Each migraine roll-on stick is designed to deliver consistent results while maintaining the natural integrity of the oils. The easy application and travel-friendly packaging make it a must-have for anyone dealing with frequent headaches or stress-related discomfort. Our focus on authenticity ensures that you experience the true benefits of nilgiri oil and gaultheria wintergreen oil in every use.</p>\n<p>Choosing Ooty Originals means choosing a natural, reliable, and effective approach to wellness. Our Eucalyptus, Gaultheria and Migraine Oil Roll-on is more than just a product—it is a thoughtful blend designed to support your daily comfort and well-being. Experience the soothing power of nature and make the right choice to buy eucalyptus oil and essential oil blends from Ooty Originals today.</p>\n<h4>Key Benefits</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Relieves cold, congestion &amp; blocked nose — inhale directly or use in steam</li>\n<li>Reduces headache and mental fatigue when applied to temples</li>\n<li>Soothes muscle pain and body aches with topical application</li>\n<li>Promotes dental health — known antibacterial properties</li>\n<li>Helps bring down fever naturally</li>\n<li>Nourishes scalp, reduces dandruff and promotes hair growth</li>\n<li>Heals minor wounds and skin infections faster</li>\n<li>Acts as a natural room freshener and insect repellent</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>How to Use / How to Apply</h4>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Steam inhalation</strong>: Add 3–5 drops to a bowl of hot water, cover head with towel, and inhale for 5–10 minutes.</li>\n<li><strong>Topical for pain:</strong> Dilute 3–4 drops with coconut oil (1:5 ratio) and massage on affected area.</li>\n<li><strong>Headache relief:</strong> Apply 1–2 drops on temples and back of neck; massage gently.</li>\n<li><strong>Diffuser:</strong> Add 5–6 drops to your diffuser for respiratory relief and freshness.</li>\n<li><strong>Hair care:</strong> Mix 5 drops with 2 tbsp coconut oil, massage into scalp, leave for 30 mins, wash off.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>How It Works</h4>\n<p>Eucalyptus oil contains cineole (also called eucalyptol) as its primary active compound — clinically studied for its antimicrobial, anti-inflammatory, and decongestant properties. When inhaled, it opens nasal passages and soothes the respiratory tract. When applied topically, it creates a cooling sensation that numbs pain receptors and reduces inflammation in muscles and joints.</p>\n<h4>Why Buy From Us?</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Sourced directly from Nilgiri villages — not factory-blended generics</li>\n<li>Steam distilled in small batches — retains maximum therapeutic potency</li>\n<li>No added chemicals, fillers, or synthetic fragrance</li>\n<li>Every batch from the same trusted Nilgiri farms since inception</li>\n<li>Most affordable pure Nilgiri Oil online — priced for everyday families</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Who Can Use This?</h4>\n<p>Suitable for adults and children above 6 years. Safe for daily use when properly diluted. Widely used by families, wellness practitioners, aromatherapists, and people with chronic respiratory conditions.</p>\n<h4>Restrictions</h4>\n<p>Not recommended for children under 2 years near the face area. Do not ingest. Do not apply undiluted directly on broken skin.</p>\n<h4>Precautions / Notes</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Always dilute with carrier oil (coconut, almond) before topical application.</li>\n<li>Perform a patch test on inner wrist before first use.</li>\n<li>Keep away from eyes and mucous membranes.</li>\n<li>Pregnant women and nursing mothers should consult a doctor before use.</li>\n<li>Store in a cool, dry place away from direct sunlight.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Gaultheria Oil</h3>\n<p>Ooty Originals Gaultheria Oil, also known as Wintergreen Oil, is extracted from the leaves of the Gaultheria plant grown in select parts of the Nilgiris — one of the very few regions in India where this rare medicinal herb thrives.</p>\n<h4>Key Benefits</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Provides fast relief from muscular pain and body aches</li>\n<li>Reduces inflammation of joints — effective for arthritis and gout</li>\n<li>Relieves headaches when applied to temples</li>\n<li>Acts as a natural analgesic (pain-numbing) agent</li>\n<li>Improves blood circulation in affected areas</li>\n<li>Helps with knee pain, back pain, and sports injuries</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>How to Use / How to Apply</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Mix Gaultheria oil with warm coconut oil in a 1:1 ratio.</li>\n<li>Apply the blend gently on the painful area — joints, muscles, back, or head.</li>\n<li>Massage in circular motions for 5–10 minutes for deeper penetration.</li>\n<li>Use 2–3 times a day for best results on chronic pain areas.</li>\n<li>For headache: apply 2 drops (diluted) to temples and back of the neck.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>How It Works</h4>\n<p>Gaultheria oil is naturally rich in methyl salicylate (over 90%), a compound closely related to aspirin. When absorbed through the skin, methyl salicylate inhibits prostaglandins — the chemicals responsible for pain and inflammation. This makes Gaultheria one of the most potent natural alternatives for pain relief, particularly for joint and muscle conditions.</p>\n<h4>Why Buy From Us?</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Rare Nilgiri-sourced Gaultheria — not blended with synthetic methyl salicylate</li>\n<li>Traditional extraction methods preserve natural potency</li>\n<li>Best Seller at Ooty Originals — trusted by thousands of repeat buyers</li>\n<li>Available in sizes from 30ml to 500ml — ideal for personal and bulk use</li>\n<li>Competitively priced with free shipping on orders above ₹499</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Who Can Use This?</h4>\n<p>Best suited for adults experiencing muscle pain, joint inflammation, arthritis, sports injuries, and tension headaches. Also popular with physiotherapists and natural health practitioners.</p>\n<h4>Restrictions</h4>\n<p>For external use only. Not for pregnant women, children under 12, or individuals on blood-thinning medications without medical advice. Do not use on broken or irritated skin.</p>\n<h4>Precautions / Notes</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Always dilute with a carrier oil — never apply neat (undiluted) to skin.</li>\n<li>Do not use near eyes, ears, or sensitive mucous membranes.</li>\n<li>Methyl salicylate can be toxic if ingested — keep out of reach of children.</li>\n<li>Those with aspirin sensitivity or salicylate allergy should avoid this oil.</li>\n<li>Consult a doctor before use if you are on anticoagulant medications.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Migraine Oil</h3>\n<p>The Ooty Originals Migraine Oil is a therapeutic blend of essential oils — including peppermint, lavender, and eucalyptus — formulated specifically to relieve the debilitating symptoms of migraines, tension headaches, and nausea.</p>\n<h4>Key Benefits</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Relieves migraine and headache pain fast</li>\n<li>Reduces nausea commonly associated with migraines</li>\n<li>Calms the mind and reduces stress — a key migraine trigger</li>\n<li>Improves sleep quality, helping prevent stress-induced migraines</li>\n<li>Portable roll-on format — apply anytime, anywhere</li>\n<li>100% natural — no synthetic drugs or chemicals</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>How to Use / How to Apply</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Apply roll-on/oil to both temples and gently massage in circular motion.</li>\n<li>Roll across the forehead and back of the neck for tension relief.</li>\n<li>Breathe in the aroma deeply for 30–60 seconds for nausea relief.</li>\n<li>Apply to wrists for a subtle, continuous calming effect.</li>\n<li>Use at the first sign of a migraine for best results.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>How It Works</h4>\n<p>The formulation combines the cooling analgesic effect of peppermint (menthol blocks pain receptors), the calming anxiolytic properties of lavender, and the decongestant benefits of eucalyptus oil. Together, they address the four main migraine triggers: pain, nausea, stress, and sensory overload — all through topical absorption and aroma inhalation.</p>\n<h4>Why Buy From Us?</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Specifically formulated for migraine relief — not just a generic roll-on</li>\n<li>Best Seller at Ooty Originals with high repeat purchase rate</li>\n<li>All-natural ingredients — no parabens, no alcohol, no synthetic fragrance</li>\n<li>Slim, pocket-friendly design — fits in any bag</li>\n<li>Priced at just ₹150 — most affordable natural migraine remedy online</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Who Can Use This?</h4>\n<p>Suitable for adults and teenagers who experience migraines, tension headaches, stress-related headaches, or motion sickness. Also beneficial for those who want a drug-free alternative to pain relief.</p>\n<h4>Restrictions</h4>\n<p>Not a substitute for prescribed medical treatment. If migraines are frequent or severe, consult a neurologist.</p>\n<h4>Precautions / Notes</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Avoid contact with eyes — roll around, not directly on, the eye socket.</li>\n<li>Do not use it on children under 6 years without medical advice.</li>\n<li>Pregnant or nursing women should consult a doctor before use.</li>\n<li>Perform a patch test before first use if you have sensitive skin.</li>\n<li>Do not ingest.</li>\n</ul>','[{\"label\":\"Category\",\"value\":\"Essential Oils\"},{\"label\":\"Packed & shipped from\",\"value\":\"Ooty, The Nilgiris\"},{\"label\":\"Price\",\"value\":\"Inclusive of GST\"}]',NULL,299.00,340.00,40,1,0,0,0,'2026-11-10 10:16:05','2026-11-10 10:16:05'),(76,5,15,'Lemongrass Oil Spray Set of 3 Combo','lemongrass-oil-spray-set-of-3-combo',NULL,'100% pure Lemongrass Essential Oil from Ooty Originals — grown in the Nilgiri