d effectiveness. Each bottle reflects our commitment to delivering authentic products that align with a healthy and sustainable lifestyle. This dedication makes our spray a dependable choice for those seeking natural insect protection.</p>\n<p>If you are searching for a reliable lemongrass bug spray, Ooty Originals offers a trusted solution that blends tradition with modern convenience. Our spray also works as a lemongrass essential oil bug spray, giving you the added benefit of aromatherapy while keeping insects at bay. The refreshing scent not only protects but also enhances the overall ambiance of your space.</p>\n<p>For those exploring natural remedies, lemon grass for mosquitoes has long been recognized as an effective solution. Our Lemongrass Oil Spray Set brings this traditional knowledge into a ready-to-use format that fits seamlessly into your lifestyle. Whether you are at home, traveling, or spending time outdoors, this spray provides reliable protection and comfort.</p>\n<p>Each product in the set is designed for convenience, portability, and consistent performance. The easy-to-use spray bottles ensure that you can apply the product quickly whenever needed. With Ooty Originals, you can trust that every purchase delivers freshness, quality, and authenticity.</p>\n<p>Choosing Ooty Originals means choosing a natural approach to everyday protection. Our Lemongrass Oil Spray Set is more than just a repellent—it is a reflection of our commitment to providing safe, effective, and eco-friendly solutions. Experience the refreshing power of lemongrass and enjoy a cleaner, more comfortable environment every day.</p>\n<p>Bring home the goodness of nature with Ooty Originals and let our lemongrass spray for mosquitoes protect your space while adding a touch of freshness to your surroundings.</p>\n<h4>Key Benefits</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Relieves headaches and migraines with topical application</li>\n<li>Fights bacteria and fungal infections</li>\n<li>Reduces inflammation in joints and muscles</li>\n<li>Aids digestion and soothes gastritis when consumed diluted</li>\n<li>Promotes relaxation and reduces anxiety in aromatherapy</li>\n<li>Natural insect repellent — keeps mosquitoes and ants away</li>\n<li>Tones and cleanses oily skin</li>\n<li>Relieves rheumatoid arthritis symptoms with massage</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>How to Use / How to Apply</h4>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Massage:</strong> Mix with jojoba or coconut oil (1:1) and apply to painful areas.</li>\n<li><strong>Gastritis:</strong> Add 1 drop to a cup of warm water or herbal tea — consume with care.</li>\n<li><strong>Diffuser:</strong> Add 4–6 drops to your diffuser for stress relief and insect repelling.</li>\n<li><strong>Skin toner:</strong> Dilute 2–3 drops in 50ml water and apply with cotton on oily skin.</li>\n<li><strong>Foot soak:</strong> Add 5–6 drops to warm water and soak feet for 15 minutes.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>How It Works</h4>\n<p>Lemongrass oil contains citral, myrcene, and limonene as its primary actives. Citral has strong antibacterial and antifungal properties. Myrcene acts as a natural sedative and analgesic. Together, they make this oil effective for pain, infections, and stress. When ingested in very small quantities (1 drop in warm tea), it soothes the stomach lining and reduces acidity.</p>\n<h4>Why Buy From Us?</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Nilgiri-grown lemongrass — distinct aroma and superior citral content</li>\n<li>Traditional cold-processing retains full therapeutic spectrum</li>\n<li>Multi-purpose oil — works for 8+ different health uses</li>\n<li>Available in 5 convenient sizes — from travel 30ml to value 500ml</li>\n<li>No dilution or fillers — pure oil, exactly as nature intended</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Who Can Use This?</h4>\n<p>Suitable for adults and children above 10 years (external use). Widely used in Ayurvedic practice, aromatherapy, natural skincare routines, and home cooking (1 drop in tea).</p>\n<h4>Restrictions</h4>\n<p>Avoid undiluted skin application. Do not use near eyes. Ingestion only recommended in trace amounts (1 drop in tea).</p>\n<h4>Precautions / Notes</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Never apply undiluted essential oils to skin — always use with a carrier oil.</li>\n<li>Pregnant women should consult a doctor before oral use.</li>\n<li>Those with sensitive skin should do a patch test before use.</li>\n<li>Keep away from eyes, ears, and open wounds.</li>\n<li>Do not give to children under 10 for internal use.</li>\n</ul>','[{\"label\":\"Category\",\"value\":\"Essential Oils\"},{\"label\":\"Packed & shipped from\",\"value\":\"Ooty, The Nilgiris\"},{\"label\":\"Price\",\"value\":\"Inclusive of GST\"}]',NULL,299.00,345.00,40,1,0,0,0,'2026-11-10 10:16:05','2026-11-10 10:16:05'),(77,5,15,'Citronella Oil Spray Set of 3 Combo','citronella-oil-spray-set-of-3-combo',NULL,'Pure Citronella Essential Oil from Ooty Originals — India’s most trusted natural mosquito repellent oil. No DEET. No chemicals. Also used as a natural air freshener, floor wash additive, and wound disinfectant. You are now buying the 10ml Roll-On','<h4>About This Product</h4>\n<p>Ooty Originals Citronella Oil is a 100% natural, chemical-free mosquito and insect repellent oil extracted from the citronella grass plant — effective against mosquitoes, bed bugs, and common household pests without the health risks of synthetic repellents. At Ooty Originals, we bring you the refreshing protection of nature with our premium citronella oil spray, crafted to keep your surroundings safe and comfortable. Sourced from high-quality plants and processed with care, our citronella oil is known for its natural ability to repel insects while maintaining a fresh, pleasant aroma. Inspired by the purity of the Nilgiris, our formulation is designed to provide effective protection without relying on harsh chemicals.</p>\n<p>Our product works as a powerful citronella oil mosquito repellent, helping you stay protected from mosquitoes in a natural way. Whether you are relaxing at home, spending time outdoors,