You can also buy citronella essential oil and spray products with confidence, knowing that they meet high standards of purity and effectiveness. For those searching buy citronella oil near me, we provide efficient delivery services to ensure that your product reaches you quickly and safely.</p>\n<p>Choosing Ooty Originals means choosing natural protection backed by tradition and trust. Our citronella oil spray is more than just a repellent—it is a refreshing, eco-friendly solution designed to enhance your everyday comfort. Experience the power of nature and make the right choice to buy citronella oil from Ooty Originals today.</p>\n<h4>Key Benefits</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Powerful natural mosquito and insect repellent — safe alternative to DEET</li>\n<li>Effective against bed bugs, ticks, and ants</li>\n<li>Natural air freshener — diffuse indoors to eliminate odours</li>\n<li>Excellent floor wash additive — disinfects and freshens rooms</li>\n<li>Treats minor wounds and skin infections (antibacterial properties)</li>\n<li>Reduces anxiety and depression with its refreshing aroma</li>\n<li>Anti-inflammatory properties — soothes sore muscles</li>\n<li>Deodorizes clothing, curtains, and fabric without staining</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>How to Use / How to Apply</h4>\n<ol>\n<li>Repellent: Mix 5–7 drops with coconut oil and apply to arms, legs, and neck.</li>\n<li>Diffuser: Add 6–8 drops to your diffuser to repel insects indoors.</li>\n<li>Floor wash: Add 10–15 drops to a bucket of water for mopping.</li>\n<li>Room spray: Mix 15 drops in 100ml water in a spray bottle; spray around room.</li>\n<li>Fabric application: Apply a few drops on curtains, bed sheets, and clothing — safe and non-staining.</li>\n</ol>\n<h4>How It Works</h4>\n<p>Citronella oil works by masking the scents (carbon dioxide and lactic acid) that attract mosquitoes to humans. Its active compounds — citronellal, geraniol, and citronellol — are scientifically proven to repel insects. The oil also contains antimicrobial and antifungal compounds that disinfect surfaces and inhibit bacterial growth.</p>\n<h4>Why Buy From Us?</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Sourced from Nilgiri-region citronella grass — high citronellal content</li>\n<li>More economical per use compared to commercial insect repellent sprays</li>\n<li>Completely safe for children and pets when diluted correctly</li>\n<li>Multi-purpose: repellent, cleaning, aromatherapy, wound care</li>\n<li>Available in bulk sizes (500ml) — perfect for homes and commercial spaces</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Who Can Use This?</h4>\n<p>Safe for the entire family when diluted properly — adults, children above 3 years, and even pets. Widely used in households, hospitals, hotels, and yoga studios.</p>\n<h4>Restrictions</h4>\n<p>Always dilute before skin application. Do not apply undiluted citronella oil directly on skin. Not for ingestion.</p>\n<h4>Precautions / Notes</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Dilute with coconut, almond, or olive oil before skin application (ratio 1:5 minimum).</li>\n<li>Avoid contact with eyes and mucous membranes.</li>\n<li>Conduct a patch test on inner wrist before widespread use.</li>\n<li>For children under 3, use only in diffuser — not on skin.</li>\n<li>Store in a dark, cool place to preserve potency.</li>\n</ul>','[{\"label\":\"Category\",\"value\":\"Essential Oils\"},{\"label\":\"Packed & shipped from\",\"value\":\"Ooty, The Nilgiris\"},{\"label\":\"Price\",\"value\":\"Inclusive of GST\"}]',NULL,299.00,345.00,40,1,0,0,0,'2026-11-10 10:16:05','2026-11-10 10:16:05'),(78,5,15,'Citriodora Oil Spray Set of 3 Combo','citriodora-oil-spray-set-of-3-combo',NULL,'Pure Citriodora (Lemon Eucalyptus) Oil from Ooty Originals — a Nilgiri specialty. Prevents hair fall, treats dandruff, keeps scalp cool, and repels insects naturally. You are now buying the 10ml Spray','<h4>About This Product</h4>\n<p>Ooty Originals Citriodora Oil is extracted from Eucalyptus citriodora trees of the Nilgiris — known for their unique lemon-citrus aroma and superior insect-repelling and hair-care properties compared to regular eucalyptus oil.</p>\n<h4>Key Benefits</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Prevents premature hair fall and thinning</li>\n<li>Treats dandruff effectively with regular scalp application</li>\n<li>Keeps scalp cool and refreshed — ideal for summer and hot climates</li>\n<li>Powerful natural insect repellent — more effective than regular eucalyptus</li>\n<li>Excellent floor wash additive for freshness and sanitation</li>\n<li>Uplifting lemon-citrus aroma in diffusers</li>\n<li>Antibacterial properties for wound care</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>How to Use / How to Apply</h4>\n<ol>\n<li>Hair care: Mix in coconut oil (ratio 1:10) and massage into scalp. Leave for 30 minutes; wash off.</li>\n<li>Diffuser: Add 4–5 drops for aroma and insect-repelling effect.</li>\n<li>Floor wash: Add 10–12 drops to a bucket of water before mopping.</li>\n<li>Insect repellent: Dilute in coconut oil and apply to arms, legs, and neck.</li>\n<li>Skin wound: Dilute 2 drops in 1 tsp aloe vera gel and apply to minor cuts.</li>\n</ol>\n<h4>How It Works</h4>\n<p>Citriodora oil contains p-menthane-3,8-diol (PMD) as its key active compound — clinically recognized as an effective insect repellent and listed by the CDC as a safer alternative to DEET. It also contains citronellal and isopulegol, which nourish the scalp, reduce inflammation, and create an inhospitable environment for dandruff-causing fungi.</p>\n<h4>Why Buy From Us?</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Rare Nilgiri Citriodora — stronger lemon aroma and higher PMD content than generic brands</li>\n<li>Dual-purpose: hair care AND insect repellent in one bottle</li>\n<li>External use only — clearly labelled for safe use</li>\n<li>Available in sizes from 30ml to 500ml for all needs</li>\n<li>Straight from Nilgiri farms — no intermediary mixing or dilution</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Who Can Use This?</h4>\n<p>Adults and children above 5 years (external use only). Highly recommended for people living in tropical/humid areas, those with dandruff-prone scalps, and frequent travellers.</p>\n<h4>Restrictions</h4>\n<p>For external use only. Do not ingest. Always dilute before use.</p>\n<h4>Precautions / Notes</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Must be diluted with coconut or other carrier oil before applying to skin or scalp.</li>\n<li>Keep away from eyes, nose, and mouth.</li>\n<li>Patch test required before first scalp application.</li>\n<li>Pregnant women should consult a doctor before use.</li>\n<li>Store in a cool, dark place. Do not expose yourself to heat.</li>\n</ul>','[{\"label\":\"Category\",\"value\":\"Essential Oils\"},{\"label\":\"Packed & shipped from\",\"value\":\"Ooty, The Nilgiris\"},{\"label\":\"Price\",\"value\":\"Inclusive of GST\"}]',NULL,299.00,345.00,40,1,0,0,0,'2026-11-10 10:16:05','2026-11-10 10:16:05'),(79,5,13,'Eucalyptus Oil Roll-On','eucalyptus-oil-roll-on',NULL,'Authentic steam-distilled Nilgiri Oil/Eucalyptus Oil sourced from the Nilgiri hills of India. 100% pure, chemical-free, and therapeutic-grade. You are now buying the 10ml roll-on. Buy Nilgiri Oil online','<h3>About This Product</h3>\n<p>Experience the natural goodness of Ooty Originals Eucalyptus Nilgiri Oil, a premium-quality essential oil carefully extracted from fresh eucalyptus leaves grown in the pristine Nilgiri Hills. Our eucalyptus nilgiri oil is produced using the traditional steam-distillation method in small batches to preserve its purity, refreshing aroma, and therapeutic properties. Free from artificial fragrances, chemicals, and mineral oils, this oil delivers the authentic benefits of nature in every drop.</p>\n<p>If you’re looking for pure and effective nilgiri oil at a competitive nilgiri oil price, Ooty Originals offers exceptional quality sourced directly from local farmers and distillers.</p>\n<h2>Benefits of Nilgiri Oil</h2>\n<p>Nilgiri oil has been valued for generations for its wide range of wellness applications. Regular use may help:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Ease nasal congestion, cold, cough, and sinus discomfort.</li>\n<li>Support comfortable breathing during seasonal changes.</li>\n<li>Reduce headaches and mental tiredness with its refreshing aroma.</li>\n<li>Relieve muscle soreness, joint stiffness, and body aches through massage.</li>\n<li>Promote a healthy scalp by reducing dandruff and supporting stronger hair.</li>\n<li>Help maintain cleaner skin with its natural antibacterial properties.</li>\n<li>Freshen indoor spaces while acting as a natural insect repellent.</li>\n<li>Support oral hygiene due to its cleansing properties.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>How to Use Eucalyptus Nilgiri Oil</h2>\n<h3>Steam Inhalation</h3>\n<p>Add 3–5 drops of eucalyptus nilgiri oil to a bowl of hot water. Cover your head with a towel and inhale the steam for 5–10 minutes to help clear blocked nasal passages.</p>\n<h3>For Muscle &amp; Joint Comfort</h3>\n<p>Mix 3–4 drops with a carrier oil such as coconut or almond oil and gently massage onto the affected area.</p>\n<h3>Headache Relief</h3>\n<p>Dilute 1–2 drops and massage onto the temples and back of the neck for a soothing cooling effect.</p>\n<h3>Aromatherapy</h3>\n<p>Add 5–6 drops to a diffuser to create a refreshing atmosphere while supporting respiratory comfort.</p>\n<h3>Hair Care</h3>\n<p>Blend 5 drops with two tablespoons of coconut oil, massage into the scalp, leave for about 30 minutes, and wash with a mild shampoo.</p>\n<h2>How It Works</h2>\n<p>The effectiveness of nilgiri oil comes from its naturally occurring compound called <strong>eucalyptol (1,8-cineole)</strong>. This active component is widely recognized for its antimicrobial, anti-inflammatory, and decongestant properties. During steam inhalation, it helps open the airways and promotes easier breathing. When applied topically after dilution, it creates a cooling sensation that helps relax tired muscles and soothe discomfort.</p>\n<h2>Why Choose Ooty Originals?</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>100% pure steam-distilled eucalyptus nilgiri oil</li>\n<li>Sourced directly from trusted growers in the Nilgiri Hills</li>\n<li>Small-batch production for maximum freshness and potency</li>\n<li>No synthetic fragrances, preservatives, or fillers</li>\n<li>Ethically sourced and carefully packed</li>\n<li>Premium quality at an affordable nilgiri oil price</li>\n<li>Trusted by families, wellness enthusiasts, and aromatherapy users across India</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Who Can Use It?</h2>\n<p>Our nilgiri oil is suitable for adults and children above 6 years of age when used as directed and properly diluted. It is commonly used by families, massage therapists, wellness practitioners, and individuals seeking natural respiratory and body care solutions.</p>\n<h2>Safety Information</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Do not use on children below 2 years around the nose or face.</li>\n<li>For external use only.</li>\n<li>Avoid swallowing the oil.</li>\n<li>Never apply undiluted oil directly to sensitive or damaged skin.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Precautions</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Always dilute with a carrier oil before applying to the skin.</li>\n<li>Perform a patch test before first use.</li>\n<li>Avoid contact with eyes and other sensitive areas.</li>\n<li>Pregnant or breastfeeding women should seek medical advice before using essential oils.</li>\n<li>Store tightly closed in a cool, dry place away from direct sunlight and heat.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>This naturally sourced eucalyptus nilgiri oil combines traditional extraction methods with the purity of the Nilgiri Hills to deliver a versatile essential oil for everyday wellness. Whether you’re purchasing it for respiratory care, body massage, hair care, or aromatherapy, Ooty Originals offers genuine nilgiri oil at a reasonable nilgiri oil price, ensuring excellent value without compromising on quality.</p>','[{\"label\":\"Category\",\"value\":\"Essential Oils\"},{\"label\":\"Packed & shipped from\",\"value\":\"Ooty, The Nilgiris\"},{\"label\":\"Price\",\"value\":\"Inclusive of GST\"}]','Nilgiri Oil | Eucalyptus Oil Roll-On',95.00,115.00,40,1,0,0,0,'2026-11-10 10:16:05','2026-11-10 10:16:05'),(80,5,14,'Citrone