 chemical-free, and therapeutic-grade. Available in 30ml, 60ml, 100ml, 200ml & 500ml.','<p>At Ooty Originals, we proudly bring you the authentic goodness of nilgiri oil, one of the most trusted natural wellness oils known for its refreshing aroma and therapeutic properties. Sourced from the lush eucalyptus plantations of the Nilgiri hills, our oil reflects the purity and natural richness that Ooty is famous for. Many people search for nilgiri oil in english to better understand this traditional product, and it is commonly known as eucalyptus oil derived from eucalyptus leaves through a careful distillation process. For generations, nilgiri oil has been valued in Indian households as a natural remedy for daily wellness and relaxation.</p>\n<p>Our premium nilgiri oil is widely used for multiple purposes, making it an essential product in every home. From respiratory relief to hair care and body relaxation, the benefits of nilgiri oil continue to make it highly popular. Customers often look for information about nilgiri oil price because quality and purity play a major role in choosing the right product. At Ooty Originals, we ensure that every bottle is crafted with care, offering excellent value without compromising authenticity. Whether you are looking for nilgiri oil for cold, nilgiri oil for cough, or nilgiri oil for hair, our naturally sourced oil is designed to support your wellness routine in the most effective way. Understanding nilgiri oil use helps customers experience the full benefits of this versatile essential oil.</p>\n<p>The Nilgiris have long been known for producing some of the finest eucalyptus-based oils in India. Our oil is extracted from carefully selected eucalyptus leaves grown in the cool climate of Ooty, preserving the strong aroma and natural healing properties that make eucalyptus nilgiri products so effective. At Ooty Originals, we focus on providing original nilgiri oil that stays true to traditional preparation methods while meeting modern quality standards.</p>\n<p>One of the most common uses of nilgiri oil is for respiratory comfort. Many people use nilgiri for cold by adding a few drops into hot water for steam inhalation. The soothing vapors help provide relief from congestion and breathing discomfort. Similarly, nilgiri oil for cough is commonly used in natural home remedies because of its cooling and refreshing properties. The calming aroma can help create a feeling of relaxation and comfort during seasonal changes.</p>\n<p>Our nilgiri essential oil is also highly valued in aromatherapy. A few drops in a diffuser can refresh your living space and create a calming atmosphere. The strong yet pleasant fragrance helps reduce stress and mental fatigue. This is why many customers choose nilgiri oil not only for health support but also for overall wellness and relaxation.</p>\n<p>Hair care is another important area where nilgiri oil is beneficial. Using nilgiri oil for hair as part of a regular hair care routine may help improve scalp health and maintain freshness. When mixed with carrier oils, it can nourish the scalp and provide a cooling sensation that many users find refreshing. Traditional practices have long included nilgiri taila as a natural ingredient for scalp massage and hair care.</p>\n<p>At Ooty Originals, we understand that customers are often looking for convenient ways to purchase authentic products. That is why we make it easy to buy nilgiri oil online directly from a trusted source. Whether you are searching for nilgiri oil near me or want reliable doorstep delivery, our platform offers a smooth and secure shopping experience. We believe customers deserve access to high-quality oils that are both natural and effective.</p>\n<p>Many customers also ask about package sizes and pricing. We provide multiple options based on different requirements, including details about nilgiri oil 50ml price and nilgiri oil 1 litre price. Smaller bottles are perfect for personal use, while larger quantities are ideal for families, wellness centers, and regular users. Regardless of the size, we maintain the same level of purity and quality in every bottle.</p>\n<p>Another reason customers trust Ooty Originals is our commitment to providing pure nilgiri oil without harmful chemicals or unnecessary additives. Our oil retains its natural strength and aroma, ensuring that users experience the authentic benefits associated with traditional nilgiri products. In many regions, people refer to this oil as nilgiri tail or nilgiri ka oil, reflecting its deep connection with traditional Indian wellness practices.</p>\n<p>Apart from respiratory and hair care uses, nilgiri oil is also popularly used for body relaxation. Many people apply diluted oil for massage because nilgiri oil for joint pain is known for its cooling and soothing sensation. It is commonly used after long working hours or physical activity to relax tired muscles and improve comfort. The refreshing aroma also contributes to a sense of relief and relaxation.</p>\n<p>Skin care is another area where nilgiri oil is appreciated. When used properly with carrier oils, nilgiri oil for skin may help refresh and cleanse the skin naturally. Its cooling properties make it a popular ingredient in wellness and skincare routines. Additionally, some people use nilgiri drops in steam or diffusers to create a refreshing indoor environment.</p>\n<p>Choosing Ooty Originals means choosing authenticity, purity, and tradition. Our nilgiri oil is more than just a product—it represents the natural heritage of the Nilgiri hills. We are dedicated to bringing the finest eucalyptus-based wellness products directly from Ooty to customers across India. Every bottle reflects our commitment to quality, freshness, and customer satisfaction.</p>\n<p>If you are looking for authentic nilgiri products that combine tradition with modern convenience, Ooty Originals is your trusted destination. Experience the natural power of original nilgiri oil and bring home the refreshing essence of the Nilgiris today.</p>\n<h2>Key Benefits of Nilgiri Oil</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Relieves cold, congestion &amp; blocked nose inhale directly or use in steam</li>\n<li>Reduces headache and mental fatigue when applied to temples</li>\n<li>Soothes muscle pain and body aches with topical application</li>\n<li>Promotes dental health known antibacterial properties</li>\n<li>Helps bring down fever naturally</li>\n<li>Nourishes scalp, reduces dandruff and promotes hair growth</li>\n<li>Heals minor wounds and skin infections faster</li>\n<li>Acts as a natural room freshener and insect repellent</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>How to Use / How to Apply Nilgiri Oil</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>Steam inhalation: Add 3–5 drops to a bowl of hot water, cover head with towel, and inhale for 5–10 minutes.</li>\n<li>Topical for pain: Dilute 3–4 drops with coconut oil (1:5 ratio) and massage on affected area.</li>\n<li>Headache relief: Apply 1–2 drops on temples and back of neck; massage gently.</li>\n<li>Diffuser: Add 5–6 drops to your diffuser for respiratory relief and freshness.</li>\n<li>Hair care: Mix 5 drops with 2 tbsp coconut oil, massage into scalp, leave for 30 mins, wash off.</li>\n</ol>\n<h4>How It Works</h4>\n<p>Eucalyptus oil contains cineole (also called eucalyptol) as its primary active compound  clinically studied for its antimicrobial, anti-inflammatory, and decongestant properties. When inhaled, it opens nasal passages and soothes the respiratory tract. When applied topically, it creates a cooling sensation that numbs pain receptors and reduces inflammation in muscles and joints.</p>\n<h4>Why Buy From Us?</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Sourced directly from Nilgiri villages not factory-blended generics</li>\n<li>Steam distilled in small batches retains maximum therapeutic potency</li>\n<li>No added chemicals, fillers, or synthetic fragrance</li>\n<li>Every batch from the same trusted Nilgiri farms since inception</li>\n<li>Most affordable pure Nilgiri Oil online priced for everyday families</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Who Can Use This?</h4>\n<p>Suitable for adults and children above 6 years. Safe for daily use when properly diluted. Widely used by families, wellness practitioners, aromatherapists, and people with chronic respiratory conditions.</p>\n<h4>Restrictions</h4>\n<p>Not recommended for children under 2 years near the face area. Do not ingest. Do not apply undiluted directly on broken skin.</p>\n<h4>Precautions / Notes</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Always dilute with carrier oil (coconut, almond) before topical application.</li>\n<li>Perform a patch test on inner wrist before first use.</li>\n<li>Keep away from eyes and mucous membranes.</li>\n<li>Pregnant women and nursing mothers should consult a doctor before use.</li>\n<li>Store in a cool, dry place away from direct sunlight.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Frequently Asked Questions</h3>\n#sp-ea-2195 .spcollapsing { height: 0; overflow: hidden; transition-property: height;transition-duration: 300ms;}#sp-ea-2195.sp-easy-accordion&gt;.sp-ea-single {margin-bottom: 10px; border: 1px solid #e2e2e2; }#sp-ea-2195.sp-easy-accordion&gt;.sp-ea-single&gt;.ea-header a {color: #444;}#sp-ea-2195.sp-easy-accordion&gt;.sp-ea-single&gt;.sp-collapse&gt;.ea-body {background: #fff; color: #444;}#sp-ea-2195.sp-easy-accordion&gt;.sp-ea-single {background: #eee;}#sp-ea-2195.sp-easy-accordion&gt;.sp-ea-single&gt;.ea-header a .ea-expand-icon { float: left; color: #444;font-size: 16px;}<h3><i></i> What are the primary health benefits of Nilgiri oil (Eucalyptus oil)?</h3> <p>Nilgiri oil is clinically valued for its powerful anti-inflammatory, antimicrobial, and analgesic properties. It is most commonly used for instant respiratory relief from colds and congestion, soothing muscle and joint pain, and promoting dental health. Additionally, its invigorating aroma is used in aromatherapy to reduce stress and improve mental clarity.</p><h3><i></i> How do I use eucalyptus oil for cold and cough relief?</h3> <p>The most effective method is steam inhalation: add 2–5 drops of pure eucalyptus oil to a bowl of hot water, cover your head with a towel, and breathe in the vapors for 5–10 minutes. For chest congestion, you can also dilute the oil with a carrier oil like coconut oil and gently massage it onto the chest and throat before bedtime.</p><h3><i></i> Can I apply eucalyptus oil directly to my skin?</h3> <p>No, you should never apply undiluted eucalyptus oil directly to the skin as it is highly concentrated and can cause irritation or chemical burns. Always dilute 3–5 drops of essential oil with at least one tablespoon of a carrier oil, such as almond or coconut oil, before topical application.</p><h3><i></i> Is eucalyptus oil good for hair growth and dandruff?</h3> <p>Yes, eucalyptus oil promotes hair growth by stimulating blood circulation to the scalp and strengthening hair follicles. Its antifungal properties make it an excellent natural remedy for dandruff and itchy scalp when 2-3 drops are mixed into your regular shampoo or a carrier oil for a scalp massage.</p><h3><i></i> How can I identify 100% pure steam-distilled eucalyptus oil?</h3> <p>Look for oil labeled as “100% pure” or “therapeutic grade” that is packaged in a bottle to prevent light degradation. Authentic Ooty eucalyptus oil is traditionally steam-distilled in small batches from fresh leaves and should have a sharp, camphoraceous aroma without any synthetic chemical undertones.</p><h3><i></i> Is eucalyptus oil safe for children and infants?</h3> <p>Eucalyptus oil should not be used on or diffused around infants and children under the age of 6 without professional medical guidance. The high cineole content can cause respiratory distress in very young children; always store the bottle out of reach of children to avoid accidental ingestion.</p><h3><i></i> Does eucalyptus oil have an expiry date?</h3> <p>Yes, eucalyptus oil typically has a shelf life of 2 to 3 years when stored in a cool, dark place in an airtight glass bottle. Over time, exposure to light and air can cause the oil to oxidize, leading to a loss of its therapeutic potency and a change in its distinct aroma.</p><h3><i></i> Can eucalyptus oil be used in a diffuser or humidifier?</h3> <p>Yes, adding 5–7 drops of eucalyptus oil to a diffuser can help purify the air, eliminate household odors, and support easier breathing while you sleep. Ensure you use it in a well-ventilated room and limit sessions to 30–45 minutes to avoid overexposure to the concentrated aroma.</p><h3><i></i> What is the difference between Nilgiri oil and regular eucalyptus oil?</h3> <p>“Nilgiri oil” specifically refers to eucalyptus oil sourced from the Nilgiri Hills (Blue Mountains) of South India, which has been famous for its high-quality production since 1843. Nilgiri-sourced oil is often preferred for its purity and traditional small-batch steam distillation methods, which preserve a superior therapeutic profile compared to mass-produced factory blends.</p><h3><i></i> Can eucalyptus oil help with muscle and joint pain?</h3> <p>Eucalyptus oil acts as a natural analgesic and counter-irritant that creates a cooling and then warming sensation on the skin, distracting from deeper pain. It is widely used in Ayurvedic liniments to reduce inflammation and stiffness associated with arthritis, rheumatism, and sports injuries.</p>{ \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"@id\": \"sp-ea-schema-2195-6af2e078a45ce\", \"mainEntity\": [{ \"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What are the primary health benefits of Nilgiri oil (Eucalyptus oil)?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": { \"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Nilgiri oil is clinically valued for its powerful anti-inflammatory, antimicrobial, and analgesic properties. It is most commonly used for instant respiratory relief from colds and congestion, soothing muscle and joint pain, and promoting dental health. Additionally, its invigorating aroma is used in aromatherapy to reduce stress and improve mental clarity.\" } },{ \"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How do I use eucalyptus oil for cold and cough relief?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": { \"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The most effective method is steam inhalation: add 2–5 drops of pure eucalyptus oil to a bowl of hot water, cover your head with a towel, and breathe in the vapors for 5–10 minutes. For chest congestion, you can also dilute the oil with a carrier oil like coconut oil and gently massage it onto the chest and throat before bedtime.\" } },{ \"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Can I apply eucalyptus oil directly to my skin?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": { \"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"No, you should never apply undiluted eucalyptus oil directly to the skin as it is highly concentrated and can cause irritation or chemical burns. Always dilute 3–5 drops of essential oil with at least one tablespoon of a carrier oil, such as almond or coconut oil, before topical application.\" } },{ \"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is eucalyptus oil good for hair growth and dandruff?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": { \"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, eucalyptus oil promotes hair growth by stimulating blood circulation to the scalp and strengthening hair follicles. Its antifungal properties make it an excellent natural remedy for dandruff and itchy scalp when 2-3 drops are mixed into your regular shampoo or a carrier oil for a scalp massage.\" } },{ \"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How can I identify 100% pure steam-distilled eucalyptus oil?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": { \"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Look for oil labeled as \'100% pure\' or \'therapeutic grade\' that is packaged in a bottle to prevent light degradation. Authentic Ooty eucalyptus oil is traditionally steam-distilled in small batches from fresh leaves and should have a sharp, camphoraceous aroma without any synthetic chemical undertones.\" } },{ \"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is eucalyptus oil safe for children and infants?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": { \"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Eucalyptus oil should not be used on or diffused around infants and children under the age of 6 without professional medical guidance. The high cineole content can cause respiratory distress in very young children; always store the bottle out of reach of children to avoid accidental ingestion.\" } },{ \"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Does eucalyptus oil have an expiry date?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": { \"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, eucalyptus oil typically has a shelf life of 2 to 3 years when stored in a cool, dark place in an airtight glass bottle. Over time, exposure to light and air can cause the oil to oxidize, leading to a loss of its therapeutic potency and a change in its distinct aroma.\" } },{ \"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Can eucalyptus oil be used in a diffuser or humidifier?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": { \"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, adding 5–7 drops of eucalyptus oil to a diffuser can help purify the air, eliminate household odors, and support easier breathing while you sleep. Ensure you use it in a well-ventilated room and limit sessions to 30–45 minutes to avoid overexposure to the concentrated aroma.\" } },{ \"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the difference between Nilgiri oil and regular eucalyptus oil?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": { \"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"\'Nilgiri oil\' specifically refers to eucalyptus oil sourced from the Nilgiri Hills (Blue Mountains) of South India, which has been famous for its high-quality production since 1843. Nilgiri-sourced oil is often preferred for its purity and traditional small-batch steam distillation methods, which preserve a superior therapeutic profile compared to mass-produced factory blends.\" } },{ \"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Can eucalyptus oil help with muscle and joint pain?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": { \"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Eucalyptus oil acts as a natural analgesic and counter-irritant that creates a cooling and then warming sensation on the skin, distracting from deeper pain. It is widely used in Ayurvedic liniments to reduce inflammation and stiffness associated with arthritis, rheumatism, and sports injuries.\" } }] }','[{\"label\":\"Available types\",\"value\":\"Bottle, Spray, Roll-on, Set of 3\"},{\"label\":\"Available sizes\",\"value\":\"10ml, 30ml, 60ml, 100ml, 200ml, 500ml\"},{\"label\":\"Category\",\"value\":\"Essential Oils\"},{\"label\":\"Packed & shipped from\",\"value\":\"Ooty, The Nilgiris\"},{\"label\":\"Price\",\"value\":\"Inclusive of GST\"}]','Nilgiri Oil | Nilgiri Oil Price | Nilgiri Oil for Cold nilgiri oil Relief Oils',100.00,110.00,280,1,0,0,0,'2026-11-10 10:16:05','2026-11-16 07:15:15'),(83,3,NULL,'Mix Nuts Dark Homemade Chocolates','mix-nuts-dark-homemade-chocolates',NULL,'Each bite is a delicious combination of dark chocolate and crunchy nuts, making it the perfect treat for any occasion. Our Mix Nuts Dark Homemade Chocolates are a must-try for all chocolate lovers and a proud addition to our collection of Ooty products.','<p>Indulge in the rich and decadent Mix Nuts Dark Homemade Chocolates, made with love and care in Ooty, India. Our homemade chocolates are crafted with only the finest ingredients, including high quality mix nuts sourced from the lush Nilgiris.</p>','[{\"label\":\"Available weights\",\"value\":\"100g, 250g, 500g\"},{\"label\":\"Category\",\"value\":\"Homemade Chocolates\"},{\"label\":\"Packed & shipped from\",\"value\":\"Ooty, The Nilgiris\"},{\"label\":\"Price\",\"value\":\"Inclusive of GST\"}]',NULL,160.00,190.00,120,1,0,0,0,'2026-11-10 10:16:05','2026-11-10 10:16:05'),(84,3,NULL,'Roasted Almonds Milk Chocolates','roasted-almonds-milk-chocolates',NULL,'Our Ooty products have always been known for their exceptional quality and taste, and these Roasted Cashew Dark Chocolates are no exception. With every bite, you will experience the perfect balance of bitterness and sweetness, making these chocolates truly delicious.Treat yourself or your loved ones to these mouth-watering Nilgiris chocolates today','<p>Indulge in the rich and creamy taste of our Roasted Almonds Milk Chocolates, made with the finest quality mix nuts sourced from the hills of Ooty. These homemade chocolates are crafted with care and expertise to deliver a heavenly taste experience</p>','[{\"label\":\"Available weights\",\"value\":\"100g, 250g, 500g\"},{\"label\":\"Category\",\"value\":\"Homemade Chocolates\"},{\"label\":\"Packed & shipped from\",\"value\":\"Ooty, The Nilgiris\"},{\"label\":\"Price\",\"value\":\"Inclusive of GST\"}]',NULL,160.00,190.00,120,1,0,0,0,'2026-11-10 10:16:05','2026-11-10 10:16:05'),(85,3,NULL,'Roasted Cashew Milk Chocolates','roasted-cashew-milk-chocolates',NULL,'Our Ooty products have always been known for their exceptional quality and taste, and these Roasted Cashew Dark Chocolates are no exception. With every bite, you will experience the perfect balance of bitterness and sweetness, making these chocolates truly delicious.Treat yourself or your loved ones to these mouth-watering Nilgiris chocolates today','<p>Indulge in the rich and velvety Roasted Cashew Milk Chocolates, a heavenly treat for all chocolate lovers. Made with high-quality mix nuts and scrumptious dark chocolate, these chocolates are homemade and sourced from the picturesque hill station of Ooty.</p>','[{\"label\":\"Available weights\",\"value\":\"100g, 250g, 500g\"},{\"label\":\"Category\",\"value\":\"Homemade Chocolates\"},{\"label\":\"Packed & shipped from\",\"value\":\"Ooty, The Nilgiris\"},{\"label\":\"Price\",\"value\":\"Inclusive of GST\"}]',NULL,160.00,190.00,120,1,0,0,0,'2026-11-10 10:16:05','2026-11-10 10:16:05'),(86,4,NULL,'Ooty Varkey Regular 500g','ooty-varkey-regular-500g',NULL,'Perfect for snacking, the Ooty Varkey Regular is a crunchy and satisfying snack that will leave you wanting more. Order now and experience the taste of authentic Ooty cookies with our Ooty Varkey Regular.','<p>The Ooty Varkey Regular is a classic treat from the hills of Nilgiris, brought to you by our online Ooty store. These eggless and vegetarian cookies are made with the finest ingredients, and are a must-try for anyone looking to indulge in the delicious taste of Ooty products.</p>','[{\"label\":\"Available weights\",\"value\":\"500g, 1Kg\"},{\"label\":\"Category\",\"value\":\"Cookies & Bakes\"},{\"label\":\"Packed & shipped from\",\"value\":\"Ooty, The Nilgiris\"},{\"label\":\"Price\",\"value\":\"Inclusive of GST\"}]',NULL,175.00,210.00,40,1,0,0,0,'2026-11-10 10:16:05','2026-11-16 07:15:13'),(87,5,12,'Wintergreen Oil','wintergreen-oil',NULL,'Pure Wintergreen Oil / Wintermint Oil extracted from the Nilgiri hills of Tamil Nadu. India’s most effective natural relief for muscular pain, joint inflammation, and headaches. Available in 30ml to 500ml','<p>At Ooty Originals, we bring you the authentic essence of the Nilgiris through our premium Wintergreen Oil, carefully sourced and traditionally processed to preserve its natural quality and refreshing character. Extracted from the leaves of the wintergreen plant, this aromatic oil has been valued in traditional wellness routines for generations. Known for its distinctive cooling sensation and naturally refreshing fragrance, wintergreen oil continues to be a trusted choice for people seeking nature-inspired self-care.</p>\n<p>Many customers searching for wintergreen oil in hindi may know it as “गॉल्थेरिया तेल” or simply wintergreen-based therapeutic oil. This naturally derived oil has become increasingly popular because of its versatility and traditional applications in massage, relaxation, and personal wellness routines.</p>\n<h2>What Is Wintergreen Oil?</h2>\n<p>One of the most common questions customers ask is: what is wintergreen oil used for? Wintergreen oil is an essential oil extracted from the leaves of the wintergreen oil plant, traditionally known for its refreshing aroma and external wellness applications.</p>\n<p>The wintergreen oil botanical name is <em>Gaultheria procumbens</em>, and the wintergreen oil scientific name is also identified as <em>Gaultheria procumbens</em>. Among wintergreen oil other names, you may hear terms such as Gaultheria Oil or Oil of Wintergreen.</p>\n<p>This oil contains naturally occurring compounds that contribute to its cooling and comforting character. The oil of wintergreen formula is commonly associated with methyl salicylate, a naturally occurring component recognized for its distinctive aromatic profile.</p>\n<h2>Wintergreen Oil Uses in Traditional Wellness</h2>\n<p>There are many traditional wintergreen oil uses, making it one of the most versatile essential oils in natural care routines.</p>\n<p>Common wintergreen essential oil uses include:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Massage routines for relaxation</li>\n<li>Aromatherapy sessions</li>\n<li>Personal wellness rituals</li>\n<li>Body massage blends</li>\n<li>Refreshing diffuser experiences</li>\n</ul>\n<p>People often explore how to use wintergreen oil by blending it with carrier oils before topical application or using small amounts in diffusers for aromatic comfort.</p>\n<h2>Wintergreen Oil Benefits for Everyday Comfort</h2>\n<p>The popularity of this oil continues to grow because of the wide range of wintergreen oil benefits appreciated in traditional wellness practices.</p>\n<p>Some commonly recognized uses include:</p>\n<h3>Supports Relaxation and Recovery</h3>\n<p>Wintergreen oil is widely used during massage routines after long days or physical activity.</p>\n<h3>Refreshing Aromatic Experience</h3>\n<p>The distinctive fragrance creates a cooling and uplifting atmosphere.</p>\n<h3>Personal Care Applications</h3>\n<p>Many users explore wintergreen oil benefits for skin by blending small amounts with carrier oils as part of external care routines.</p>\n<h3>Traditional Hair Care Practices</h3>\n<p>Some people also include wintergreen oil for hair in diluted oil blends to create refreshing scalp massage experiences.</p>\n<h2>Understanding Wintergreen Essential Oil Aroma</h2>\n<p>One reason customers love this oil is its unmistakable fragrance.</p>\n<p>The wintergreen essential oil smell is often described as fresh, cooling, mint-like, and clean.</p>\n<p>People frequently ask:</p>\n<h3>What does wintergreen oil smell like?</h3>\n<p>It has a naturally sweet, mint-inspired aroma with cooling herbal notes.</p>\n<h3>What is the smell of oil of wintergreen?</h3>\n<p>The oil of wintergreen smell is refreshing and recognizable, making it popular for wellness and diffuser applications.</p>\n<p>Because of this distinctive profile, many users enjoy wintergreen essential oil diffuser benefits, creating an environment that feels refreshing and revitalizing.</p>\n<h2>How to Use Wintergreen Oil</h2>\n<p>To experience the best results, always use wintergreen oil responsibly.</p>\n<h3>Massage Application</h3>\n<p>Mix with a carrier oil before external application.</p>\n<h3>Aromatherapy</h3>\n<p>Add a few drops to a diffuser.</p>\n<h3>Relaxation Routine</h3>\n<p>Apply diluted oil during body massage sessions.</p>\n<p>When learning how to use wintergreen oil, avoid direct undiluted use unless directed by product instructions.</p>\n<h2>Why Choose Ooty Originals?</h2>\n<p>At Ooty Originals, quality and authenticity guide everything we do.</p>\n<p>Our products are:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Carefully sourced from trusted regions</li>\n<li>Traditionally processed</li>\n<li>Preserved for natural aroma and quality</li>\n<li>Produced with attention to purity standards</li>\n</ul>\n<p>As interest grows in natural wellness, customers increasingly look for reliable wintergreen oil manufacturers in india that prioritize authenticity and quality.</p>\n<h2>Buy Authentic Wintergreen Oil Online</h2>\n<p>If you are searching for wintergreen oil online, Ooty Originals offers a trusted destination for premium-quality oils.</p>\n<p>Whether you are wondering where can i buy wintergreen oil or looking for where to buy wintergreen oil, our platform provides a convenient and reliable shopping experience.</p>\n<p>You can confidently buy wintergreen oil directly from Ooty Originals and enjoy authentic products delivered with care.</p>\n<h2>Precautions</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>For external use only</li>\n<li>Always dilute before application</li>\n<li>Avoid contact with eyes</li>\n<li>Keep away from children</li>\n<li>Consult a professional if needed before use</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Experience the refreshing tradition of nature with Ooty Originals and discover how authentic Wintergreen Oil can become a meaningful part of your everyday wellness routine.</p>\n<h2>Key Benefits of  Wintergreen Oil for Joint Pain &amp; Inflammation</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Provides fast relief from muscular pain and body aches</li>\n<li>Reduces inflammation of joints — effective for arthritis and gout</li>\n<li>Relieves headaches when applied to temples</li>\n<li>Acts as a natural analgesic (pain-numbing) agent</li>\n<li>Improves blood circulation in affected areas</li>\n<li>Helps with knee pain, back pain, and sports injuries</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>How to Use / How to Apply Wintergreen Oil for Best Results</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Mix Wintergreen oil with warm coconut oil in a 1:1 ratio.</li>\n<li>Apply the blend gently on the painful area — joints, muscles, back, or head.</li>\n<li>Massage in circular motions for 5–10 minutes for deeper penetration.</li>\n<li>Use 2–3 times a day for best results on chronic pain areas.</li>\n<li>For headache: apply 2 drops (diluted) to temples and back of the neck.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>How It Works</h4>\n<p>Wintergreen oil is naturally rich in methyl salicylate (over 90%), a compound closely related to aspirin. When absorbed through the skin, methyl salicylate inhibits prostaglandins — the chemicals responsible for pain and inflammation. This makes Gaultheria one of the most potent natural alternatives for pain relief, particularly for joint and muscle conditions.</p>\n<h4>Why Buy From Us?</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Rare Nilgiri-sourced Wintergreen — not blended with synthetic methyl salicylate</li>\n<li>Traditional extraction methods preserve natural potency</li>\n<li>Best Seller at Ooty Originals — trusted by thousands of repeat buyers</li>\n<li>Available in sizes from 30ml to 500ml — ideal for personal and bulk use</li>\n<li>Competitively priced with free shipping on orders above ₹499</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Who Can Use This?</h4>\n<p>Best suited for adults experiencing muscle pain, joint inflammation, arthritis, sports injuries, and tension headaches. Also popular with physiotherapists and natural health practitioners.</p>\n<h4>Restrictions</h4>\n<p>For external use only. Not for pregnant women, children under 12, or individuals on blood-thinning medications without medical advice. Do not use on broken or irritated skin.</p>\n<h4>Precautions / Notes</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Always dilute with a carrier oil — never apply neat (undiluted) to skin.</li>\n<li>Do not use near eyes, ears, or sensitive mucous membranes.</li>\n<li>Methyl salicylate can be toxic if ingested — keep out of reach of children.</li>\n<li>Those with aspirin sensitivity or salicylate allergy should avoid this oil.</li>\n<li>Consult a doctor before use if you are on anticoagulant medications.</li>\n</ul>\n#sp-ea-2180 .spcollapsing { height: 0; overflow: hidden; transition-property: height;transition-duration: 300ms;}#sp-ea-2180.sp-easy-accordion&gt;.sp-ea-single {margin-bottom: 10px; border: 1px solid #e2e2e2; }#sp-ea-2180.sp-easy-accordion&gt;.sp-ea-single&gt;.ea-header a {color: #686868;}#sp-ea-2180.sp-easy-accordion&gt;.sp-ea-single&gt;.sp-collapse&gt;.ea-body {background: #fff; color: #444;}#sp-ea-2180.sp-easy-accordion&gt;.sp-ea-single {background: #d4d6d4;}#sp-ea-2180.sp-easy-accordion&gt;.sp-ea-single&gt;.ea-header a .ea-expand-icon { float: left; color: #444;font-size: 16px;}<h3><i></i> Is Nilgiri Gaultheria oil effective for arthritis and joint pain?</h3> <p>Yes, <strong>Nilgiri Gaultheria (Wintergreen) oil</strong> is highly effective for <strong>arthritis, gout, and chronic joint pain</strong>. It contains over 90% <strong>natural methyl salicylate</strong>, which acts as a powerful <strong>analgesic (pain-killer)</strong> and <strong>anti-inflammatory</strong> agent to reduce swelling and improve mobility.</p><h3><i></i> How do I use Gaultheria oil for muscle aches and sports injuries?</h3> <p>To relieve <strong>muscle aches or sports injuries</strong>, always dilute Gaultheria oil in a <strong>1:1 ratio with a carrier oil</strong> like coconut or sesame oil. Massage the blend into the affected area to inhibit prostaglandins and provide <strong>fast-acting topical pain relief</strong>.</p><h3><i></i> Can Gaultheria oil be used for tension headaches?</h3> <p>Yes, it is a potent <strong>natural remedy for headaches</strong>. For quick relief, apply <strong>2 drops of diluted Gaultheria oil</strong> to your temples. Its <strong>numbing properties</strong> help soothe tension and provide a cooling, sedative effect.</p><h3><i></i> What makes Ooty Originals Gaultheria oil better than synthetic versions?</h3> <p>Our oil is <strong>pure, steam-distilled</strong>, and sourced directly from the <strong>Nilgiri hills</strong>, one of the few regions where this rare medicinal herb thrives. Unlike commercial brands, our <strong>authentic wintergreen oil</strong> is not factory-blended with <strong>synthetic methyl salicylate</strong>, ensuring you get the full therapeutic spectrum.</p><h3><i></i> Are there any safety precautions for using Wintergreen oil?</h3> <p>Since it is a high-potency <strong>essential oil</strong>, it is for <strong>external use only</strong>. It should not be used by pregnant women, children under 12, or individuals on <strong>blood-thinning medications</strong>. Always perform a patch test to check for skin sensitivity before full application.</p>','[{\"label\":\"Available types\",\"value\":\"Bottle, Roll-on\"},{\"label\":\"Available sizes\",\"value\":\"10ml, 30ml, 60ml, 100ml, 200ml, 500ml\"},{\"label\":\"Category\",\"value\":\"Essential Oils\"},{\"label\":\"Packed & shipped from\",\"value\":\"Ooty, The Nilgiris\"},{\"label\":\"Price\",\"value\":\"Inclusive of GST\"}]','Wintergreen Oil | Wintermint Oil | Winter Green Oil Price | Gaultheria Oil Gaultheria Oil Winter Green Oil Price Wintergreen Oil Wintermint Oil',110.00,120.00,240,1,0,0,0,'2026-11-10 10:16:05','2026-11-10 10:16:05'),(88,3,NULL,'Assorted Homemade Chocolates 250g','assorted-homemade-chocolates-250g',NULL,'Each bite is a delicious combination of creamy milk chocolate and crunchy nuts, making it the perfect treat for any occasion. Our Assorted Homemade Chocolates are a must-try for all chocolate lovers and a proud addition to our collection of Ooty products.','<p>Indulge in the rich and decadent Assorted Homemade Chocolates with most of the varities mixed, made with love and care in Ooty, India. Our homemade chocolates are crafted with only the finest ingredients, including high quality mix nuts sourced from the lush Nilgiris.</p>','[{\"label\":\"Available weights\",\"value\":\"100g, 250g, 500g\"},{\"label\":\"Category\",\"value\":\"Homemade Chocolates\"},{\"label\":\"Packed & shipped from\",\"value\":\"Ooty, The Nilgiris\"},{\"label\":\"Price\",\"value\":\"Inclusive of GST\"}]',NULL,400.00,440.00,40,1,0,0,0,'2026-11-10 10:16:05','2026-11-16 07:15:11'),(89,3,NULL,'Krispy Dark Homemade Chocolates','krispy-dark-homemade-chocolates',NULL,'Each bite is a delicious combination of dark chocolate and crunchy rice krisps, making it the perfect treat for any occasion. Our Krispy Dark Homemade Chocolates are a must-try for all chocolate lovers and a proud addition to our collection of Ooty products.','<h3><i>Authentic Mountain-Crafted Dark Choco Crunch from the Nilgiris</i></h3>\n<p>Experience the nostalgic magic of India’s favorite chocolate town with <b>Ooty Originals Krispy Rice Dark Homemade Chocolates</b>. Handcrafted at over 2,000 meters above sea level in the misty Nilgiri Hills, this decadent treat brings you the genuine, uncompromised taste of traditional <b>Ooty homemade chocolates</b> delivered fresh to your doorstep.</p>\n<p>We take premium, rich dark cocoa mass and slow-blend it using time-honored mountain tempering techniques. By folding in crisp, golden toasted rice, we’ve created an elevated <b>Ooty choco crunch</b> that perfectly balances sophisticated, bittersweet dark chocolate with a light, airy snap.</p>\n<h3>Why Ooty Originals Stand Out:</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><b>Authentic Ooty Homemade Chocolates:</b> Genuinely made in small batches in the cool climate of Udhagamandalam (Ooty)—no mass-production, no shortcuts.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><b>Pure Cocoa Butter, Zero Compromise:</b> Unlike commercial alternatives that use cheap vegetable oils, our <b>premium dark chocolates</b> are crafted with real cocoa butter for that signature smooth, melt-in-your-mouth texture.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><b>The Ultimate Nilgiri Choco Crunch:</b> Packed generously with high-quality crisped rice that retains its perfect crunch from the first bite to the last.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><b>Preservative-Free &amp; Fresh:</b> Made without harsh chemicals or artificial preservatives. We focus on pure ingredients, ensuring you get the freshest <b>handmade chocolates from Ooty</b>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Product Specifications &amp; Ingredients</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><b>Ingredients:</b> Premium Dark Cocoa Mass, Pure Cocoa Butter, Sugar, Toasted Crisped Rice, Emulsifier (Soy Lecithin), Natural Vanilla Flavor.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><b>Texture &amp; Flavor:</b> Deep, roasted South Indian cocoa notes with a subtle mountain-sweetness and a light, crispy center.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><b>Dietary Info:</b> 100% Vegetarian-friendly. Free from artificial artificial colors and hydrogenated fats.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><b>Shelf Life &amp; Storage:</b> As these are <b>fresh homemade chocolates</b> without artificial preservatives, store them in a cool, dry place (ideally 16–18°C) to maintain perfect tempering and crunch. Avoid immediate refrigeration.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>The Perfect Gift from the Blue Mountains</h3>\n<p>Looking to buy the <b>best Ooty chocolates online</b> for a celebration or a self-care treat? Our Krispy Rice Dark Chocolate box is perfect for:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Authentic festive gifting and premium chocolate gift hampers 🎁</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Pairing with a warm cup of single-estate <b>Nilgiri Tea</b> or a bold espresso ☕</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>A healthier, antioxidant-rich dark chocolate daily indulgence 🍫</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><b>The Ooty Originals Promise:</b> Because our chocolates are truly handmade by artisan chocolatiers in the hills, each piece carries an authentic, rustic look. Skip the supermarket candy aisle and taste a genuine piece of the Blue Mountains.</p>\n<p><i>Order fresh today and enjoy pan-India delivery on the finest <b>Ooty chocolates online</b>!</i></p>','[{\"label\":\"Available weights\",\"value\":\"100g, 250g, 500g\"},{\"label\":\"Category\",\"value\":\"Homemade Chocolates\"},{\"label\":\"Packed & shipped from\",\"value\":\"Ooty, The Nilgiris\"},{\"label\":\"Price\",\"value\":\"Inclusive of GST\"}]',NULL,160.00,190.00,120,1,0,0,0,'2026-11-10 10:16:05','2026-11-10 10:16:05'),(90,4,NULL,'Ooty Wheat Mixed Biscuits – 400g','ooty-wheat-mixed-biscuits-400g',NULL,'Savor the authentic crunch of Ooty Wheat Mixed Biscuits. Crafted in the Nilgiris using premium whole wheat and traditional recipes, these 100% natural treats offer a perfectly balanced sweetness. The ultimate healthy tea-time snack for those seeking the genuine taste of Ooty’s heritage bakeries.','<h2><b>Ooty Wheat Mixed Biscuits – Sweet, Salt and Peanut Biscuits</b></h2>\n<p>Indulge in the nostalgic crunch of <b>Ooty Wheat Mixed Biscuits</b>, a signature delicacy straight from the misty hills of the Nilgiris. Crafted with tradition and health in mind, these biscuits combine the wholesome goodness of premium <b>whole wheat</b> with a delicate touch of sweetness, making them the perfect companion for your evening tea.</p>\n<p>At <b>Ooty Originals</b>, we preserve the age-old baking techniques that have made Ooty’s “varkey” and biscuits famous worldwide. Every bite offers a rustic, melt-in-the-mouth texture that takes you back to the mountain air and heritage bakeries of the Blue Mountains.</p>\n<h3><b>Why Choose Ooty Wheat Mixed Biscuits?</b></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><b>Wholesome Whole Wheat:</b> Made with high-quality wheat flour, offering a fiber-rich alternative to ordinary maida-based snacks.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><b>Authentic Nilgiri Recipe:</b> Sourced and baked using traditional methods to ensure that authentic <b>Ooty bakery</b> flavor.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><b>Perfectly Balanced Sweetness:</b> Just enough sweetness to satisfy your cravings without being overpowering.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><b>100% Natural Ingredients:</b> No artificial preservatives or synthetic flavors—just pure, mountain-inspired goodness.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><b>The Ultimate Tea-Time Snack:</b> Their crisp texture holds up perfectly when dipped in a hot cup of Chai or Coffee.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><b>Product Specifications</b></h3>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Feature</strong></td>\n<td><strong>Details</strong></td>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Main Ingredient</b></td>\n<td>Premium Whole Wheat</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Flavor Profile</b></td>\n<td>Subtly Sweet &amp; Nutty</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Texture</b></td>\n<td>Crunchy, Crumbly, and Fresh</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Origin</b></td>\n<td>Ooty, Nilgiris (Tamil Nadu)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Shelf Life</b></td>\n<td>3 Months (Store in an airtight container)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h3><b>Health Benefits in Every Bite</b></h3>\n<p>Unlike highly processed store-bought cookies, our <b>wheat mixed biscuits</b> are designed for the conscious snacker. Wheat provides essential energy and dietary fiber, helping you stay full and satisfied. It’s a treat you can feel good about sharing with your kids and elders alike.</p>','[{\"label\":\"Net quantity\",\"value\":\"400g\"},{\"label\":\"Category\",\"value\":\"Cookies & Bakes\"},{\"label\":\"Packed & shipped from\",\"value\":\"Ooty, The Nilgiris\"},{\"label\":\"Price\",\"value\":\"Inclusive of GST\"}]','ooty biscuits ooty cookies ooty wheat biscuits',180.00,220.00,40,1,0,0,0,'2026-11-10 10:16:05','2026-11-10 10:16:05'),(91,4,NULL,'Ooty Wheat Peanut Biscuits – 400g','ooty-wheat-peanut-biscuits-400g',NULL,'Savor the authentic crunch of Ooty Wheat Peanut Biscuits. Crafted in the Nilgiris using premium whole wheat and traditional recipes, these 100% natural treats offer a perfectly balanced sweetness. The ultimate healthy tea-time snack for those seeking the genuine taste of Ooty’s heritage bakeries.','<h2><b>Ooty Wheat Peanut Biscuits</b></h2>\n<p>Indulge in the nostalgic crunch of <b>Ooty Wheat Peanut Biscuits</b>, a signature delicacy straight from the misty hills of the Nilgiris. Crafted with tradition and health in mind, these biscuits combine the wholesome goodness of premium <b>whole wheat</b> with a delicate touch of sweetness, making them the perfect companion for your evening tea.</p>\n<p>At <b>Ooty Originals</b>, we preserve the age-old baking techniques that have made Ooty’s “varkey” and biscuits famous worldwide. Every bite offers a rustic, melt-in-the-mouth texture that takes you back to the mountain air and heritage bakeries of the Blue Mountains.</p>\n<h3><b>Why Choose Ooty Wheat Peanut Biscuits?</b></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><b>Wholesome Whole Wheat:</b> Made with high-quality wheat flour, offering a fiber-rich alternative to ordinary maida-based snacks.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><b>Authentic Nilgiri Recipe:</b> Sourced and baked using traditional methods to ensure that authentic <b>Ooty bakery</b> flavor.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><b>Perfectly Balanced Sweetness:</b> Just enough sweetness to satisfy your cravings without being overpowering.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><b>100% Natural Ingredients:</b> No artificial preservatives or synthetic flavors—just pure, mountain-inspired goodness.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><b>The Ultimate Tea-Time Snack:</b> Their crisp texture holds up perfectly when dipped in a hot cup of Chai or Coffee.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><b>Product Specifications</b></h3>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Feature</strong></td>\n<td><strong>Details</strong></td>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Main Ingredient</b></td>\n<td>Premium Whole Wheat</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Flavor Profile</b></td>\n<td>Subtly Sweet &amp; Nutty</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Texture</b></td>\n<td>Crunchy, Crumbly, and Fresh</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Origin</b></td>\n<td>Ooty, Nilgiris (Tamil Nadu)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Shelf Life</b></td>\n<td>3 Months (Store in an airtight container)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h3><b>Health Benefits in Every Bite</b></h3>\n<p>Unlike highly processed store-bought cookies, our <b>wheat peanut biscuits</b> are designed for the conscious snacker. Wheat provides essential energy and dietary fiber, helping you stay full and satisfied. It’s a treat you can feel good about sharing with your kids and elders alike.</p>','[{\"label\":\"Net quantity\",\"value\":\"400g\"},{\"label\":\"Category\",\"value\":\"Cookies & Bakes\"},{\"label\":\"Packed & shipped from\",\"value\":\"Ooty, The Nilgiris\"},{\"label\":\"Price\",\"value\":\"Inclusive of GST\"}]','ooty biscuits ooty cookies ooty wheat biscuits',180.00,220.00,40,1,0,0,0,'2026-11-10 10:16:05','2026-11-10 10:16:05'),(92,11,NULL,'Ooty’s Finest Five Tea Time Hamper','ooty-s-finest-five-tea-time-hamper',NULL,'Experience the magic of the Nilgiris with Ooty’s Finest Five Tea Time Hamper. This curated collection pairs aromatic Cardamom Tea and rich Instant Coffee with iconic, flaky Ooty Varkey, crunchy Wheat Biscuits, and decadent Homemade Chocolates. It’s the ultimate hill-station high tea experience, delivered straight to your cup.','<h2>Ooty’s Finest Five Tea Time Hamper – The Quintessential Taste of the Blue Mountains</h2>\n<p>Bring home the magic of a misty Nilgiri afternoon with <b>Ooty’s Finest Five Tea Time Hamper</b>. This beautifully curated collection brings together the absolute essentials of a classic hill-station high tea—a perfect balance of aromatic local brews, iconic crispy bakes, and rich, melt-in-your-mouth confections.</p>\n<p>Whether you are looking for the perfect gift or wanting to recreate the cozy warmth of an Ooty holiday right at home, these five handpicked treasures offer an authentic taste of the hills in every single bite.</p>\n<h3>What’s Inside:</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><b>Nilgiri Cardamom Tea 200g:</b> Grown in the high-elevation estates of the Nilgiris, this premium black tea is expertly blended with the warm, spicy notes of real cardamom. It’s an aromatic, bracing brew that instantly captures the essence of mountain air.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><b>Instant Coffee Classic 200g:</b> Smooth, rich, and deeply comforting. For those moments when you want a robust, full-bodied cup without the wait, this classic instant blend delivers a perfect wake-up call or a velvety evening pick-me-up.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><b>Ooty Varkey 500g:</b> The legendary, undisputed king of local teatime snacks. Layered, flaky, and beautifully crisp, our traditional varkey is meticulously baked to achieve that signature crust. It is practically made for dipping into a hot cup of tea or coffee.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><b>Ooty Wheat Mixed Biscuits 400g:</b> A rustic, wholesome treat baked with the goodness of wheat. These biscuits offer a delightful, crunchy texture and a subtle, old-school sweetness that pairs effortlessly with your favorite brew.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><b>Assorted Homemade Chocolates 250g:</b> No trip to Ooty is complete without its famous chocolates. Enjoy a handpicked selection of rich, creamy, and decadent homemade chocolates—the ultimate sweet finish to your teatime ritual.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><b>The Perfect Ritual:</b> Brew a hot cup of Cardamom Tea, grab a flaky Ooty Varkey for the perfect dip, and let the rich flavours transport you straight to the quiet, winding lanes of the Nilgiris.</p>','[{\"label\":\"Category\",\"value\":\"Gift Hampers\"},{\"label\":\"Packed & shipped from\",\"value\":\"Ooty, The Nilgiris\"},{\"label\":\"Price\",\"value\":\"Inclusive of GST\"}]',NULL,999.00,1360.00,39,1,1,1,0,'2026-11-10 10:16:05','2026-11-16 09:50:24'),(93,4,NULL,'Ooty Wheat Varkey – 400g','ooty-wheat-varkey-400g',NULL,'Savor the authentic crunch of Ooty Wheat Varkey. Crafted in the Nilgiris using premium whole wheat and traditional recipes, these 100% natural treats offer a perfectly balanced sweetness. The ultimate healthy tea-time snack for those seeking the genuine taste of Ooty’s heritage bakeries.','<h2><b>Ooty Wheat Varkey</b></h2>\n<p>Indulge in the nostalgic crunch of <b>Ooty Wheat Varkey</b>, a signature delicacy straight from the misty hills of the Nilgiris. Crafted with tradition and health in mind, these varkey combine the wholesome goodness of premium <b>whole wheat</b> with a delicate touch of sweetness, making them the perfect companion for your evening tea.</p>\n<p>At <b>Ooty Originals</b>, we preserve the age-old baking techniques that have made Ooty’s “varkey” famous worldwide. Every bite offers a rustic, melt-in-the-mouth texture that takes you back to the mountain air and heritage bakeries of the Blue Mountains.</p>\n<h3><b>Why Choose Ooty Wheat Varkey?</b></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><b>Wholesome Whole Wheat:</b> Made with high-quality wheat flour, offering a fiber-rich alternative to ordinary maida-based snacks.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><b>Authentic Nilgiri Recipe:</b> Sourced and baked using traditional methods to ensure that authentic <b>Ooty bakery</b> flavor.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><b>Perfectly Balanced Sweetness:</b> Just enough sweetness to satisfy your cravings without being overpowering.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><b>100% Natural Ingredients:</b> No artificial preservatives or synthetic flavors—just pure, mountain-inspired goodness.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><b>The Ultimate Tea-Time Snack:</b> Their crisp texture holds up perfectly when dipped in a hot cup of Chai or Coffee.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><b>Product Specifications</b></h3>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Feature</strong></td>\n<td><strong>Details</strong></td>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Main Ingredient</b></td>\n<td>Premium Whole Wheat</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Flavor Profile</b></td>\n<td>Subtly Sweet &amp; Nutty</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Texture</b></td>\n<td>Crunchy, Crumbly, and Fresh</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Origin</b></td>\n<td>Ooty, Nilgiris (Tamil Nadu)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Shelf Life</b></td>\n<td>3 Months (Store in an airtight container)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h3><b>Health Benefits in Every Bite</b></h3>\n<p>Unlike highly processed store-bought cookies, our <b>wheat varkey</b> are designed for the conscious snacker. Wheat provides essential energy and dietary fiber, helping you stay full and satisfied. It’s a treat you can feel good about sharing with your kids and elders alike.</p>','[{\"label\":\"Net quantity\",\"value\":\"400g\"},{\"label\":\"Category\",\"value\":\"Cookies & Bakes\"},{\"label\":\"Packed & shipped from\",\"value\":\"Ooty, The Nilgiris\"},{\"label\":\"Price\",\"value\":\"Inclusive of GST\"}]','ooty varkey ooty wheat varkey',180.00,220.00,40,1,0,0,0,'2026-11-10 10:16:05','2026-11-10 10:16:05'),(94,11,NULL,'Ooty Originals Delights Combo','ooty-originals-delights-combo',NULL,'A handpicked taste of the Nilgiris in one box – fruity jam, sweet homemade chocolates, crispy Varkey and Raw and Pure Nilgiri Honey. Perfect as a gift or a treat for yourself.','<h2>Ooty Originals Delights Combo – The Taste of Nilgiris!</h2>\n<p>Bring home a little bit of the hills with the Ooty Originals Delights Combo – four of our most-loved products, packed together for the full Nilgiri experience.</p>\n<h2>This combo includes:</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Mixed Fruit Jam (300g):</strong> A rich, fruity spread made in small batches, bursting with real fruit and no artificial flavour.</li>\n<li><strong>Assorted Homemade Chocolates (250g):</strong> A mix of our handcrafted chocolates, made the way Ooty households have always made them creamy, indulgent, and made to melt slowly.</li>\n<li><strong>Ooty Varkey (500g):</strong> The iconic Nilgiri biscuit, flaky and buttery, best enjoyed with a hot cup of tea.</li>\n<li><strong>Nilgiri Forest Honey (100g): </strong>Pure, raw honey sourced from the forests of the Nilgiris, unprocessed and naturally sweet.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Whether you’re gifting it to someone who’s never tasted the Nilgiris or treating your own family to a taste of home, this combo brings together everything that makes Ooty Originals special in one box.</p>\n<h2><strong>Why you’ll love it:</strong></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Handpicked bestsellers in one combo</li>\n<li>Great value compared to buying individually</li>\n<li>Perfect for gifting – festivals, housewarmings, or just because</li>\n<li>100% authentic, made in the Nilgiris</li>\n</ul>','[{\"label\":\"Category\",\"value\":\"Gift Hampers\"},{\"label\":\"Packed & shipped from\",\"value\":\"Ooty, The Nilgiris\"},{\"label\":\"Price\",\"value\":\"Inclusive of GST\"}]',NULL,949.00,1010.00,40,1,0,0,1,'2026-11-10 10:16:05','2026-11-10 10:16:05'),(95,1,NULL,'Darmona Premium Dust Tea','darmona-premium-dust-tea',NULL,'The finely graded CTC particles infuse instantly, yielding a deep liquor, captivating aroma, and an invigorating strength that pairs exceptionally well with milk. Hygienically processed directly from our estate to your cup, it is the perfect brisk chai to power your daily routine.','<h2>Darmona Premium Dust Tea</h2>\n<p>For over three generations, Darmona has nurtured the craft of producing high-altitude South Indian teas. Grown in the mist-covered Nilgiri hills, our tea bushes benefit from unique microclimates that yield subtle aromatics and natural strength.</p>\n<p>Darmona Premium Dust Tea is meticulously processed from handpicked leaves into ultra-fine particles, allowing an immediate release of bold flavor and deep amber color. Whether you prefer a morning wake-up call or an evening refreshment, Darmona Dust Tea delivers an authentic estate-to-cup experience defined by consistency, strength, and timeless tradition.</p>\n<h3>Quick Feature:</h3>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Feature</strong></td>\n<td><strong>Details</strong></td>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Tea Type</b></td>\n<td>CTC Dust Tea</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Origin</b></td>\n<td>Nilgiris (Blue Mountains), South India</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Strength</b></td>\n<td>Strong / Full-bodied</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Best Enjoyed</b></td>\n<td>Hot with milk and sweetener</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Available Sizes</b></td>\n<td>250g, 500g</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Brewing Time</b></td>\n<td>2–3 minutes (Simmered/Boiled)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Shipping</b></td>\n<td>Dispatched within 5–7 business days</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>','[{\"label\":\"Available sizes\",\"value\":\"250g, 500g\"},{\"label\":\"Category\",\"value\":\"Nilgiri Teas\"},{\"label\":\"Packed & shipped from\",\"value\":\"Ooty, The Nilgiris\"},{\"label\":\"Price\",\"value\":\"Inclusive of GST\"}]','darmona dust tea nilgiri tea Tea',130.00,NULL,80,1,0,0,0,'2026-11-10 10:16:05','2026-11-10 10:16:05');
